\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 1\plain \f0\super\fs32 rb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Petrus Gaszowiec}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Tabulae aureae motuum corporum caelestium}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . Anfang fehlt. Beginnt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 est primus veri coniunctio saturni ... - ... 1448 completum radix veneris eadem est, cum sole radice lune non indignus, nota si vis habere augustem. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Vgl.\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Markowski, Astronomica, 1990}}\plain \f0\fs24 , S. 181, Nr. 81-84;\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f0\fs24 Richard L. Kremer, "Abbreviating" the Alphonsine tables in Cracow. The "Tabulae Aureae" of Petrus Gaszowiec (1448), Journal for the History of Astronomy 38/3 (2007), S. 283-304, Nr. 132 (jeweils ohne diese Hs.). Abweichender Textbefund bei Markowski, Astronomica, 1990, S. 315.
