\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 , 26\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 , 31\plain \f0\super\fs32 rv\plain \f0\fs24 , 34\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 , 35\plain \f0\super\fs32 rv\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[3].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat18 Glossen zum Jahr 1147}}\plain \f0\fs24 . Zeitgen\u246 \'f6ssisch. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat18 Nota, tempore Heinrici XXVIII archiepiscopi Moguntinensis 1147}}\plain \f0\i\fs24 ... - ... surdus et mutus, claudus. \plain \f0\fs24 Nicht gedruckt.}

