\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 1\plain \f0\super\fs32 ra\plain \f0\fs24 -162\plain \f0\super\fs32 vb\plain \f0\scaps\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Flavius Josephus}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Antiquitates Iudaicae}}\plain \f0\fs24 . Libri I-XII. Version \u955 ? der n\u246 \'f6rdlichen Gruppe. Vorwort fehlt. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Incipit liber primus Iosephi de antiquitate istorie. Capitulum primum: In principium creavit deus c\u281 elum et terram}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... Explicit liber duodecimus hystoriarum Iosephi Iudaice Antiquitatum\plain \f0\fs24 , (62\plain \f0\super\fs32 rb\plain \f0\fs24 ) endet \plain \f0\i\fs24 ut nequaquam cum eis  pugnare debeatis \plain \f0\fs24 (IV 296) , (74\plain \f0\super\fs32 rb\plain \f0\fs24 ) enth\u228 \'e4t \plain \f0\i\fs24 dum nusquam se bibere fateretur\plain \f0\fs24  (V 345), (74\plain \f0\super\fs32 va\plain \f0\fs24 ) enth\u228 \'e4lt \plain \f0\i\fs24 ut hec ei indicaret\plain \f0\fs24  (V 351), (76\plain \f0\super\fs32 rb\plain \f0\fs24 ) enth\u228 \'e4lt \plain \f0\i\fs24 porro Samuhel super eos castra ducens peremit multos eroumque superbiam ad nihilum deduxit. abstulit regionem illam ... prophetavit Samuhel deposito populo eisque reddita civitate in ea eos convenire precepit \plain \f0\fs24 (VI 30), (121\plain \f0\super\fs32 rv\plain \f0\fs24 ) enth\u228 \'e4lt \plain \f0\i\fs24 Illi vero consilium dedit ut oleum venederet et precium creditoribus daret / et ex ipso olei precio rectum \plain \f0\fs24 (!) \plain \f0\i\fs24 quod \plain \f0\fs24 (!) \plain \f0\i\fs24 ait iudicabitis \plain \f0\fs24 (hier der Textbruch)\plain \f0\i\fs24 . Non verba vesani\u281 e locus est. Quibus festinantibus ut ea audirent adque rogantibus \plain \f0\fs24 (IX 50), aber (74\plain \f0\super\fs32 va\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 et sacerdotium Eleazari \plain \f0\fs24 (statt a domo Heli bzw. ad domum Eleazari) \plain \f0\i\fs24 esse migrandum \plain \f0\fs24 (V 350)\plain \f0\i\fs24 . \plain \f0\fs24 Ed. (B\u252 \'fccher I-V): Franz Blatt, The Latin Josephus, Teil 1 (Acta Jutlandica 30/1; Humanities serie 44), \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Aarhus UP\plain \f0\fs24  1958, S. 42 f. (zur Version \u955 ?, ohne diese Hs.).}

