\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 28\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -33\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Theonas Episcopus}}\plain \f0\fs24 :]\plain \f0\scaps\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 De nocturnis illusionibus}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs24 . \plain \f0\fs24 Anfang und Ende fehlen.\plain \f0\i\fs24  Interrogatio cur interdum remissius ieiunantes ... - ... dubias esse propter de eventibus. \plain \f0\fs24 Nach {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Lehmann, Bibliothekskataloge}}\plain \f0\fs24 , S. 345 "ex collacione abbatis Theone et si in eis liceat accedere ad altare". Druck: Johannes Cassianus, De institutis c\u339 \'9cnobiorum. Add. Collationes patrum XXIV, Basel <Johann Amerbach> 1497, Bll. 200\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -205\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 .}

