\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 38\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -153\plain \f0\super\fs32 v \plain \f0\fs24 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Petrus de Alliaco?}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs24 ]: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Missae praeparatio}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs24 .\plain \f0\scaps\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Notandum quod, si quis linguis informaretur}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... cottidie non meretur, post annum accipe. \plain \f0\fs24 Nach {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Lehmann, Bibliothekskataloge}}\plain \f0\fs24 , S. 345 "excerptum de libello qui dicitur Cave (...) Edicio quedam de corpore Christi per dominum Petrum, cardinalem Cameracensem, quondam cancellarium Parisiensem [i.e. Petrus de Alliaco], sed hic est exerptum. / Multa bona puncta de sacramento altaris et de frequentacione misse et utilitate et effectibus etc. multa et pulcra". Zur bisher einzigen Hs. vgl. Ludovico Salembier, Petrus de Alliaco, Lille 1886, S. XLVII (BSB, M\u252 \'fcnchen, Clm 16480, f. 305-317), (136\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Ps.-Albertus Magnus}}\plain \f0\fs24 :] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Imparatio pro communione}}\plain \f0\fs24 . Druck: Johannes Mauburnus, Rosetum exercitiorum spiritualium et sacrarum meditationum in quo habetur materia predicabilis per totius anni circulum, Paris 1510, Alph. XLVIII, L. Dieser Einschub ist ein 'locus classicus' nach Johannes von Paltz, Colifodina, hg. und bearb. von Christoph Burger (Sp\u228 \'e4tmittelalter und Reformation: Texte und Untersuchungen 2), Berlin 1983, S. 99 f., (152\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -153\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[8].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Missa celebrata pro multis}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Utrum quilibet sciens aliqua veritate}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ...\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f0\i\fs24 si ante mortem (dummodo) hostia ipsi (scientes), hoc Gregorius.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Times New Roman;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

