\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 154\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -174\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Quodlibetalia}}\plain \f0\fs24 . Stark an Thomas von Aquin orientiert, daher Erschlie\u223 \'dfung \u252 \'fcber Stichw\u246 \'f6rter im Thomas-Lexikon (TL), betreffen Glaubensbekenntnis und Beichte, (154\plain \f0\super\fs32 rv\plain \f0\fs24 ) De veritate tacita. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Utrum quilibet sciens aliqua veritate vel aliquid esse verum pro quolibet tempore et loco indifferens}}\plain \f0\i\fs24 , obligetur sub pena predicta mortalis eandi veritatem quam mente concepit publicate et expresse confiteri.\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f0\i\fs24 Notandum primo questio: Quantum notant ... - ... et (Eva sue) respondere. \plain \f0\fs24 Nicht mit Meier, Jakob von J\u252 \'fcterbog, 1955, S. 60, Nr. 72 identisch; vgl. auch Mertens, Iacobus Carthusiensis, 1976, S. 283, (154\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -156\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) Preceptum affirmatum obligat, sed non ad semper. \plain \f0\i\fs24 Notandum quod verum exprimere ... - ...\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f0\i\fs24 virtutes ex primo Ethicorum. \plain \f0\fs24 Vgl. TL, S. 621: praeceptum affirmativum, (156\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) De confessione fidei. \plain \f0\i\fs24 Quando est necessaria\plain \f0\fs24 . \plain \f0\i\fs24 Questio premissa per creatas propositiones ... - ... habemus Thomae secunda secunde questio tertia\plain \f0\fs24 , (156\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -157\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) De confessione et confidenti. \plain \f0\i\fs24 Secunda proposicio: Confessor in foro ... - ... deo de depositione manuum res postea reddat. \plain \f0\fs24 Vgl. TL, S. 152: confessio exterior et interior, (157\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -158\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) De veritate in iudiciis. \plain \f0\i\fs24 Necessaria iudex\plain \f0\fs24 . \plain \f0\i\fs24 Tercia proposicio: In iudiciis ... - ... volunt non mendacium dici. \plain \f0\fs24 Vgl. TL, S. 430: iudicium exterius et interius, (158\plain \f0\super\fs32 rv\plain \f0\fs24 ) De sigillo confessionis. \plain \f0\i\fs24 Sequitur quarta proposicio: In nullo casu licitum est ... - ... servetur confessionibus aliis relevare proposicio quinta. \plain \f0\fs24 Vgl. TL, S. 152: confessio exterior et interior, (158\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -160\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) De fidei commissis et non celandis. \plain \f0\i\fs24 VI\plain \f0\i\super\fs32 a\plain \f0\i\fs24  proposicio: Aliquis sciens in secreto sibi commissa ... - ... quod non liceret sibi ea retinere\plain \f0\fs24 .\plain \f0\i\fs24  \plain \f0\fs24 Vgl. TL,\plain \f0\i\fs24  \plain \f0\fs24 S. 304: fides communiter accepta und f. proprie accepta, (160\plain \f0\super\fs32 rv\plain \f0\fs24 )\plain \f0\i\fs24  \plain \f0\fs24 De fidei commissis celandis\plain \f0\i\fs24 . Septima proposicio: Fidei commissa in aliis quam deum \plain \f0\fs24 [!]\plain \f0\i\fs24  est omnis inviolabiliter ... - ... alteri ne fecerit. \plain \f0\fs24 Vgl. TL, S. 304: fides formata s. vivens und fides informis s. mortua, (160\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -161\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) De secretis prelato. \plain \f0\i\fs24 In casu non revelandis\plain \f0\fs24 . \plain \f0\i\fs24 Septima \plain \f0\fs24 (!) \plain \f0\i\fs24 proposicio: Sciens aliquam culpam alterius occulte et revelans eam prelato ... - ... prelatus non possit percipere ut ordo evocandi pervincitur. Hoc Thomas. \plain \f0\fs24 Vgl. TL, S. 327: forum confessionis, (161\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -163\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) De fraterna correctione. \plain \f0\i\fs24 Octava proposicio: Silentio preterire culpam fratris sine correctione fraterna ... - ... ne contenti debet esse fraterna correctione \plain \f0\fs24 (es folgt eine Marginalie). Vgl. TL, S. 192: correctio fraterna, (164\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -166\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) Ordo corrigendis. \plain \f0\i\fs24 Sed ex quodammodo fraterna correctione in precepto ... - ... utique est inclitus. \plain \f0\fs24 Vgl. TL, S. 192: correctio indebita und c. debita, (166\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) De veritate in tractatibus. \plain \f0\i\fs24 Nona proposicio erit: De veritate dicenda ac tacenda ... - ... contra huius formam et contra caritatem.\plain \f0\fs24  Evtl. mit Meier, Jakob von J\u252 \'fcterbog, 1955, S. 60, Nr. 72 identisch; vgl. auch Mertens, Iacobus Carthusiensis, 1976, S. 283, (166\plain \f0\super\fs32 rv\plain \f0\fs24 ) De temporalibus. \plain \f0\i\fs24 Si igitur materia ventilatur De temporalibus et corporalibus ... - ... ad conscienciam aut ad deum aut \plain \f0\fs24 [ad]\plain \f0\i\fs24  proximum. \plain \f0\fs24 Vgl. TL, S. 88: bonum aeternum und bonum temporale, (166\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -167\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) De dampno.\plain \f0\i\fs24  Si non habere tractatus de privacione et destitucione ... - ... nichil attingatum, \plain \f0\fs24 (167\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) De eo quod licite haberi non potest. \plain \f0\i\fs24 (Summa) ventiletur questio: De aliquo acquirendo seu possidendo ... - ... hoc sit in temporalibus sed in spiritualibus, \plain \f0\fs24 (167\plain \f0\super\fs32 rv\plain \f0\fs24 ) De electionibus.\plain \f0\i\fs24  Se vero ventiletur et materia de electionibus ... - ... operam dare, quantum valet, sequitur, \plain \f0\fs24 (167\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) De veritate in privato quesita dicenda vel tacenda.\plain \f0\i\fs24  Item, si quis in privato ... - ... aut iacturam, \plain \f0\fs24 (167\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -168\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) De scandalo.\plain \f0\i\fs24  Sed quod scriptum Gregorius super Ezechielem dicit: Si de veritate scandalum sumitur, utilius permittitur nasci scandalum quam veritas relinquatur ... - ... et confraterna correctione ut dicitur. \plain \f0\fs24 Exzerpt aus: MPL 76, Sp. 842C, (168\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -169\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) De visitacionibus. \plain \f0\i\fs24 Decima proposicio: In visitacionibus presencium religiosorum ... - ... quod nemo dicere debet etc. etc. \plain \f0\fs24 Am unteren Rand Schreibervermerk, (170\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -172\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) De bono zelo.\plain \f0\i\fs24  Bonus zelus est animi fervor ... - ... Helyas prophetas Baal destituerat. \plain \f0\fs24 Exzerpt aus: Zitat MPL 114, Sp. 365B; vgl. 1 Kg 18, 40, (172\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f0\fs24 -174\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) Schreiberkommentar. \plain \f0\i\fs24 Si quis inmortalitem esse invenies, iudicare debet \u8230 \'85\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f0\i\fs24 Qualiter in iudicandi proximorum defectibus fidelis quisque debeat se habere \u8230 \'85 - \u8230 \'85 nolite iudicare ut non iudicemur\plain \f0\fs24 , (174\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) De discretione.\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f0\i\fs24 Augustinus in sermonem contra Manicheos hoc de discrecione dei: Hoc est hominis vita beata et tranquilla, cum omnes motus eius rationi veritatisque consentiunt ... - ... cum ignoscitur penitenti. \plain \f0\fs24 Exzerpt aus: CSEL 91, S. 99, (174\plain \f0\super\fs32 rv\plain \f0\fs24 ) Schreiberkommentar. \plain \f0\i\fs24 Gregorius quadam omne: Vera iusta compassione hec ... - ... ut alios eis corrigamus.}

