\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 184\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Notabilia}}\plain \f0\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 In accusacionibus non sis anxius}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  \u8230 \'85 - ... et non vasces requiem eius. In correctione fraterna \u8230 \'85 - ... Peccata occulta non sunt aliis manifestanda. Idem de hiis plurimis secunda secunde questio 33\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f0\i\fs24  proposiciones. \plain \f0\fs24 Exzerpt aus: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Thomas de Aquino, Secunda\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 secundae\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Summae\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 theologiae\plain \f0\fs24 : a quaestione 1 ad quaestionem 56, cum commentariis Thomae de Vio Caietani (Sancti Thomae Aquinatis doctoris Angelici opera omnia 8), Rom 1895, S. 262-272.}

