\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 185\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 De infirmo}}\plain \f0\fs24 . \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Secuntur, quibus se munire et premonere poterit infirmus cuique ad pacienciam tempore visitacionis (est) vel et aliis<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Bernhardus in meditationibus suis in capitulo inquit: ubi peccata mea emendare debui}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  \u8230 \'85 - ... sarcina sum. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Bloomfield/Guyot, Incipits, 1979}}\plain \f0\fs24 , Nr. 3216; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Sch\u246 \'f6nberger, Repertorium, 1994}}\plain \f0\fs24 , Nr. 12025. Druck: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 MPL}}\plain \f0\fs24  184, Sp. 485-508, bes. Sp. 500D-501B.}

