\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 258\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f0\fs24 -271\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Johannes Gerson}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f0\scaps\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 De celebratione missae}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 .{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17  Dubitatum est apud me}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... hoc est omnis homo. Explicit tractatus bonus de celebracione misse, editus a magistro Iohanne de Gerson sacre theologie professoris studii Parisiensis, summo cancellario preinclito et dignissimo. \plain \f0\fs24 Ed.: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Gerson, \u338 \'8cuvres compl\u232 \'e8tes}}\plain \f0\fs24 , hier Bd. 9, 1973, S. 35-50, Nr. 425, (271\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 )\plain \f0\super\fs32  \plain \f0\fs24 Schreibervermerk\plain \f0\scaps\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Iugo }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 [!]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17  in didascalicon, qui virtutum noticiam et formam vivendi querit }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 [in]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17  sacro eloquio hos libros magis debet legere}}\plain \f0\i\fs24 , qui huius mundi contemptum persuadent et animum ad sui conditoris amorem accendunt rectumque tramitem vivendi docet, ut sunt libri, in quibus litterorum prescriptorum vita et nostrum triumphum describuntur. Et illorum doctorum libri, quorum dictis ad disciplinam nostram (etiam) \plain \f0\fs24 [ad]\plain \f0\i\fs24  statum nostrum pertinencia discimus, ut moralitas beati Gregorii, scripta Bernhardi alterumque doctorum devotorum. C. hec ille. \plain \f0\fs24 Das Zitat aus: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Hugo de Sancto Victore}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Didascalicon de studio legendi}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs24  V 7, \plain \f0\fs24 in: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 MPL}}\plain \f0\fs24  176, Sp. 739D-816C, bes. Sp. 794D. Ed.: Hugo de Sancto Victore, Didascalicon de Studio Legendi. A Critical Text, ed. Charles Henry Buttimer (Studies in Medieval and Renaissance Latin 10), Washington 1939. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Sch\u246 \'f6nberger, Repertorium, 1994}}\plain \f0\fs24 , Nr. 14109 f. Zum Verh\u228 \'e4ltnis Hugos von Sankt Viktor zu Gregor dem Gro\u223 \'dfen und Bernhard von Clairvaux vgl. Hugo von Sankt Viktor, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Didascalicon\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 de\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 studio\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 legendi.\plain \f0\fs24  Studienbuch, \u252 \'fcbers. und eingel. von Thilo Offergeld (Fontes Christiani 27), Freiburg u.a. 1997, S. 39, 66 u.a.}

