\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 (10\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -13\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 )\plain \f0\super\fs32  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Proprium de sanctis}}\plain \f0\fs24 . \plain \f0\i\fs24 >De lectiones et omeliis per annum<. Silvestri. Lectiones ... - ... defendas ab omni malo et perduc me ad >g<audia felicitatis eterne. Amen\plain \f0\fs24 , (11\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) leer, (12\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -13\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) Mariengebete. \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Hee oraciones subsequentes dicuntur quinque dolores beate virginis Marie. Et si quis eas cotidie devote dixerit, dies mortis sui revelabitur per virginem gloriosam, que et sui subveniet anima egrediente de corpore omnio dubio postposito. Ave Maria<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Chevalier, Repertorium, 1892-1921}}\plain \f0\fs24 , Nr. 1783, (12\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -13\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) >\plain \f0\i\fs24 Oratio optima pro bono fide<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 O sanctissima spes omnium in te sperancium, domina et matrona mea, sancta Maria}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... et qui eternam vitam possidere merear. Amen\plain \f0\fs24 , (13\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 )\plain \f0\super\fs32  \plain \f0\fs24 Christoph.\plain \f0\i\fs24  >Ad sanctum Christoferum martirem oracio bona et perutilis<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 O, sancte Christofere, martyris dei preciose, rogate}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... iudicare vivos et mortuos et seculum per ignem. Amen\plain \f0\fs24 , (13\plain \f0\super\fs32 rv\plain \f0\fs24 ) Erasmus. \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Ad sanctum Herasmum<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Qui die dominica oblatus fuisti et de eo letitiam resurrectionis suscepisti}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... sed sit mihi medicina peccatorum atque via perveniendi ad perpetuam salutem. Amen\plain \f0\fs24 , (13\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) Georg. \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Ad sanctum Georgium<.\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Mente tristi orete, deprecor}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... ita me omnibus diebus vite mee defendas ab omni malo et perduc me ad gaudia felicitatis eterne. Amen\plain \f0\fs24 , 
