\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs32\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -23\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs32\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Paulus Wann}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Confessionale}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . Traktat \u252 \'fcber die Haupts\u252 \'fcnden. Mit Kapitel\u252 \'fcberschriften. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 >Confessionale magistri Pauli Wann<.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Primo confessor non ostendat se seriosum aut rigidum ad confitentem}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... - ... maiorem querit, licet talia legere possint, tum forte (unius) (curant) quam simplices. Deo gratias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , (16\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs32\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De penitenciis iniungendis Gerson\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (20\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs32\cf1 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De tribus veritatibus Gersonis quas (videlicet).\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Nicht in: Paul Hupfauer, Ueber\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 den\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 passauischen\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Domherrn\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Paulus\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Wann\plain \f0\fs24 , \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 seine\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Schriften\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 und die\plain \f0\fs24  v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 erschiedenen\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ausgaben\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 derselben.\plain \f0\fs24  Nebst 2 Holzschnitten, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Landshut\plain \f0\fs24  1801, verzeichnet. 24\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24  leer.}

