\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 223\plain \f0\super\fs32 ra\plain \f0\fs24 -223\plain \f0\super\fs32 va\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Ladislaus von Anjou-Durazzo}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Epistola ad Johannem XXIII antipapam}}\plain \f0\fs24 . \plain \f0\i\fs24 Copia litere misse per regem Ladislaus\plain \f0\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Sanctissimo domino Iohanni pape continentis de obedientia data ipsi pape}}\plain \f0\i\fs24 . Sanctissimo in Christi patri et domino domino Iohanni summa dei providentia pape 23 sacrosancte Rome et totius universalis ecclesie dignissimo summo pontifici. Devotissimus servus vester filius, Ladislaus dei gratia Ungarie, Ierusalime, Sicilie, Dalmacie, Croacie, (Kanie), Servie, Galicie, Ladomerie, Commoranie Vulgarieque rex, Provincie, Forcalquio et Pedimontis comes. Humilissima et devotissima recommendatione ... - ... Datum in Castro Novo meo Neapolis per manus mei, predicti regis Ladislai, anno domini M\plain \f0\i\super\fs32 o\plain \f0\i\fs24  CCCC\plain \f0\i\super\fs32 o\plain \f0\i\fs24  duodecimo, die XVI\plain \f0\i\super\fs32 a\plain \f0\i\fs24  mensis octobris, indiccione\plain \f0\fs24  [Ordnungszahl fehlt], \plain \f0\i\fs24 regnorum meorum XXVI\plain \f0\i\super\fs32 to\plain \f0\super\fs32  \plain \f0\fs24 [1412 X 16, Castelnuovo/Neapel]. Erw\u228 \'e4hnung des Briefes: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Alessandro Cutolo,\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Re Ladislao d'Angi\u242 \'f2-Durazzo\plain \f0\fs24 , Mailand 1936, S. 382 mit Anm. 36.}

