\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 225\plain \f0\super\fs32 rv\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Martinus V. papa}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Constitutio Ineffabile sacramentum}}\plain \f0\fs24 . \plain \f0\i\fs24 Martinus episcopus servus servorum dei. Ad perpetuam rei memoriam. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Ineffabile sacramentum}}\plain \f0\i\fs24 , quod sacerdos in eternum Christus dominus instante, quam pro peccatoribus subire valuit sue mortis tempore nobis ... - ... Datum Rome apud Sanctos Apostolos VII kal. Iunii, pontificatus nostri anno duodecimo \plain \f0\fs24 [Zw\u246 \'f6lfaposteln/Rom, 1429 V 26]. \plain \f0\i\fs24 Duplicata de curia. B\plain \f0\fs24 [enedictus]\plain \f0\i\fs24  de Pateo.\plain \f0\fs24  Ed.: Bullarum diplomatum et privilegiorum sanctorum Romanorum pontificum, Bd. 4, Turin 1859, S. 732. Zu Benedictus de Pileo, Scriptor und Abbreviator unter Alexander V., 1418-1422 Secretarius apostolicus, vgl. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Die Bullenregister\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Martin\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 V\plain \f0\fs24 . \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 und\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Eugen\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 IV\plain \f0\fs24 ., hg. von Emil von Ottenthal (Mittheilungen des Instituts f\u252 \'fcr \u246 \'f6sterreichische Geschichtsforschung. Erg\u228 \'e4nzungsheft 3), \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Innsbruck\plain \f0\fs24  1885, S. 74 [474].}

