\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 (9\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -177\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Proprium de tempore}}\plain \f0\fs24 . Teilweise neumiert. Anfang und Initialen fehlen, beginnt \plain \f0\i\fs24 quam voluerint. Dominica secunda de adventu. Statio ad sanctam Crucem. Introitus. Populus Syon, ecce, dominus venerit ad salvandas gentes ... - ... Concede nobis deus, querimus, ut per sacramenta, que sumpsimus, quicquid in nobis vitiosus est, pisius medicationis dono curetur. Per\plain \f0\fs24 , (98\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -103\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 , 112\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -116\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) Ges\u228 \'e4nge der Osternacht, (116\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -117\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) Litanei der Osternacht, (118\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -132\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ), hier (118\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -119\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) Kurze liturgische Anleitung f\u252 \'fcr das Kirchenjahr. \plain \f0\i\fs24 Incipiunt rubrice generales de missali. Adventus domini celebratur, ubicumque dominicus dies venerit inter quinto kalendas decembris et tertio nonas eiusdem mensis ... - ... Aliis temporibus semper cantatur Alleluia\plain \f0\fs24 , (122\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -127\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) Pr\u228 \'e4fationen. Teilweise gesungen, (128\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -129\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) Offertorium. Mit F\u252 \'fcrbitten an die Heiligen Johann, Stefan, Matth\u228 \'e4us, Barnabas, Ignaz, Alexander, Marcellin, Petrus, Felicitas, Perpetua, Agatha, Lucia, Agnes und Cecilia, (129\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -132\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) Communio, teilweise gesungen,}

