\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 (177\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -248\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Proprium de sanctis}}\plain \f0\fs24 . Anfang fehlt. \plain \f0\i\fs24 In vigilia sancti Andree apostoli. Introitus. Dominus secus mari Galilee vidit duos fratres ... - ... Post communionem: Sumptus, domine salutis nostre\plain \f0\fs24 ,}

