\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 68\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -104\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\scaps\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Ps-Augustinus (?)}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Epistolae}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs24 . \plain \f0\fs24 Anfang fehlt. Unterstrichene Adressaten unbekannt. Beginnt\plain \f0\scaps\fs24  \plain \f0\i\fs24 cupisse. Sed melius est dubitare de occultis ... - ... simul, quod absit, cum Iuda damnemur. Pax tecum et ora pro me\plain \f0\fs24 , (68\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Ad Marcellum< \plain \f0\fs24 [Mitadressat Epp. 175,  181 ?, s.u.]\plain \f0\i\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Illi namque in hac vita positi ligandi atque solvendi potestatem habent}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... ut sol et luna parce mihi fili et ora pro me\plain \f0\fs24 , (69\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) >\plain \f0\i\fs24 Ad Bonifatium comitem \plain \f0\fs24 [Adressat Epp. 185, 185A, 189, 220, evtl. 289, nicht Ep. 98, erw\u228 \'e4hnt Ep. 77, Abschn. 2, Ep. 78, Abschn. 2] \plain \f0\i\fs24 de veritate et mendacio et adulatione<. Bonifatio comiti viro clarissimo Augustinus episcopus Iponensis salutem. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Inter c\u230 \'e6tera, qu\u230 \'e6 tibi pro nunc scribo}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... regnum dei non consequemur\plain \f0\fs24 , (71\plain \f0\super\fs32 rv\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Ad Bonifatium comitem< \plain \f0\fs24 [s.o.]\plain \f0\i\fs24 . Venerando meritoque colendo Bonifacio Augustinus Iponensis episcopus salutem. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Arduam rem et difficilem reverentia tua impetravit}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... et misereatur nostri deus noster. Amen\plain \f0\fs24 , (71\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Ad Henodium\plain \f0\fs24 , \plain \f0\i\fs24 utrum\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f0\i\fs24 omnia Christi parabolice dicta facto fuerint vera<. \plain \f0\fs24 [Evodius?, Adressat Ep. 159, Absender Ep. 158, evtl. erw\u228 \'e4hnt Ep. 33, Abschn. 2, Ep. 80, Abschn. 1, und Ep. 217 = MPL 33, Sp. 575D-5786D, Anm.] \plain \f0\i\fs24 Dilligendo \plain \f0\fs24 [!] \plain \f0\i\fs24 fratri et quem diligo in veritate Enodio mihi carissimo Augustinus episcopus salutem. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Recepi litteras tuas, in quibus dubitare videris}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... ideo tanquam iud\u281 eis a domino dicebatur\plain \f0\fs24 , (72\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Ad \plain \f0\i\ul\fs24 Anteletum\plain \f0\i\fs24 <. Augustinus episcopus. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Si iuste vivere qu\u230 \'e6ris, te decet fidelem servum domini tui esse}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... et in periculo simul cum eis s\u230 \'e6pe fuisse arbitror. Vale in Christo. (Hic) Augustinus\plain \f0\fs24 , (73\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Ad Cornelium presbyterum< \plain \f0\fs24 [Adressat Ep. 259, s.u.]\plain \f0\i\fs24 . Cornelio presbytero Augustinus dei et utinam bonus salutem. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Ut nobis per tuas amicabiles litteras declarasti}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... qu\u230 \'e6 nobiscum sunt in Christi nomine constitut\u230 \'e6\plain \f0\fs24 , (74\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Ad Neptarium< \plain \f0\fs24 [Adressat Epp. 91, 104, s.u.].\plain \f0\i\fs24  Domino eximio meritoque honorabili fratri Augustinus Aurelius Iponensis episcopus salutem in caritate non ficta. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Recepi litteras tuas, in quibus dicitur te non intelligere}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... et secum ad bellum gladium deferre, quo percuteret\plain \f0\fs24 , (74\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Ad \plain \f0\i\ul\fs24 Marsilianum\plain \f0\i\fs24  de avaricia<. Nobili viro et potenti Marsiliano Augustinus episcopus salutem \u230 \'e6ternam in Christo. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[7].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Cum nuper multiplicata fuerit gloria domus tue}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... sed servum omnimode desydero te in Christo valere\plain \f0\fs24 , (75\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -76\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Ad \plain \f0\i\ul\fs24 Ciceronem\plain \f0\i\fs24  militem de morte<. Dillecto \plain \f0\fs24 [!] \plain \f0\i\fs24 in Christo diligendo venerabilique militi Ciceroni Augustinus episcopus Iponensis salutem. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[8].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Nunquid ignoras diem mortis esse}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... sed angelorum consortio valeas triumphare\plain \f0\fs24 , (77\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Ad \plain \f0\i\ul\fs24 Cirilum\plain \f0\i\fs24  de solatio huius vit\u230 \'e6<. Dillecto \plain \f0\fs24 [!] \plain \f0\i\fs24 filio carissimo Cirilo Augustinus episcopus salutem. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[9].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Tua caritate devotus mox tuis litteris respondere curavi}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... cui nostra omnia consilia confundere audeamus. Vale\plain \f0\fs24 , (77\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Ad \plain \f0\i\ul\fs24 Fabianum\plain \f0\i\fs24 <. Dillecto \plain \f0\fs24 [!] \plain \f0\i\fs24 filio fabiano Augustinus episcopus salutem. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[10].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Lege frequenter te deprecor affectanti, quomodo paganis philosophis splenduit imago virtutis}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... cum eisdem descendas ad Tartara. Vale et ora pro nobis. Amen\plain \f0\fs24 , (79\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Ad Nepotianum \plain \f0\fs24 [als Presbyter erw\u228 \'e4hnt Ep. 75, Abschn. 3 ?] \plain \f0\i\fs24 comitem de luxuria<. Nepotiano dilecto Augustinus episcopus salutem. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[11].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Accepi litteras tuas, in quibus dicis te luxuriam surgere desyderare}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... porcum pascis in stabulo, qui devorabit. Vale\plain \f0\fs24 , (79\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Ad \plain \f0\i\ul\fs24 Theophranum\plain \f0\i\fs24  philosophum<. Theophrano diligendo Augustinus episcopus salutem. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[12].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Licet sacerdos altissimi appelaris}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  \plain \f0\fs24 [!] \plain \f0\i\fs24 ... - ... recordare h\u230 \'e6c omnia obsecro et in \u230 \'e6ternum non peccabis. Vale, fili, et ora pro nobis\plain \f0\fs24 , (80\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Ad Nembrianum de castigatione corporis< \plain \f0\fs24 [Nebridius?, Adressat Epp. 9, 14, Absender Epp. 10-13]\plain \f0\i\fs24 . Dillecto \plain \f0\fs24 [!] \plain \f0\i\fs24 filio Nembriano Augustinus episcopus salutem. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[13].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Legi, fraternitas, tuas litteras, in quibus dicis velle sobrie, caste et pie in saeculo vivere}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... Salutant te omnes fratres, qui mecum sunt in Christi nomine congregati. Amen\plain \f0\fs24 , (82\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Ad Bonifatium comitem< \plain \f0\fs24 [s.o.]. \plain \f0\i\fs24 Magnifico et illustri viro Bonifacio Augustinus episcopus salutem. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[14].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Legitur frequenter, ut vere te scire tria esse}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... Saluta Theodoram sororem tuam in Christo Iesu domino nostro. Pax tecum in \u230 \'e6ternum et ultra\plain \f0\fs24 , (83\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Ad Cirillum presbyterum< \plain \f0\fs24 [Celere?, Adressat Epp. 56, 57]\plain \f0\i\fs24 . Amando filio, quem diligo in veritate, Cirilio presbytero Augustinus episcopus salutem et benedictionem. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[15].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Querelam grandem de te auditam nunquid tibi celare debeo}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... et eorum divitias omni respueremus. Vale in Christo Iesu\plain \f0\fs24 , (84\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Ad \plain \f0\i\ul\fs24 Fabianum\plain \f0\i\fs24 <. Dillecto \plain \f0\fs24 [!]\plain \f0\i\fs24  in Christo Fabiano Augustinus episcopus salutem. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[16].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Congratulor una tecum}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... ne filius tuus dominando tuus pater efficiatur\plain \f0\fs24 , (84\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -85\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Ad \plain \f0\i\ul\fs24 Brisinam\plain \f0\i\fs24  de obedientia<. Dillecta \plain \f0\fs24 [!] \plain \f0\i\fs24 filia, quam puro corde diligo in veritate, Brisina, Augustinus episcopus salutem et benedictionem. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[17].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Licet famula sis et servula aliorum, tibi tamen propria manu cum affectu scribere non erusbesco}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... Preterea, ut capi non possis, a diabolo aspires, Christum nudum in cruce pendente. Ora pro me peccatore\plain \f0\fs24 , (85\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Ad \plain \f0\i\ul\fs24 Silentianam\plain \f0\i\fs24  de vita activa et contemplativa<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[18].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Si petis a me, filia, quod melior sit, vita activa vel contemplativa}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... Activa enim et contemplativa, si cupimus intrare ad vitam, sunt necessari\u230 \'e6. Vale in Christo\plain \f0\fs24 , (86\plain \f0\super\fs32 rv\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Ad \plain \f0\i\ul\fs24 Aurelianum\plain \f0\i\fs24  comitem< \plain \f0\fs24 [s.u.]\plain \f0\i\fs24 . Comes Aureliane magnifice. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[19].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 An ignoras, quod deus immensus est et sine mensura diligendus est}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... ut revertaris ad ille, qui te et cunctos suo sanguine redemit hec. Augustinus\plain \f0\fs24 , (86\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Ad Valentinum< \plain \f0\fs24 [Adressat Epp. 214, 215]. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[20].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Sapientia divina repleri desyderas astringere te volo humilitatem caram atque perfectam}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... licet post multos erroresi \plain \f0\fs24 [!] \plain \f0\i\fs24 magnam et apparentem potentiam fecerit\plain \f0\fs24 , (87\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Ad \plain \f0\i\ul\fs24 Lazarum\plain \f0\i\fs24  presbyterum<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[21].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Suspiciaris, ut asseris et dubitare videris, quomodo apostolus loquatur, dum dicit: Volo homines esse sicut meipsum}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[21].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17  (1 Cor 7, 7)}}\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f0\i\fs24 ... - ... melius tamen est esse virginem quoniam uxoratum non tamen virginem esse omnibus consulendum et propter fornicationem vitandam. Vale in Christo\plain \f0\fs24 , (88\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Ad \plain \f0\i\ul\fs24 Desyderium\plain \f0\i\fs24  episcopum< \plain \f0\fs24 [s.u.]\plain \f0\i\fs24 . Reverendo domino episcopo Desyderio Augustinus eternam in Christo pacem. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[22].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 An ignoras, quod in hoc mundo non timere, non dolere, non metere}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... Esto igitur patiens, si modica gravaris infirmitate et habebis rectus cor, et infirmitas non ad iudicium, si ad salutem tibi profuerit\plain \f0\fs24 , (90\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Ad \plain \f0\i\ul\fs24 Basilicam\plain \f0\i\fs24  virginem<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[23].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Si petis a me, filia, quomodo sit maius gaudium in c\u230 \'e6lo de peccatore converso}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... qu\u230 \'e6 numquam fructus protulit. Gaude in Christo et ora pro me veterano\plain \f0\fs24 , (90\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Ad Dorotheum de prelatis< \plain \f0\fs24 [Adressat Ep. 284]\plain \f0\i\fs24 . Dillecto \plain \f0\fs24 [!]\plain \f0\i\fs24  filio Dorotheo Augustinus episcopus salutem. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[24].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Cave, ne amore inebriaris terreno, aliquem in cathedram regiminis ponas}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... H\u230 \'e6c enim veraciter serva, si Christo placere desyderas. Ave fili, ora pro me\plain \f0\fs24 , (90\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -91\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 )\plain \f0\i\fs24  >Ad \plain \f0\i\ul\fs24 Leoncinam\plain \f0\i\fs24  filiam de misericordia<. Dillecta \plain \f0\fs24 [!] \plain \f0\i\fs24 filia Leoncina Augustinus episcopus salutem. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[25].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Cum natura hominum satis prompta ad cl\u230 \'e6mentiam sit}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... et esto mater pietate plena et eris ditissima in eterna gloria, requiesce in pace. Amen. Et ora pro me\plain \f0\fs24 , (92\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Ad Neptarium de sacra scriptura< \plain \f0\fs24 (s.o., s.u.). \plain \f0\i\fs24 Dilligendo \plain \f0\fs24 [!]\plain \f0\i\fs24  Neptario Augustinus episcopus salutem. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[26].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Omnia enim, qu\u230 \'e6 scripta sunt, ad nostram doctrinam scripta sunt}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... Elige igitur hanc, quam lignum vit\u230 \'e6 est, et qui eam invenerit, inveniet vitam et hauriet salutem a domino. Vale in eo, Amen\plain \f0\fs24 , (92\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -93\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 )\plain \f0\i\fs24  >Ad Donatum presbyterum, qualiter non licet clerico arma portare< \plain \f0\fs24 [Adressat Ep. 173, nicht aber Epp. 100, 112]. \plain \f0\i\fs24 Dilligendo \plain \f0\fs24 [!]\plain \f0\i\fs24  Donato presbytero Augustinus episcopus salutem. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[27].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Deprecor te in Christo Iesu, ut arma bellicana non assummas}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... Hoc autem tenet mundanorum arma deponere et numquam ea suscipere curaveris, nisi casus mortis, quod deus avertat accidere tibi. Vale, fili, et ora pro nobis\plain \f0\fs24 , (93\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Ad Anastasium de divitiis< \plain \f0\fs24 [Adressat Ep. 145]. \plain \f0\i\fs24 Dillecto \plain \f0\fs24 [!] \plain \f0\i\fs24 et merito diligendo Anastasio Augustinus episcopus salutem. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[28].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Si petis a me, utrum in divitiis permanendo salvari possis, respondeo te}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... Ama igitur paupertatem, qu\u230 \'e6 in fine suam continet humilitatem, qu\u230 \'e6 hominem deo et angelis redit conformare. Vale et deum deprecare pro me\plain \f0\fs24 , (94\plain \f0\super\fs32 rv\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Ad \plain \f0\i\ul\fs24 Aurelianum\plain \f0\i\fs24  de ebrietate> \plain \f0\fs24 [s.o., s.u.]. \plain \f0\i\fs24 Discreto discipulo meritoque venerando Aureliano comiti Augustinus episcopus salutem. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[29].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Quia tuas litteras recepi alacriter, id, quod tenendum sit in principatu, rescribo}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  .... - ... non decet regentem vel principantem vino inebriari. H\u230 \'e6c fac, deprecor, et memento mei. Vale\plain \f0\fs24 , (95\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Ad Desyderium episcopum de pastoribus< \plain \f0\fs24 [s.o.]. \plain \f0\i\fs24 Amando presbytero \plain \f0\i\ul\fs24 Desyderio\plain \f0\i\fs24  Augustinus episcopus salutem. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[30].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Credo iam longo tempore te scire ad principatus eligi non debuit, qui minora officia non didicit gubernare}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... Si navicula regiminis gubernare potentibus minime commitato eo, quod ovile desyderat lupus intrare et oves devorare vult leo. Vale et ora pro me\plain \f0\fs24 , (95\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -96\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >De mercatoribus et foeneratoribus ad Cornelium< \plain \f0\fs24 [s.o., s.u.]. \plain \f0\i\fs24 Dillecto \plain \f0\fs24 [!] \plain \f0\i\fs24 filio in Christo Iesu Cornelio Augustinus episcopus salutem. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[31].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Legi litteras tuas, in quibus dicis beatitudinem \u230 \'e6ternam desyderare}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  .... - ... ut foenerari desistas et cupias magis mendicare ad tempus, quantumcumque divitiis cruciare in \u230 \'e6ternum. Vale in Christo\plain \f0\fs24 , (96\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Ad Iulianum comitem< \plain \f0\fs24 [erw\u228 \'e4hnt in Ep. 24, Abschn. 1, Ep. 99, Abschn. 1, nicht zu verwechseln mit Ep. 93, Abschn. 4, Ep. 101, Abschn. 4, Ep. 105, Abschn. 2, Ep. 207, Abschn. 1, Ep. 224, Abschn. 2, Ep. 225, Abschn. 3, Ep. 280, Abschn. 1]. \plain \f0\i\fs24 Iuliano comiti venerando Augustinus episcopus salutem. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[32].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Opto te scire et in mente te semper portare}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... Nam tenere et non dare, recepisse est. Vale in Christo\plain \f0\fs24 , (96\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Ad clerum et univers\u230 \'e6 plebi ecclesie Iponensis< \plain \f0\fs24 [Adressat Ep. 78, als Absender s.u.]. \plain \f0\i\fs24 Dillectissimis \plain \f0\fs24 [!] \plain \f0\i\fs24 fratribus clero senioribus et univers\u230 \'e6 plebi ecclesi\u230 \'e6 Iponensis, cui servio in dilectione Christi, Augustinus in domino salutem. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[33].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Quam secundum suam misericordiam meremini quampropter inaudita}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... Deponatis igitur omnem immundiciam et omnem abundantiam malicie suscipere in mansuetudinem possitis insitum verbum, quod post salvare animas nostras salutant vos omnes fratres, quos tales inveni, quos desyderavi\plain \f0\fs24 , (97\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Responsio clericorum et seniorum plebis Iponensis<\plain \f0\fs24  [als Adressat s.o.] \plain \f0\i\fs24 Sanctissimo domino et vere omni laude dignissimo Augustino Anastasius Possidonius \plain \f0\fs24 [s.o.]\plain \f0\i\fs24 , Valerius senex  et Neptarius \plain \f0\fs24 [s.o.] \plain \f0\i\fs24 cum clero et plebe ecclesiae Iponensis se omnes cum omni obedientia et completo et consummato opere iniquitatis novissimis diebus. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[34].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Ecce, iam pater mediantibus tuis precibus}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... Exspectamus enim veraciter verum pastorem et patrem veram gloriam in Erusalem et leticia Israel verum ornamentum felici margaritam c\u230 \'e6lestem, veram arcam foederis, columnam et virgam Moisi et respicientes in te tanquam in seculum salvari per te aperte possumus\plain \f0\fs24 , (97\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Ad Cornelium philosophum< \plain \f0\fs24 [s.o.]. \plain \f0\i\fs24 Cornelio presbytero Augustinus episcopus salutem. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[35].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Qualis et quanta sit nostra calamitas et miseria}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... plus gaudebit Lazarus pauperculus et ulceribus plenus, quam omnes mundi sapientes cum eorum astutia et doctrina. Opto te, fili, in Christo semper valere\plain \f0\fs24 , (98\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Ad \plain \f0\i\ul\fs24 Grisarium\plain \f0\i\fs24  militem<. Nobili viro Grisario Augustinus episcopus salutem. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[36].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Cum vit\u230 \'e6 emendationem prophet\u230 \'e6 tui viderunt tibi falsa et stulta}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... Salutant te omnes fratres, qui mecum sunt, et Dorotheam saluta uxorem tuam, qu\u230 \'e6 multum pro tua salute laborarent\plain \f0\fs24 , (98\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Ad \plain \f0\i\ul\fs24 Aurelium\plain \f0\i\fs24  presbyterum< \plain \f0\fs24 [s.o.]. \plain \f0\i\fs24 Dillecto \plain \f0\fs24 [!] \plain \f0\i\fs24 filio, et quem diligo in veritate, Aurelio presbytero Augustinus episcopus Ipponensis salutem. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[37].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Qu\u230 \'e6stiunculam nobis fili nuper per epistolam transmisisti}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... H\u230 \'e6c autem loquere et instanter populo predica. Ora pro me peccatore, fili, vale in Christo Iesu\plain \f0\fs24 , (99\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Ad \plain \f0\i\ul\fs24 Ricardum\plain \f0\i\fs24  presbyterum<. Ricardo presbytero Augustinus episcopus salutem. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[38].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Quia contra nostram voluntatem ad ordinem sacerdotalem sicut lupus intrasti}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... Vale et emenda vitam tuam saecularem deus benignus et misericors dispensator autem eius austerus nullatenus esse debet\plain \f0\fs24 , (99\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -100\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Ad Severum diaconum< \plain \f0\fs24 [Adressat Epp. 62, 63, 110, Absender Ep. 109, s.u.]. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[39].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Temporibus nostris paganus quidam iponierat [!], qui valde foeminas diligebat et diligendo se ipsum despiciebat}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  .... - ... utrumque ideo statuit deus ad perfectionem natur\u230 \'e6. H\u230 \'e6c Augustinus\plain \f0\fs24 , (100\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Ad Marcellum< \plain \f0\fs24 [s.o.]. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[40].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Austeritas indiscreta, in vigiliis et orationibus reprehenda est, quam idolatria committens, servit demonibus moreque Christum negans membrum Sathan\u230 \'e6 efficitur}}\plain \f0\fs24 , (100\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Ad Donatum< \plain \f0\fs24 [Adressat Epp. 100, 112, nicht Ep. 173, s.u.]. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[41].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Sancta ecclesia mater aurum et argentum habere debet, ut sicut  pauperibus et captivis subvenire et ministrare possit}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... Fruamur gloria sognitis, ut voluntas declarata est. Vale\plain \f0\fs24 , (101\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Ad Severum< \plain \f0\fs24 [s.o.]. \plain \f0\i\fs24 Dillecto \plain \f0\fs24 [!] \plain \f0\i\fs24 filio Severo Augustinus episcopus salutem et sapientiam. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[42].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Quis namque, fili, in hac infirma et misera vita sine dilectatione vivere poterit}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... et qui orat cum ira in corde, inducit super se maledictionem et oratio erit in execrabilis\plain \f0\fs24 , (101\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Ad Macedonum< \plain \f0\fs24 [Absender Epp. 152, 154, Adressat Epp. 153, 155, s.u.]. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[43].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Cum dolore mentis et statu corporis abscindenda sunt vulnera}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... Salutant te fratres, qui mecum sunt, confortare et in malis esto robustus\plain \f0\fs24 , (102\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Ad Neptarium de prelatis< \plain \f0\fs24 [s.o.]. \plain \f0\i\fs24 Domino eximio meritoque honorabili fratre Neptario Augustinus Christi famulus salutem.{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[44].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17  Iam senio frigescentibus membris statum tui columnis intimare debueri}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... Plora igitur et consydera, quoniam mors intravit in orbem terrarum. Vale\plain \f0\fs24 , (102\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Ad eundem Donatum< \plain \f0\fs24 [s.o.]. \plain \f0\i\fs24 Dionato \plain \f0\fs24 [!] \plain \f0\i\fs24 presbytero Augustinus famulus Christi et suorum fidelium salutem. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[45].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Si possis imaginari aut cogitare dolorem cordis mei, pro anim\u230 \'e6 me\u230 \'e6 salute}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... non tantum bonis et modestis, sed etiam discolis, sed semper tamen dominica et precepta servando\plain \f0\fs24 , (102\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Ad Macedonium< \plain \f0\fs24 [s.o., s.u.]. \plain \f0\i\fs24 Macedonio dilecto filio in domino \u230 \'e6ternam salutem. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[46].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Hortor namque et moneo, ut tantum pondus super te et familiam tuam ponas, quantum portare potes}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... H\u230 \'e6c loquere famili\u230 \'e6 tu\u230 \'e6 et exhortare in Christo Iesu domino nostro\plain \f0\fs24 , (103\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Epistola Macedonii ad Augustinum de sui commendatione< \plain \f0\fs24 [Absender Epp. 153, 155, Adressat Epp. 152, 154, s.o.]. \plain \f0\i\fs24 Religioso atque in Christi membris sanctissimo, laudabile dei famulo Augustino Macedonius servus ad pedes tu\u230 \'e6 sanctitatis. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[47].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Lectis litteris sanctitatis tu\u230 \'e6, vehementer expavesco et dico}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... ut audivimus et fratres nostri narraverunt nobis. Saluto te, pater clare, ora pro me\plain \f0\fs24 , (103\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Ad Neptarium< \plain \f0\fs24 [s.o.]. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[48].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Cupis namque, fili, scire, quando pernitiosus sit}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... Timendum est igitur, ne sacram scripturam audiendo et vacando, non bona operando, divitias et fallacias eum dolore acquirendo, simul, quod absit, cum Iuda damnemur. Pax tecum et ora pro me. \plain \f0\fs24 Weder in: MPL 33, noch in: Sancti Aurelii Epistolae, ed. Klaus D. Daur,  3 Bde. (CCSL 31A-C), Turnhout 2004, 2005, 2009 (beide ohne diese Hs.). Vgl. aber {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Galynina, Augustinus, 2010}}\plain \f0\fs24 , S. 200; \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Keith Val Sinclair, Descriptive\plain \f0\fs24  C\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 atalogue\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 of\plain \f0\fs24  M\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 edieval\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 and\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Renaissance\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Western\plain \f0\fs24  M\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 anuscripts\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 in\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Australia, Sydney UP\plain \f0\fs24  1969, S. 130-134, Nr. 57 (Hs. aus Oberitalien, u.a. ebenfalls mit der Schreibereigent\u252 \'fcmlichkeit \plain \f0\i\fs24 dillecto\plain \f0\fs24 , 3. Drittel 15. Jh.).  }

