\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 (10\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -19\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Officium}}\plain \f0\fs24 . Mit 12 Lesungen. \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Sequitur officium ecclesiasticum rithmicum decem milium martirum militum, quorum festum XXII\plain \f0\i\super\fs32 a\plain \f0\i\fs24  iunii annua celebratur. Ad vesperas antiphonae<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 In dei potens dextera mundi fallacis prospera turba}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... O quondam felix cetus purpureus, quem decorat sponsus virgineus preelectus ex mille (mireus) rubicundus colore roseus, gloriosus in decimis millibus graciosus assit supplicibus\plain \f0\fs24 ,}

