\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 1\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -48\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermones de sanctis}}\plain \f0\fs24 . Anfang fehlt, Lombarden teilweise nicht ausgef\u252 \'fchrt, beginnt \plain \f0\i\fs24 cendente de celo ornatam auro, sapiente incarnare\plain \f0\fs24 , endet \plain \f0\i\fs24 querite uni Christus etc., ad quam etc.\plain \f0\fs24 , (6\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -7\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Elegit eum ex omni carne }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 [Eccl 45,4]. }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Sicut dicit Bernardus: Si male dictus est, qui facit partem suam detentiorem}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... Qui seminat in carne, de carne metet corruptionem; qui seminat in spiritu, de spiritu metet vitam eternam, ad quam etc. \plain \f0\fs24 (Gal. 6,8; Aug., De vera religione III 4, 15), (9\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -10\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Christo affixus sum cruci. Gal. }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 [2,19].}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17  Navis in mari posita, duobus indiget}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... Quod sciebat ipso, qui sciet me etc. \plain \f0\fs24 48\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24  leer.}

