\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 49\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -138\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Humbertus de Romanis}}\plain \f0\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 De eruditione praedicatorum}}\plain \f0\fs24 .  Vertauschte Reihenfolge des Inhaltsverzeichnisses bzw. der B\u252 \'fccher 1 und 3, Verlust von Buch 2, (49\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -84\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) 3. Buch. \plain \f0\i\fs24 Notandum, quod qualibet dies vite presentis dicitur bona die ... - ... diversitates hominum, quibus predicta sic (assignantur)\plain \f0\fs24 , (84\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -85\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) Inhaltsverzeichnis. \plain \f0\i\fs24 Generales materie sermonum seu collacionum ad omne genus hominum ... - ... ad mulieribus malas\plain \f0\fs24 ,\plain \f0\i\fs24  \plain \f0\fs24 (85\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -138\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) 1. Buch. 79 nummerierte Kapitel mit \u220 \'dcberschriften. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Ad omne genus hominis. Omnis homo est exhortandus, ut caveat a malo}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... Sancta et salubris est cogitacio pro defunctis exhorare \plain \f0\fs24 [!], \plain \f0\i\fs24 ut a peccatis salvantur etc. Explicit liber.\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Kaeppeli, ScriptOP, 1970}}\plain \f0\fs24 , Bd. 2, S. 287 f., Nr. 2013 (ohne diese Hs.); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Sch\u246 \'f6nberger, Repertorium, 1994}}\plain \f0\fs24 , Nr. 14185. Ed.: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Berthier, Humberti de Romanis Opera I-II, 1888}}\plain \f0\fs24  (ND Turin 1956), Bd. 2, S. 373-484. Druck: Bibliotheca Maxima  veterum Patrum, Bd. 25, ed. Marguerin de la Bigne / Philippe Despont, Lyon 1677, Sp. 424-567. Vgl. Simon Tugwell, Humbert of Romans\rquote s Material for Preachers, in: De ore domini (\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Studies in Medieval Culture 27)\plain \f0\fs24 , hg. von Thomas L. Amos, Kalamazoo 1989, S. 105-117. 138\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -139\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24  leer.}

