\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 140\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -162\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Caesarius Arelatensis}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermones}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs24 . \plain \f0\fs24 Neun Briefe, Anfang fehlt, beginnt\plain \f0\i\fs24  Audivimus aliquos ex vobis ad arbores vota reddere, ad fontes orare, auguria diabolica\plain \f0\fs24 , endet\plain \f0\i\fs24  qui inimicis suis mala pro bonis retribuit.\plain \f0\fs24  Nicht zuzuordnen waren (149\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -151\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 Qualiter observandam sit diem dominicam. IIII.\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Ne cesaverit, fratres dilectissimi}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... et in futuro vitam tribuere sempiternam. Qui vivit et regnat\plain \f0\fs24 , (154\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -155\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 Sermo de preceptis per egregium doctorm Augustinum. VII.\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Audite, fratres mei dilectissimi, et auribus percipite mandata}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... que ipse nobis prestare dignemur. Qui cum patre. \plain \f0\fs24 Erw\u228 \'e4hnung: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Augustinus}}\plain \f0\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Praeceptum}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs24 . \plain \f0\fs24 Ed.: La R\u232 \'e8gle de Saint Augustin, ed. Luc Verheijen, Bd. 1, Paris 1967, S. 417-437. Zur \u220 \'dcberlieferung der Briefe vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 CCSL 103}}\plain \f0\fs24 , S. LXXXI-IV (ohne diese Hs.).\plain \f0\i\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 CPL}}\plain \f0\fs24  1008. Ed. (der nachgewiesenen Briefe): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 CCSL}}\plain \f0\fs24  103, S. 233-235, Nr. 53, S. 235-240, Nr. 54, S. 154-161, Nr. 36, S. 114-118, Nr. 26, S. 142-147, Nr. 33, S. 593-595, Nr. 144, S. 195-200, Nr. 44, S. 205-211, Nr. 46. Vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[3].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Galynina, Augustinus, 2010}}\plain \f0\fs24 , S. 158, 200 f.}

