\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 162\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -166\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Adso Dervensis}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 De ortu et tempore antichristi}}\plain \f0\fs24 . \plain \f0\i\fs24 Istoria de antechristo, qualiter nascetur et quomodo nutrietur et de morte eius, per ordinem declaratur. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 De antechristo scire volentes, primo notabitis, quare sic vocatus sit}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... Explicit ystoria de antechristo. Deo gratias. Amen. Amen. Amen. Assit solamen sancti spiritus. Amen. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Stegm\u252 \'fcller, RB}}\plain \f0\fs24 , Bd. 2, S. 15, Nr. 880, 2. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Sch\u246 \'f6nberger, Repertorium, 1994}}\plain \f0\fs24 , Nr. 10072. Edd.: Sibyllinische Texte und Forschungen. Pseudomethodius, Adso und die tiburtinische Sibylle, hg. von Ernst Sackur, Halle 1898, S. 104-113; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 CCCM}}\plain \f0\fs24  45, S. 20-30. Zu den Hss. vgl. ebd., S. 8-19; http://www.tcnj.edu/~chazelle/carindex.htm (18. Juni 2010) (jeweils ohne diese Hs.). 167\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -169\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24  leer. 169\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Deutsches Gebet}}\plain \f0\fs24 . Hand des 15. Jhs., radiert. \plain \f0\i\fs24 Remedium. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 In dem nam dez vaters}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ...  in dem nam dez vaters, dez suns und dez h\plain \f2\i\lang1049\fs22 eiligen geistes + dic tribus (omnibus) super (pariem) (et) (...) vite ea Pater noster et (trici) Ave Maria.}

