\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 204\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -229\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermones de tempore}}\plain \f0\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Cum esset desponsata mater Ihesu Maria Ioseph, antequam convenirent, inventa est in utero hominis }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 [Mt 1,18].}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17  In hiis verbis data nobis beata virgo}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... ut tanti premii nos dignos faciat et participes. Amen\plain \f0\fs24 . Parallelhs.: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Schneyer, Repertorium 1, 1969-1990}}\plain \f0\fs24 , Bd. 9, S. 852, 1 bis S. 858, 76. Mit Auslassungen und leichten Modifikationen, abweichend (229\plain \f0\super\fs32 rv\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >De sancta cruce<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Ego, domine, exaltavi lignum humilem et humiliam signum sublime}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17  [Ez 17,24]. }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 De duobus signis agitur}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... Si compatimur, con reginabimus \plain \f0\fs24 [!]\plain \f0\i\fs24 .}

