\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 229\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -242\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermones de sanctis}}\plain \f0\fs24 . \plain \f0\i\fs24 >De sancto Egidio<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Dedit illi dominus scientiam sanctorum, honestavit illum in laboribus et complevit laboribus illius }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 [Weish 10,10]. }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Sanctus Egidius, cuius hodie solempnitas agitur, in hanc auctoritate commendatur}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... Qui ponam te in filiis tribuam tibi. Qui vivit et regnat per secula. Amen\plain \f0\fs24 , (235\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Sermo de adventu domini<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Egredietur dominus - }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 (Jes 26, 21). }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Nota, quod quinque sunt adventus domini}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... Hanc benedictionem conferat nobis Ihesus Christus. Amen\plain \f0\fs24 , (235\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -236\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >De adventu domini<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Dicite, filie Syon - }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 (Jes 62,11).}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17  In hoc themate non tacetur dictorum prohibitio}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... Venite, benedicti patris mei, quorum nobis dignetur dicere filius dei. Amen. \plain \f0\fs24 Vgl.\plain \f0\i\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Schneyer, Repertorium 1, 1969-1990}}\plain \f0\fs24 , Bd. 9, S. 321, 3-4.}

