\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 1\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -171\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Ambrosius Traversarius}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Chronicon Casinense}}\plain \f0\fs24 . Anfangszeilen der Hauptteile in Auszeichnungsschrift (Capitalis). \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Incipit proemium in historia Cassinensis monasterii<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Domino et patri sanctissimo venerabilis c\u281 enobii Cassinensis abbati Oderisio}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... neque bona sua illis imminueret. >Explicit liber quartus et ultimus historiae monasterii Cassinensis feliciter<\plain \f0\fs24 , (1\plain \f0\super\fs32 rv\plain \f0\fs24 ) leer, (2\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -31\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) Buch 1, (2\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -3\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) Prolog, (3\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -4\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) Inhaltsverzeichnis, (31\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -74\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) Buch 2, (31\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -33\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) Inhaltsverzeichnis, (74\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -112\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) Buch 3, (74\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -75\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) Prolog: Vita et gesta abbatis Desiderii (= Victoris III papae), (75\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -76\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) Inhaltsverzeichnis, (112\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) Epilog: Epitaphium Desiderii, (112\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -171\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) Buch 4, (112\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -113\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) Prolog: Petrus Diaconus: Epistola ad abbatem Raynaldum, (171\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) leer. Vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Repertorium fontium}}\plain \f0\fs24 , Bd. 11, 2007, S. 224.}

