\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f0\fs24 -134\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 )\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Proprium de tempore}}\plain \f0\fs24 . Termine und Liturgiebestimmungen rubriziert. Unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig, (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f0\fs24 -2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) Beginnt \plain \f0\i\fs24 sed vivam et narrabo opera domini. >Completorium<. Dominus Ihesus, postquam cenavit\plain \f0\fs24 , endet \plain \f0\i\fs24 indutus est dominus fortitudinem et precinxit se. Gloria. >Graduale<. Pretiosus for\plain \f0\fs24 , (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f0\fs24 -43\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) Osterkreis. \plain \f0\i\fs24 Resurrexi, et ad huc tecum sum. Alleluya. Posuisti ... - ... Alleluya. >In vigilia ascensionis officium misse et orationes dicuntur de dominica preterita. Introitus ascensionis. Introitus<\plain \f0\fs24 , (43\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f0\fs24 -49\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) Christi Himmelfahrt mit Oktav. \plain \f0\i\fs24 In Galilei, quid admiramini aspitientes \u8230 \'85 - \u8230 \'85 set ut serves eos malo. Alleluya. Alleluya\plain \f0\fs24 , (49\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f0\fs24 -73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) Pfingstkreis. Beginnt mit einer ausf\u252 \'fchrlichen Rubrik. \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Die veneris post octavam ascensionis, si festum non fuerit, missa \plain \f0\fs24 [\u8230 \'85]\plain \f0\i\fs24 < \u8230 \'85 - \u8230 \'85 unde veniat aut quo vadat. Alleluya\plain \f0\fs24 , (73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f0\fs24 -134\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) Jahreskreis. Sonntage (au\u223 \'dfer Trinitatis) gez\u228 \'e4hlt ab Pfingsten. \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Missa de sancta trinitate. Introitus<. Benedicta sit sancta trinitas \u8230 \'85 - \u8230 \'85 >Dominica XX\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f0\i\fs24 IIII post Pentecosten resumitur officium de preterita dominica. Sacerdos dicit: Domini, ego cogito cogitatione pacis<.}

