\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 1\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -171\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Psalterium feriatum}}\plain \f0\fs24 . Pars hiemalis. Teilweise mit Terminangaben in der Kopfzeile, teilweise neumiert. Beginnt \plain \f0\i\fs24 Invitatoria subscripta dicuntur singulis dominicis a secunda dominica post epiphaniam usque ad septugesimam et a kalendis octobris usque ad adventum dominica secunda post epiphaniam. Invitatorium. Venite, exultemus domino, \plain \f0\fs24 bricht mit dem Te Deum ab: \plain \f0\i\fs24 Te martyrum candidatus laudet exercitus. Te per orbem terrarum sancta\plain \f0\fs24 ,\plain \f0\i\fs24  \plain \f0\fs24 (1\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -131\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) Tagespsalmen, (10\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) leer, (10\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -11\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) Drei Neumenbl\u228 \'e4tter mit Initien. Ps 109-112, Lk 1. 46-55 (mit Umstellungen), Hinweis auf Franziskaner. \plain \f0\i\fs24 Ut cognovit re, si previs Seraphei ordinis magi\plain \f0\fs24 [ster?], (133\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -171\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) Psalmen f\u252 \'fcr das Stundengebet. (133\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -157\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 )  Vesper, (157\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -161\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) Laudes, (161\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -164\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) Terz, (164\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -167\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) Sext, (167\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -170\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) Non, (170\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -171\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) Matutin.}

