\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 13\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -24\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermones de tempore}}\plain \f0\fs24 , (13\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -18\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Simile est regnum caelorum homini qui seminaverit bonum semen in agro suo etc. Mt. XIII, }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 [Mt 13,24]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 . Detinebant illum ne discederet ab eis scilicet Galilei }}\plain \f0\i\fs24 ... - ... breviter de parabola dicta sufficiant. \plain \f0\fs24 Parallelhs.: Durham, University Library: MS Cosin V.V.3 Sermones s. xiii ex., f. 3\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -19\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 , nach: http://www.dur.ac.uk/library/asc/theme/medmss/apvv3/, (18\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -19\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Benedictus in filiis Aser sit placens fratribus suis tinguat in oleo pedem suum. Deuteronomio XXXIII }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 [Dt 33,24]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 . Ante grandinem prehibit coruscatio et ante verecundiam prehibit gratia et pro reverentia adest tibi bona gratia. Ecc. XXXII }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 [Eccl 32,14]. }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Iesus filius Sirac in verbo proposito tripliciter nobis insinuat parabolum verbi dei, quod comparatur grandini}}\plain \f0\i\fs24 ... - ... et hoc propter omnium gratiarum plenitudinem\plain \f0\fs24 , (19\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -20\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Acceptus est regi minister intelligens. Verbum istud acceptum est de XV proverbium }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 [Prv 14,35]. }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Ad sancti Ioanni nobis proponit commendationem}}\plain \f0\i\fs24 , in quo quidem commendatur tripliciter ... - ... in ministerio sanctitatis sui divini timoris dicens ergo. etc.\plain \f0\fs24 , (20\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -21\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Item aufertur penam}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... cum dilectissimo familiari suo domino Iesu Christo, qui cum patrem vium ire in se. Amen\plain \f0\fs24 , (21\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -22\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Que est ista, que progreditur quasi aurora consurgens, pulchra ut luna, electa ut sol. Cant. VI }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 [Ct 6,9].}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17  Ex ipsa forma questionis oportet se Salomon ignorare}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... Introduci dicitur exemplum solis eum in virgine Maria. Estote misericordi etc. \plain \f0\fs24 Cf. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Schneyer, Repertorium 1, 1969-1990}}\plain \f0\fs24 , hier Bd. 3, S. 344, 714 und Bd. 7, S. 557, (22\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -24\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Benedicta tu in mulieribus et benedictus fructus, ut verbum istud scribit Lucas 1{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 [,28]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 . Et facit perlatum}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... Elizabeth etc. \plain \f0\fs24 24\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -25\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24  J\u252 \'fcngerer Vermerk.}

