\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 54\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -55\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Bonaventura}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 O crux frutex salveficus}}\plain \f0\fs24 . Bearbeitung I. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 [O]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17  crux frutex salveficus. | Vivo fonte rigatus}}\plain \f0\i\fs24 . | Quem flos exornat fulgidus, | Fructus fecundat gratus. | ... - ... Ad \plain \f0\fs24 [!] \plain \f0\i\fs24 sempiternus status. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 AH}}\plain \f0\fs24  50, S. 561 f., Nr. 381. 54\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24  unten bis 55\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24  V\u228 \'e4terzitate. J\u252 \'fcngerer Vermerk.}

