\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 56\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -74\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 , 75\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -85\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Bonaventura}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Commentarius in quatuor libros sententiarum}}\plain \f0\fs24 . Liber III, (56\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -57\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) Distinctio XXIII, Articulus I, Quaestio V.\plain \f0\i\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Queritur de descriptione fidei ab apostolo assignata, quoniam ipsa inter ceteras est magis autentica}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... sed etiam in ea, que sunt ad finem\plain \f0\fs24 , (57\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -60\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) Articulus II, Quaestiones I-III. \plain \f0\i\fs24 Consequenter queritur de fide informi ... - ... licet eam habeant quodam modo minus perfecte propter suarum mentium obcecationem\plain \f0\fs24 , (60\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -62\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) Articulus II, Dubia I-VI. \plain \f0\i\fs24 Item queritur iuxta hoc de diversitate notificationum ipsius fidei, que a diversis doctoribus assignantur ... - ... per ipsam visionem beatissimam \plain \f0\fs24 [recte: pro ipsa beatissima visione], (62\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -63\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) Distinctio XXIV, Articulus I, Quaestio I. \plain \f0\i\fs24 Queritur utrum fidei obiectum sit circa verum tantum, an fidei possit subesse falsum ... - ... et sic nunquam decipitur nec errat\plain \f0\fs24 , (63\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -64\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) Articulus II, Quaestio II, Dubium IV. \plain \f0\i\fs24 Item queritur de hoc, quod dicit: Quid est deum scire? ... - ... ipsam anagogicam unionem\plain \f0\fs24 , (64\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -69\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) Articulus I, Quaestiones I-III. \plain \f0\i\fs24 Ad intelligentiam autem huius partis ... - ... se habent uniformiter\plain \f0\fs24 , (69\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -70\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) Articulus II, Quaestio I. \plain \f0\i\fs24 Consequenter queritur de profectu fidei secundum diversitate temporum ... - ... privilegium speciale quarundam personarum\plain \f0\fs24 , (70\plain \f0\super\fs32 rv\plain \f0\fs24 ) Quaestio III, Dubium II. \plain \f0\i\fs24 Item queritur de hoc, quod dicit ... - ... inter auctoritates premissas\plain \f0\fs24 , (70\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -71\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) Distinctio XXVI, Articulus II, Quaestio II. \plain \f0\i\fs24 Item queritur de spe per comparationem ad meriti usum ... - ... Alia vero, que obiciuntur, satis sunt manifesta\plain \f0\fs24 , (71\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -72\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) Distincio XXVI, Articulus II, Quaestio IV. \plain \f0\i\fs24 Item queritur de ipsa spe per comparationem ad obiectum ... - ... sed in quantum habeat rationem\plain \f0\fs24 , (72\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -74\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) Dubia V-VI. \plain \f0\i\fs24 Item queritur de hoc, quod dicit: Quibusdam non indocte videtur, fidem et spem in Christo non fuisse ... - ... et ex hiis patent illa dubia, que supra de subiecto spei querebantur\plain \f0\fs24 , (75\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -84\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) Distinctio IX. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Ad intelligentiam huius partis incidit hec questio de oratione Christi}}\plain \f0\i\fs24 , circa quam principaliter queruntur duo ... - ... De hoc autem plenius habetur in IIII\plain \f0\i\super\fs32 o\plain \f0\i\fs24  libro\plain \f0\fs24 , (84\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -85\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) Distinctio VI, Articulum II, Quaestiones II et III. \plain \f0\i\fs24 Queritur de illa unione quantum admodum ... - ... Et sic patet responsio ad omnia quesita.\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Stegm\u252 \'fcller, RS}}\plain \f0\fs24 , hier Bd. 1, S. 56-59, Nr. 111; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Distelbrink, Bonaventurae scripta, 1975}}\plain \f0\fs24 , S. 4-8, Nr. 2 (jeweils ohne diese Hs.). Ed.: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Bonaventura, Opera omnia}}\plain \f0\fs24 , Bd. 3, 1887, S. 483-494, 501-506, 508-511, 534-547, 530 f., 551-553, 571-573, 575-578, 585 f., 199-223, 159-163.}

