\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 87\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -105\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 , 109\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -137\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Nicolaus de Gorran}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Postilla in Iohannem}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs24 .\plain \f0\scaps\fs24 ] \plain \f0\i\fs24 Ieronimus. Litteras nescit, qui sacras ignorat. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Ecce intelliget servus meus}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17  [Is 52,13]}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... recta operatione exercendo, que docuerit, ad dona sempiterna pervenire, quod dicitur ipse promisit, ipse adiuvante, qui vivit et regnat per secula seculorum. Amen. \plain \f0\fs24 Stegm\u252 \'fcller, RB, Bd. 4, S. 41, Nr. 5782 (ohne diese Hs.).}

