\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 105\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -108\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Notiz}}\plain \f0\fs24 . \u220 \'dcber Plagen. \plain \f0\i\fs24 Accipiens VII\plain \f0\i\super\fs32 to(m) \plain \f0\fs24 [septentrionem?]\plain \f0\i\fs24  panes etc. ... - ... Insanabilis fractura tua. Thomas questio ad primum. Pessima plaga. Thomas questio ad secundum. Quod duplex plaga in nullo sanatur. Questio usque hoc. Vivitur de lege communi. Ieronimus. Sana me, domine, sanabor etc.}

