\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 181\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -182\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Notiz}}\plain \f0\fs24 . \u220 \'dcber Reichtum, Armut und Anfechtungen. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Super cathedra Moysi etc. }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 [Mt 23,2; cf. Ps. 61,8]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 . Augustinus dicit: Qui in cathedra Moysi, cui successit cathedra Christi, sederet et mali}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... tamen a cathedra catholica noli descendere. Beatus, qui intelligit super egenum et pauperem insuper Christum \plain \f0\fs24 [Ps 40,2]\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... te divitias eius hic morietur. Filie regum delectaverunt te in honore tue ... - ... sed illi nati. Deus adiutor in tribulationibus, que invenerunt \plain \f0\fs24 [Ps 45,3]\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... adiutor factus est dominus. Non parva pars scientie est scienti ... - ... Quod videt deus (...). Augustinus super Psalmos. Deus, deus meus, respice in me \plain \f0\fs24 [Ps 21,2]\plain \f0\i\fs24 . Passio domini celebratur tempus gemendi est ... - ... dignitate doloris tanti. Io. Christe, spiritu sancto ... - ... in conspectu nostro semper. Idem. Effundite coram illo corda nostra \plain \f0\fs24 [cf. Ps 61,9] \plain \f0\i\fs24 ... - ... ad eum levantes animas vestras. \plain \f0\fs24 Enth\u228 \'e4lt Exzerpte aus: Augustinus, Enarrationes in psalmos. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Stegm\u252 \'fcller, RB}}\plain \f0\fs24 , Bd. 2, S. 138-140, Nr. 1463 (ohne diese Hs.). Druck: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 MPL}}\plain \f0\fs24  36, Sp. 755C, 455A, 515B, 172AB, 756B-757A. Ed.: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 CCSL}}\plain \f0\fs24  38/1, S. 779, 449, 518, 123, CCSL 38/2, S. 780. Vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[3].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Galynina, Augustinus, 2010}}\plain \f0\fs24 , S. 201.}

