\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 92\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -94\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Bernardino d'Asti}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Declarazioni circa il vestire dei cappuccini}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Dichiaratione del regola per fra Bernardino d'Asti, Generale de' Capuccini, intorno al vistire. Alla conservatione della gratia}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... et questo f\u249 \'f9 il (colo) compagno di San Francesco. A laude del Nostro Signor. Amen. \plain \f0\fs24 Ed.:\plain \f0\i\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Bernardino d'Asti, Declarazione circa il vestire, ed. Costanzo Cargnoni, in: I frati cappuccini. Documenti e testimonianze del primo secolo, Bd. 1, Perugia 1988, S. 745-751\plain \f0\fs24 . \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Kommentar zu\plain \f0\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Franciscus Assisias}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Regula non bullata}}\plain \f0\fs24 . Ed.: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Esser, Opuscula des hl. Franziskus, 1976}}\plain \f0\fs24 , S. 373-404. Zum Autor vgl. Leandro Perini, (Art.) Bernardino d'Asti, in: Dizionario biografico degli italiani, Bd. 9, Rom 1967, S. 197 f., 95\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -[96a]\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24  leer.}

