\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 1\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -9\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo de penitentia}}\plain \f0\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Ferculum fecit sibi rex Salomon de lignis Libani, columnas eius fecit argenteas, reclinatorium aureum, ascensum purpureum media caritate constravit propter filias Hierusalem }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 [Ct 3,9-10]. }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Dictum hoc ferculum est ecclesia}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... et spiritu sancto nos feliciter perducat, cuius et regnum et imperium sine fine permaneat in secula seculorum. Amen\plain \f0\fs24 , (4\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -5\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) Handwechsel, (9\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) Kolophon. \u220 \'dcber 8 Zeilen. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Qui scripsit, scribat semper, cum domino vivat}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... Laus tibi fit Christe, quod labor explicit iste.\plain \f0\fs24  \u196 \'c4hnelt Colophons 23201, (9\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Notizen}}\plain \f0\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Ista sunt X precepta. Primum dominum deum}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... X. Non desideras uxorem proximi tui.\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f0\i\fs24 Ista sunt VII vitia generalia. Primum est superbia ... - ... VII. Luxuria.\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f0\i\fs24 Iste sunt VII virtutes. Prima est fides ... - ... VII. Prudentie ...}

