\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 I.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 1\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -48\plain \f0\super\fs32 r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Johannes de Indagine}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 De passione Christi}}\plain \f0\fs24 . Am Anfang unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig. Beginnt {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Iustus periit et nemo est, qui recogitet in corde suo. Ysaie LVII. Dilectissimi in Christo, hodie sancta mater ecclesia peragit diem passionis domini nostri Ihesu Christi}}\plain \f0\fs24 , endet \plain \f0\i\fs24 et regnum eternum possidere, contra nobis parare dignetur Iesus Christus homine pro nobis passus. Amen\plain \f0\fs24 , (1\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) Besitzvermerk, (45\plain \f0\super\fs32 rv\plain \f0\fs24 ) Glossen, darunter \plain \f0\i\fs24 Multa mirabilia signa in sacramento altaris\plain \f0\fs24 , (8-9, 11-13, 15, 17, 19-20, 22-23, 25, 27-28, 31-32, 34, 36-37, 39-40, 42, 44, 46-48) Zusatzbll. mit Notizen, (46\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24  und 48\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) leer. Zu Johannes Hagen als Autor des Traktats vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Klapper, Hagen, Bd. 1, 1960}}\plain \f0\fs24 , S. 47; Dieter Mertens, (Art.) Hagen, Johannes, in: VL\plain \f0\super\fs32 2\plain \f0\fs24 , Bd. 3, Sp. 388-398, bes. Sp. 393 (jeweils nur H74 genannt).}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset1 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs24 49\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 -63\plain \f1\super\fs32 v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Johannes de Indagine}}\plain \f1\scaps\fs24 :\plain \f1\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 De passione Domini}}\plain \f1\scaps\fs24 .\plain \f1\fs24  Der am Stundengebet orientierte Text (f\u252 \'fcr Nacht und Tag jeweils 9 Lesungen) wird um Betrachtungen zum Leiden Christi erg\u228 \'e4nzt, (49\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 -61\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\fs24  \plain \f1\fs24 Kolophon. \plain \f1\i\fs24 >Sermo de passione domini nostri Ihesu Christi<. Incipit sermo meditacionis salutifere passionis domini nostri Ihesu Christi ex diversibus auctoribus scriptum, parti spiritualiter, parti moraliter per quendam studiosum compilatus, et concordantia quatuor\plain \f1\fs24  \plain \f1\i\fs24 ewangelistarum per beatum Bernhardum compilata adiunctus et inscriptus. Et hanc pro legentium devotione et audientium utilitate, quod in die parascenes quasi ex eodem sermone poterit \plain \f1\b\i\fs24 (parari).\plain \f1\i\fs24  Si oportunitas fuerit et quilibet devotus lector salubriter poterit profundissime in ipso meditari, accedat ergo loco theatris huius dulcissime speculationis istud, quod scribitur \plain \f1\fs24 [libris]\plain \f1\i\fs24  Canticarum quatuor: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Egredimini, filie Syon, et videte regem Salomonem in dyademate, quo coronavit eum mater sua in die desponsationis, et in letitia cordis sui. Dicit Augustinus: Omnia, que de Salomone dicuntur a deo, soli Christo proprie et convenienter conveniunt}}\plain \f1\fs24 , endet mit\plain \f1\i\fs24  >Explicit concordantia quatuor evangelistarum cum diversis ceterisque materiis et auctoribus compendiose convenientis et collectis, \plain \f1\fs24 [merito]\plain \f1\i\fs24  devotionis et utilitatis compilatum et conscriptum anno domini \plain \f1\b\i\fs24 (antescripto)\plain \f1\i\fs24  etc.\plain \f1\fs24  Zur Concordantia evangelistarum von Johannes Gerson bei Johann Hagen vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Klapper, Hagen, Bd. 1, 1960}}\plain \f1\fs24 , S. 34, (50\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 -51\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\fs24 >De distinccione parcium passionis domini nostri Ihesu Christi<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Restat, ut diligentissime intueri et prosequi de parcium amarissimam dominice passionis distinccionem}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... ad scribendam partem, harum parcium distinccionis (propter) Iohannes ewangelista dominicam passionis incipit: Dominus egressus etc.\plain \f1\fs24 , (53, 58, 61-63) Zusatzbll. mit Notizen, (63\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 ) leer. Zu Johannes Hagen als Autor des Traktats vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Klapper, Hagen, Bd. 1, 1960}}\plain \f1\fs24 , S. 47 (F 21, H135); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Klapper, Hagen, Bd. 2, 1961}}\plain \f1\fs24 , S. 148 (Entstehung des Traktats im Jahre 1454 in Eisenach).}

