\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 64\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -88\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Michael de Massa}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs24 :] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Meditationes vitae Christi}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs24 . \plain \f0\fs24 Exzerpte\plain \f0\scaps\fs24 . \plain \f0\i\fs24 Iam enim instat, ut ad passionem domini veneratur ... - ... et tandem ad te deum et dominum meum perveniam. Amen\plain \f0\fs24 , (75, 80, 86) Zusatzbll. mit Notizen, (80\plain \f0\super\fs32 rv\plain \f0\fs24 ) Alphabetisches Register. Andere Hand., (66, 68, 73, 81, 84) Zusatzbll., leer. Zumkeller, Manuskripte, 1966, Nr. 692 (ohne diese Hs.). Edd.: Ludolphus de Saxonia, Vita Jesu Christi, ed. Auguste-Clovis Bolard, Louis Marie Rigollot, Jean Carnandet, Paris, Rom 1865 (ND in: Analecta Cartusiana 241, Salzburg 2006); Bonaventura, Opera omnia, ed. Adolphe Charles Peltier, Bd. 12, Paris 1868, S. 511-630.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Times New Roman;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;\red255\green204\blue153;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 89\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -98\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Thomas a Kempis}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 De imitatione Christi libri IV.}}\plain \f0\fs24  Liber II. Rubrizierte \u220 \'dcberschriften sp\u228 \'e4ter erg\u228 \'e4nzt. [Gestr. \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Ex imitacione Christi<\plain \f0\fs24 ]. \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Incipiunt admoniciones ad interna trahentes. Capitulum primum de interna inspiracione<\plain \f0\fs24 .\plain \f0\i\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Regnum dei intra vos, sicut dicit dominus}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... quoniam per multas tribulationes oportet nos intrare in regnum celorum. >Expliciunt admonicione\plain \f0\fs24 s \plain \f0\i\fs24 ad interna trahentes<\plain \f0\fs24 .  Piergiovanni Bonardi, Tiburzio Lupo, L'imitazione di Cristo et il suo autore, Bd. 2, Turin 1964, S. 1-220; Lourdaux/Persoons, Petri Trudonensis catalogus, 1968, S. 203, Nr. 138, 4; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Kaeppeli, ScriptOP, 1970}}\plain \f0\fs24 , S. 219, Nr. 1852; Stephanus Axters, De imitatione Christi, 1971; ders., Bijdrage tot de inventarizering van de Imitatio-handschriften. Addenda et dubia, Nederlands Archiv voor Kerkgeschiedenis 56 (1975), S. 142-158; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[3].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Distelbrink, Bonaventurae scripta, 1975}}\plain \f0\fs24 , S. 112 f., Nr. 89; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Sch\u246 \'f6nberger, Repertorium, 1994}}\plain \f0\fs24 , Nr. 13772 (jeweils ohne diese Hs.). Ed.: Thomas Hermerken a Kampis, Opera omnia, ed. Michael J. Pohl, Bd. 2, Freiburg im Breisgau 1904, S. 59-88, (98\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) Zwei Register, (91, 92-93, 96-97) Zusatzbll. mit Notizen.}

