\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 148\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -150\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Benedictus Papa, XII.}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Bulla Pastor bonus?}}\plain \f0\fs24  Hand von Johannes Hagen. \plain \f0\i\fs24 (...) Benedicti pape de concordia mendicancium cum plebanis ... - ... \plain \f0\fs24 [unleserlich]. M\u246 \'f6gliche Vorlage: Bullarum privilegiorum ac diplomatum Romanorum pontificum amplissima collectio, ed. Hieronymus Mainardi, Bd. 3/2, Rom 1733-1762 (ND Graz 1964), S. 201-203, Nr. 2 (Avignon, 1334 VI 17). Gem\u228 \'e4\u223 \'df Inhaltsverzeichnis I\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24  folgen in der Hs. die Augustinusregel (\plain \f0\i\fs24 Ibidem regula beati Augustini\plain \f0\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 CPL}}\plain \f0\fs24  1839a-b) und die Best\u228 \'e4tigung der Minderbr\u252 \'fcder (\plain \f0\i\fs24 Item confirmacio fratrum minorum per Bonifacium\plain \f0\fs24 ). Gemeint ist wahrscheinlich die Bulle Exiit qui seminat Papst Nikolaus' III. Ed.: Bullarium Franciscanum, hg. von Konrad Eubel, Bd. 5, Rom 1898, S. 232-241.\plain \f0\b\fs24  \plain \f0\fs24 Zu p\u228 \'e4pstlichen Bullen bei Johannes Hagen vgl. Klapper, Hagen, Bd. 1, 1960, S. 35.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Times New Roman;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 151\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -156\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f0\scaps\fs24 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Johannes de Indagine?}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs24 :]\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 De missa conventuali}}\plain \f0\fs24 . \plain \f0\b\fs24  \plain \f0\i\fs24 Venerabili in Christo patri, domino Iohanni priori Carthusis Erfordi. Illuminati in tribus visionis sibi in Christo (...) ad amando missas atque preces ... - ... sa\plain \f0\fs24 [n]\plain \f0\i\fs24 gu\plain \f0\fs24 [in]\plain \f0\i\fs24 is Christi in calice est sacramentum vel specie una sacramenti. \plain \f0\fs24 Vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Klapper, Hagen, Bd. 1, 1960}}\plain \f0\fs24 , S. 43 f.; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Klapper, Hagen, Bd. 2, 1961}}\plain \f0\fs24 , S. 149 f. (Entstehung eines Traktats \u252 \'fcber Messhindernisse im Jahre 1456, wohl in Eisenach). Zu Visionen bei Johannes Hagen ebd., S. 131, 134\plain \f0\i\fs24 .\plain \f0\fs24  156\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24  Notizen. Erw\u228 \'e4hnung (\plain \f0\i\fs24 Augustinus in speculo ecclesie\plain \f0\fs24 ): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Augustinus}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 De moribus ecclesiae catholicae et de moribus Manichaeorum}}\plain \f0\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 CPL }}\plain \f0\fs24 261. Ed.: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[4].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 CSEL}}\plain \f0\fs24  90. Druck: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[3].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 MPL}}\plain \f0\fs24  32, Sp. 1309C-1378B. }

