\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs24 159\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 -168\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Johannes de Indagine}}\plain \f1\scaps\fs24 :  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo de Spiritu Sancto}}\plain \f1\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\fs24 In nomine Jesu Christi. Incipit sermo de spiritu sancto\plain \f1\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Cum autem venerit ... }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 [Jo 16,8].}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17  In Christo dilectissimi, si per circulo anni}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... deducente nos in vitam eternam, qui ... seculorum. Amen. Explicit.\plain \f1\fs24  Der Werktitel folgt  dem Inhaltsverzeichnis I\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24  (\plain \f1\i\fs24 Vide notis. Sermo de spiritu sancto. Iohannes Indagine\plain \f1\fs24 ). Vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Klapper, Hagen, Bd. 1, 1960}}\plain \f1\fs24 , S. 48 (C26, G28, H8, H11, H73); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Klapper, Hagen, Bd. 2, 1961}}\plain \f1\fs24 , S. 89 (Abfassung der Predigt 1468 in Erfurt).}

