\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs24 171\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 -180\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Divisio decretalium, declaratio terminum et regulae iuris}}\plain \f1\scaps\fs24 . \plain \f1\fs24 Der Werktitel folgt dem Inhaltsverzeichnis I\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24  (\plain \f1\i\fs24 Divisio librum decretalium cum declaracionem terminorum similorum librorum, et de modo logendi \plain \f1\fs24 [!] \plain \f1\i\fs24 et abbreviandi in iure 119\plain \f1\fs24 ), (171\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 -172\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\fs24 Divisio decretalium.\plain \f1\fs24  \plain \f1\i\fs24 Primus liber decretalium. Nota ... - ... dampnium pena petante communi verbaque regii etc.\plain \f1\fs24 , (172\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 -175\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Expositio allegationum iuris}}\plain \f1\fs24 .\plain \f1\i\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 [I]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 gnorancia facti, non iuris excusatur. Sic scribitur Extra De regulis iuris, capitulo Ignorantia, libro VI. In hiis verbis breviter tanguntur duo articuli principales}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... corpore iuris civilis et canonici (occurencia) etc. \plain \f1\fs24 Clem. 5. 12. 13. Ed.: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Corpus Iuris Canonici 2, 1880}}\plain \f1\fs24 , Sp. 1122 (2. Paginierung), (175\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 -177\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Declaratio terminum}}\plain \f1\scaps\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\fs24 Termini primi libri decretalium. Constitucio est ius relatum et rescriptio redactum ... - ... ius aliqui facit edificum\plain \f1\fs24 , (177\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 ) Zusatz.\plain \f1\i\fs24  Purgatio est ... - ...\plain \f1\b\fs24  \plain \f1\i\fs24 Scriptum Erfordie anno XXVI\plain \f1\i\super\fs32 o\plain \f1\i\fs24  in octava die epifanie domini hora duodecima etc.\plain \f1\fs24  [Erfurt, 1421 I 13, Mittag oder Sonnenuntergang], (178\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 -179\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[3].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Termini iuris canonici}}\plain \f1\fs24 . Alphabetische Liste. \plain \f1\i\fs24 Ab. Abbas, qui aliquociens per Wylhelmo de Monte Lauduno allegatur etc. ... - ... Verborum. Ven. Ventre. etc.\plain \f1\fs24 , 180\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Bonifatius Papa, VIII.}}\plain \f1\scaps\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[4].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 De Regulis Iuris}}\plain \f1\fs24 . Clemen. 5. 12. 1-35\plain \f1\scaps\fs24 . \plain \f1\fs24 Ed.: Corpus Iuris Canonici 2, 1880, Sp. 1122-1124 (2. Paginierung). Zu den kanonistischen Kenntnissen von Johannes Hagen vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Klapper, Hagen, Bd. 1, 1960}}\plain \f1\fs24 , S. 35.}

