\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 216\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -230\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Simon Favershamensis}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs24 :] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Quaestiones super librum Praedicamentorum}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs24 . \plain \f0\fs24 19 Quaestiones, nur die 6. Quaestio (220\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) und die 13. Quaestio (224\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) mit Titel und Nummer. Anfang und Ende fehlen. Beginnt {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 [Q]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 >ueritur primo circa librum predicamentorum<. Circa librum predicamentorum queritur, utrum in diffiniciones equivocorum et univocorum date in predicamentis sive bone [!] diffinicio equivocorum ista equivoca sunt}}\plain \f0\fs24 , bricht ab \plain \f0\i\fs24 Sequitur questio vicesima. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Lohr, Commentaries, 1973}}\plain \f0\fs24 , S. 142, Nr. 2. Edd.: Carmelio Ottaviano, Le "Quaestiones super libro Praedicamentorum" di Simone di Faversham, Atti della Reale Accademia Nazionale dei Lincei, Series VI: Memorie della Classe di Scienze morali, storiche et filologiche 3 (1930), S. 257-351, hier S. 263-334; Magistri Simonis Anglici sive de Faverisham Opera logica, Bd. 1, ed. Pasquale Mazarella (Opera omina 1/1 = Pubblicazioni dell' Istituto universatario di Magistero di Catania, serie filosofica: testi critici 1), Padua 1957 (bibliographisch nicht bisher nachweisbar).}

