\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs24 249\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 -273\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Petrus Dresdensis?}}\plain \f1\scaps\fs24 :] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Parvulus philosophiae naturalis cum glossis}}\plain \f1\scaps\fs24 .\plain \f1\scaps\fs24  \plain \f1\i\fs24 Parvulus huic operi sit gratia (...) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Ex quo parvulus tractatulus et philosophi capitulum tunc videndi, quid sit philosophia}}\plain \f1\i\fs24 , diffinitur: Primo notandum, quod philosophia secundum Hugonem sit ... - ... a quo fit abstraccio deo autem nichil est simplicius. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Et sic est finis huius, laudetur deus et sanctus Bartholomeus. Et sic est finis huic parvuli philosophie anno domini millesimo quadrigentesimo quinquagesimo proxima sexta feria ante festum Georgii hora quasi quinta }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 [1450 IV 17]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17  in stuba venerabilis viri magistri Iohannis (Ewdernis) necnon theoloie baccalari, protunc informator meus preclarissimus. Deo gracias. Amen}}\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , (249\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs32\cf1 r\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -250\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs32\cf1 v\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Einleitung, \plain \f1\fs24 (249\plain \f1\super\fs32 rv\plain \f1\fs24 ) Text, (250\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 -273v) Grundtext mit Interlinearglossen unterlegt, (250\plain \f1\super\fs32 rv\plain \f1\fs24 ) Randglossen, (250\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\fs24 Natura est principium et causa movendi et quiescendi.\plain \f1\fs24  Zitat aus: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[3].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Nicolaus Oresmius}}\plain \f1\scaps\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Commentarius in physicam Aristotelis}}\plain \f1\fs24 . 2. Buch. Quaestio II. 3. Vgl. Stefan Kirschner, Nicolaus Oresmes Kommentar zur Physik des Aristoteles (Sudhoffs Archiv. Beihefte 39), Stuttgart 1997, S. 462 (Quaestionenverzeichnis). Zwei Kolophone (vgl. auch Schlusskolophone): (260\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Et hic est finis illius libri primi. Anno domini Mo CCCCo quinquagesimo proxima quinta feria ante dominicam Invocavit per me Iohannem Selmenicium in Lipzick}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  \plain \f1\fs24 [1450 II 20, Leipzig], (264\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Et hic est finis istius tractatus secundi anno domini Mo CCCCo quinquagesimo proxima sexta feria post festum pasche}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  \plain \f1\fs24 [1450 IV 17]. Teilausgaben\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : Studium\plain \f1\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Upsalense. Specimens\plain \f1\fs24  of the O\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ldest\plain \f1\fs24  L\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ecture\plain \f1\fs24  N\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\cf1 otes\plain \f1\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\cf1 taken\plain \f1\fs24  in the M\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\cf1 edieval\plain \f1\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\cf1 University\plain \f1\fs24  of \plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Uppsala, ed.\plain \f1\fs24  Anders Piltz (Skrifter utgivna till Uppsala Universitets 500-\u229 \'e5rsjubileum 1, 2; Acta Universitatis Upsaliensis C, 36)\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ,\plain \f1\fs24  Upsala 1977, S. 293-296; Sebastian Lalla, Secundum viam modernam. Ontologischer Nominalismus bei Bartholom\u228 \'e4us Arnoldi von Usingen (Epistemata. Reihe Philosophie 343), W\u252 \'fcrzburg 2003, S. 392-401. Zum Autor ebd., S. 77-83. Vgl. Josef Tr\u237 \'edska, Studie a prameny k r\u233 \'e9torice a k universitn\u237 \'ed literature [Quellen zur Rhetorik und zur Universit\u228 \'e4tsliteratur] (Pr\u225 \'e1ce z dejin University Karlovy, Sv. 9), Prag 1972, S. 218; K. W\u243 \'f3jcik, Anonimowy wst\u281 ep\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\fs24 do Compendium logica Piotra ze Zgorzelca [Eine anonyme Einleitung zum Kompendium der Logik des Petrus von G\u246 \'f6rlitz], Roczniki filosoficzne KUL 16 (1968), S. 139-146.}

