\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 V. und IX.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 55\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -69\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 , 162\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -182\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Giordano Bruno}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Artifiosa methodus medicinae}}\plain \f0\fs24 , (55\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -69\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 Medicina Lulliana, partim ex mathematicis, partim ex physicis principiis educta. Fideliter collecta per nos, nihilo pr\u230 \'e6ter et extra intentionem adducto, addito neque diminuto. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Intentio noster est non tam vulgari more principia medicin\u230 \'e6, qui praxi proxima sunt, adducere}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... verumtamen percussio B\plain \f0\i\super\fs32 e\plain \f0\i\fs24  est acutior quam percussio ipsius A. \plain \f0\fs24 Exzerpt aus:\plain \f0\i\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Raimundus Lullus}}\plain \f0\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 De principiorum medicinae}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs24 . \plain \f0\fs24 Edd.: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Bruno, Opera, Bd. 3, 1891}}\plain \f0\fs24 , S. 569-616, 616-619; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 \u1047 ?\u1091 ?\u1073 ?\u1086 ?\u1074 ?, \u1056 ?\u1091 ?\u1082 ?\u1086 ?\u1087 ?\u1080 ?\u1089 ?\u1085 ?\u1086 ?\u1077 ? \u1085 ?\u1072 ?\u1089 ?\u1083 ?\u1077 ?\u1076 ?\u1080 ?\u1077 ?, 1950}}\plain \f0\fs24 , S. 173 f., (57\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) Schema der vier Elemente, 24 Stunden, 12 Monate, 12 Tierkreiszeichen, vier Grundeigenschaften und vier Jahreszeiten, (69a\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -68b\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) leer, (162\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -182\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Artificiosa methodus medicin\u230 \'e6 ex Lullianis fragmentis}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ...qu\u230 \'e6 ars sine scientia thesaurus pauperum vere erit\plain \f0\fs24 , (166\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) Schema der Himmelsrichtungen, Tages- und Nachtstunden, Monate, Tierkreiszeichen und Jahreszeiten, (180\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) Rezept, (180\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) leer, (182\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) Schema der 24 Stunden und der vier Elemente. Unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig, (182\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) leer.}

