\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 VII.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 87\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -98\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Giordano Bruno}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs24 : \plain \f0\scaps\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 De vinculis in genere}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs24 . \plain \f0\fs24 2. Redaktion.\plain \f0\scaps\fs24  \plain \f0\i\fs24 Jordani Bruni Nolani. De vinculis in genere. Ut eum, qui vincere debet, necessarium est rerum quoddammodo universalem rationem habere ... - ... Si amans amat\u230 \'e6 minus blanditur, queritur h\u230 \'e6c quasi eam, ille curet minus, queritur amans versus amatam si.\plain \f0\fs24  Ed.: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Bruno, Opera, Bd. 3, 1891}}\plain \f0\fs24 , S. 653-700; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Bruno, De magia. De vinculis in genere, 1986}}\plain \f0\fs24 , S. 109-211. 98\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24  leer.}

