\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 VIII. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 99\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -160\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Giordano Bruno}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Lampas triginta statuarum}}\plain \f0\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Anim\u230 \'e6 cibum esse veritatem}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... adeo ut ultimum\u230 \'e6ternorum omnium complexionem includere videatur.\plain \f0\fs24  Ed.: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Bruno, Opera, Bd. 3, 1891}}\plain \f0\fs24 , S. 1-258, (160\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) Kolophon. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Itaque gratias deo agentes. Artem inventivam per 30 statuas perficimus. Reliquum est, ut quo quisque, prout credit, posse ex istius summe bonum, meliorem vel optimum fructum comparare. Bene, melius vel optime in istis assuescat. Multum enim confert in bonam non solum incurrisse disciplinam, et a bono lumine, sed illud pr\u230 \'e6cipuum esse videtur, ut aliquis, quod habet, fidat se habere. Et iuxta fidem excolat agrum et iugi - meditatione rerum iugans agrum ingenii - propria iniecta semina adolescere faciat, incrementum sumat, et fructus suo tempore pr\u230 \'e6stoletur. Infidi vero et desperantes, quos neque numina posse curare testantur, ocio et torpere et innata desideria, talentum suffodiunt et legetem moribus corrodendam pr\u230 \'e6termittunt. }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\ul\fs24\chcbpat17 F}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 initur anno 1591, }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\ul\fs24\chcbpat17 I}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 n mense octobri, }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\ul\fs24\chcbpat17 N}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 octe die 22 \u9794 ?, }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\ul\fs24\chcbpat17 I}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 n Padu\u230 \'e6 }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\ul\fs24\chcbpat17 S}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 criptus}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  \plain \f0\fs24 [1591 X 22, Padua; Buchstaben des Chronogramms nachtr\u228 \'e4glich unterstrichen]. 160\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -160b\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24  leer. 160b\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24  Tabelle (leer). 24 Zeilen, 15 Spalten. Nummeriert (1-22 bzw. 1-13).}

