\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 V
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 14\plain \f0\super\fs32 rv\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Johannes Bugenhagen}}\plain \f0\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Brief}}\plain \f0\fs24  an {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Martin Luther}}\plain \f0\fs24  (Braunschweig, 1528 VII 22). {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Gratiam dei per Christum. Hodie Abbas noster incolumis hoc pervenit}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... Vale cum uxore dilecta et filiis. Ex B\plain \f0\fs24 [runswiga]\plain \f0\i\fs24  Magdalen\u230 \'e6 MDXXVIII. J.B. Pomeranus\plain \f0\fs24 , (14\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) Briefadresse. \plain \f0\i\fs24 Doctissimo doctori Martino Luthero, patri meo. D. Pomeranus.\plain \f0\fs24  Ed.: D. Martin Luthers Werke. Kritische Gesamtausgabe [Abt. 4]: Briefwechsel, Bd. 4, Weimar 1933, S. 502 f., Nr. 1297 (nach dieser Hs.).}

