\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 VI
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 15\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -16\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Matthias Flacius Illyricus}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs24 :\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Brief}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs24  \plain \f0\fs24 an Unbekannten. Gegen die Aufnahme des Waldenser-Ritus in den evangelischen Kult (Magdeburg, 1555 III 31). {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Salutem a domino Iesu unico omnium piorum servatore. Quod de Waldensibus scribis, eorum c\u230 \'e6remonias vestris ecclesiis}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... admonitionis ferre. Magdeb\plain \f0\fs24 [urgensi] \plain \f0\i\fs24 pridi\u230 \'e6 Calend. Aprilis 1556. T. Illyricus. \plain \f0\fs24 Zu den Waldensern als vorgeblichen Protoreformatoren vgl. aber Mathias Flacius Illyricus, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Catalogus\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 testium\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Veritatis\plain \f0\fs24 , \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Qui\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ante\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 nostram\plain \f0\fs24  ae\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 tatem\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 reclamarunt\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Pap\u230 \'e6\plain \f0\fs24 . \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Opus\plain \f0\fs24  v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 aria\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rerum\plain \f0\fs24 , \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 hoc\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 praesertim\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 tempore\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 scitu\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 dignissimarum\plain \f0\fs24 , \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 cognitione\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 refertum\plain \f0\fs24 , \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ac\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 lectu\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 cum\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 primus\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 utile\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 atq\plain \f0\fs24 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ue\plain \f0\fs24 ] \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 necessarium, Basel \plain \f0\fs24 1556, S. 704-761.}

