\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 XI
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 22\plain \f0\super\fs32 rv\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Petrus Lotichius}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Carmen}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs24  ad Dr. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Mathiam Stoium}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs24 , Professorem medicinae in academia Regiomontana\plain \f0\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Amico suo carissimo et fratri suasissimo, domino Mathia Stoio (Doctore) Borusso. Stoi Pieridum datus lororum. | Stoi Lorchii dator satudi}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... carmina paula earum (in) pectore inspirato. Datis \plain \f0\fs24 [15]\plain \f0\i\fs24 49. Lotichius. \plain \f0\fs24 Nicht in: Petrus Lotichius, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Poemata\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 omnia\plain \f0\fs24 . Notis et praef. instruxit Petrus Burmannus, 2 Teile, Amsterdam 1754 (ND Hildesheim u.a. 1998), enthalten. Vgl. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Petrus\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Lotichius, Poemata, q\plain \f0\fs24 uae exstant omnia, selectis Petri Burmanni Secundi Hoogstratani et Christiani Friderici Quellii, Notis illustrata recensuit praefatus est notasque suas et indicem adiecit Carolus Traugott Kretzschmar, Dresden 1773. }

