\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 XIII
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 25\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -26\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Johann Wigand}}\plain \f0\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Brief}}\plain \f0\fs24 . Als Bischof von Pomesanien bezeugt Wigand die Rechtgl\u228 \'e4ubigkeit von {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Georg Junghenel}}\plain \f0\fs24 , Prediger in Bartenstein, und empfiehlt ihm Mathias Copos als Diakon (K\u246 \'f6nigsberg, 1577 IX 5). \plain \f0\i\fs24 Episcopale Testimonium Copo. 5. Sept. 1577. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 S}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 [alutem]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17  in Christo. Reverende domine pastor, monstravit mihi M. Morgenstern tuas litteras de saccellario}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... Bene vale. Regiomontis Septembr. Anno Domini 1577\plain \f0\fs24 , (26\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) leer, (26\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) Briefadresse.\plain \f0\i\fs24  Reverendo viri domino Georgio Junghenelin Pastori Bartensteinsi, suo amico. Johannes  Wigandus Episcopus Pomezanensis et Administrator Sambiensis. \plain \f0\fs24 Druck: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Acta\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Borussica\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ecclesiastica\plain \f0\fs24 , \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 civilia\plain \f0\fs24 , \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 literaria\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 oder\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 sorgf\u228 \'e4ltige\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sammlung\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 allerhand\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 zur\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Geschichte\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 des\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Landes\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Preussen\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 geh\u246 \'f6riger\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Nachrichten\plain \f0\fs24 , \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Uhrkunden\plain \f0\fs24 , \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Schrifften\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 und\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Documenten, Bd. 2, K\u246 \'f6nigsberg,\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Leipzig 1731, S. 462 f.}

