\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 (82\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -100\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Mariengebete}}\plain \f0\fs24 , (82\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -83\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Prophezeiung}}\plain \f0\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Incipit oracio valde devota ad postulandum sanctissime virginis Marie}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... Dic sororibus tuis, sicut vidisti et audisti\plain \f0\fs24 , (83\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -87\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 )  Ed.: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Leroquais, Les livres d'heures. Manuscrits}}\plain \f0\fs24 , Bd. 2, S. 336 f., Nr. XXI (maskuline Form, erg\u228 \'e4nzt um die Initiale \plain \f0\i\fs24 S.\plain \f0\fs24 ), (87\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -88\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Deus, qui beatissimam virginem Mariam in conceptu}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... Per Christum dominum nostrum. \plain \f0\fs24 Vgl. Leroquais, Les livres d'heures. Manuscrits, Bd. 1, S. 54, (88\plain \f0\super\fs32 rv\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Ave Maria, virgo concipiens}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... deus et homo sit semper dulcis Ihesus. Amen\plain \f0\fs24 , (88\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -89\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 O domina glorie, o regina leticie}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... et regnat in secula seculorum. Amen. \plain \f0\fs24 Vgl. Leroquais, Les livres d'heures. Manuscrits, Bd. 1, S. 43, (89\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -91\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) Ed.: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Leroquais, Les livres d'heures. Manuscrits}}\plain \f0\fs24 , Bd. 2, S. 346 f., Nr. XXXVIII (maskuline Form), (91\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -92\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Gaude, mater, virgo Christi}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... nobis detur frui perhenni gaudio\plain \f0\fs24 . Vgl. Leroquais, Les livres d'heures. Manuscrits, Bd. 1, S. 319, (93\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -96\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Gratiam tuam, quesumus, domine}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... et merear videre filium dei et leticiam sine fine habere. Amen\plain \f0\fs24 , (96\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -97\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Domina dulcissima prima, ornamentum celi}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... tuo adiutorio, virgo dei genitrix Maria. Amen\plain \f0\fs24 , (97\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -100\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 )\plain \f0\i\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[7].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Obsecro te, }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[7].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 [domina]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[7].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17  mater domini nostri Ihesu Christi, per illud gaudium}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... et exaudi preces famuli tui. Amen. Ihesus autem transiens per medium illorum ibat\plain \f0\fs24 . Vgl. Leroquais, Les livres d'heures. Manuscrits, Bd. 1, S. 233,}

