\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 (101\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -106\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Officium de Sancta Trinitate}}\plain \f0\fs24 . Zu jeder Tagzeit ein Hymnus, eine Versikel, ein Responsorium und ein Gebet. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Incipit officium sanctissime trinitatis. Ad matutinam. Pater noster. Domine, labia mea}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... Per Christum dominum nostrum. Amen. Explicit officium sanctissime trinitatis\plain \f0\fs24 , (101\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 , 102\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 , 103\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 , 103\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Chevalier, Repertorium, 1892-1921}}\plain \f0\fs24 , Nr. 16566. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 AH}}\plain \f0\fs24  30, S. 9, Nr. 1 (1., 2., 6. und 3. Strophe),\plain \f0\i\fs24  \plain \f0\fs24 (104\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 Trinitate filius patri incarnatus ... - ... con \plain \f0\fs24 [!] \plain \f0\i\fs24 patre et spiritu conglorificatus\plain \f0\fs24 , (104\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -105\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 , 105\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Chevalier, Repertorium, 1892-1921}}\plain \f0\fs24 , Nr. 16566. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[3].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 AH}}\plain \f0\fs24  30, S. 9, Nr. 1 (7. und 8. Strophe), (105\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f0\fs24 -106\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Gebet}}\plain \f0\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Laudes et gratias tibi ago}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... dignare me, laudare te in secula seculorum. Amen\plain \f0\fs24 , (106\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r \plain \f0\fs24 ) Gebet. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Tibi me trado, tibi me commendo}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... ad vitam eternam perducas. Per Christum dominum nostrum. Amen\plain \f0\fs24 . Es folgt eine Rubrik, }

