\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 (111\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -146\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Bonaventura}}\plain \f0\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Officium de Passione Domini}}\plain \f0\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Incipit gloriossime passionis domini nostri Ihesu Christi, quod composuit venerabilis pater, frater Bonaventura cardinalis de Balneo Regio et de ordine minorum}}\plain \f0\i\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Domine, labia mea aperies}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ...  Explicit officium sanctissime passionis\plain \f0\fs24 , (120\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -121\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Chevalier, Repertorium, 1892-1921}}\plain \f0\fs24 , Nr. 20086, (122\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -123\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 , 125\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -126\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ,  127\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -128\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 , 130\plain \f0\super\fs32 rv\plain \f0\fs24 , 136\plain \f0\super\fs32 rv\plain \f0\fs24 , 139\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -140\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 , 142\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -143\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Chevalier, Repertorium, 1892-1921}}\plain \f0\fs24 , Nr. 3186, 20697, 8029, 3984, 2322, 16483, 16432. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[3].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 AH}}\plain \f0\fs24  50, S. 568-570, Nr. 382, (144\plain \f0\super\fs32 rv\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Christusgebete}}\plain \f0\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Domine Ihesu Christe, qui in hora diei ultima}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... cum deo patre in unitate spiritus sancti per omnia secula seculorum. Amen\plain \f0\fs24 , (144\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -145\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Qui pro salute nostra humanitatem suscepit}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... ad paradisi gaudia perducamus per Christum dominum nostrum. Amen\plain \f0\fs24 , (145\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Domine Ihesu Christe, qui hora diei nona}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... qui verus paradisus es, facias misericorditer pervenire. Qui vivis\plain \f0\fs24 , (145\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Domine Ihesu Christe, qui hora diei ultima in sepulcro}}\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f0\i\fs24 ... - ... qui et paraclisus es, facias misericorditer pervenire. Qui vivis\plain \f0\fs24 , (145\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -146\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 O anima Christi sanctissima, sanctifica me}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... tuis angelis et archiangelis laudent te per infinitas secula seculorum. Amen\plain \f0\fs24 , (146\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -147\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \u220 \'dcbergang zum nachfolgenden Offizium. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[7].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Dominus, te domine Ihesu Christe, et b