\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 1\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -6\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Kalendar}}\plain \f0\fs24 . Mittelniederl\u228 \'e4ndisch. Monatsnamen (nur August bis Dezember vorhanden) auch in Latein. Goldene Zahl, Sonn- und Feiertagsbuchstaben. Gebrauch von Utrecht wegen der Nennung der Utrechter Heiligen Friedrich (18. Juli) und Gregor (25. August) sowie der rubrizierten Eintr\u228 \'e4ge f\u252 \'fcr Willibrord (7. November) und Lebuin (12. November), w\u228 \'e4hrend Hubert (3. November) nach Maastricht und die M\u228 \'e4rtyrer Viktor und Gereon (10. Oktober) sowie Quirin (20. Oktober) nach K\u246 \'f6ln verweisen. Vgl. Eef A. Overgaauw, Saints in medieval calendars from the diocese of Utrecht as clues for the localization of manuscripts, Codices manuscripti 16 (1992), S. 81-97, bes. S. 84 f. 7\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24  leer.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 7\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -25\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Passionsoffizium}}\plain \f0\fs24 . Jede Tagzeit beginnt mit einer Initiale und besteht aus Antiphon, Hymnus, Versikel, Kollekte, Versikel, Responsorium und einer F\u252 \'fcrbitte an Maria (f\u252 \'fcr die Matutin vollst\u228 \'e4ndig wiedergegeben), (8\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Die pabus Iohannes hast ghegheven, die dese ghetiden dagelics lesen aen jaer oflaets die buten dootsonden siin ende oflaet verdienen moeg}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  h\plain \f0\fs24 [ymel]. Vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Haimerl, Gebetbuchliteratur, 1952}}\plain \f0\fs24 , S. 46, 128, (8\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -10\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Te metten tiit<. Pater Noster. Ave Maria. Heer, du selste opdoen mijn lippen ... - ... ende altoes ende eweliken sonder eynde. Amen\plain \f0\fs24 , (8\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Ant\plain \f0\fs24 [ifon]\plain \f0\i\fs24 <. Cristus is voor ons geworden onderdanich totter dood ende totter doot des cruces\plain \f0\fs24 , (8\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -9\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Ymnen<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Des vaders w\u255 \'ffsheit, die godlike waerheit, Cristus menscheit in der ghevanghen te metten tiit}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... die ghepassiit biste om ons. \plain \f0\fs24 [Versikel.] \plain \f0\i\fs24 Heere, verhore mijn ghebet. Ende mijn ropen comen totti\plain \f0\fs24 , (9\plain \f0\super\fs32 rv\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Collecta<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[8].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Heer Ihesu Criste, des leveden gods soen, du biste der enghelen bl\u252 \'fcsscap}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... al hier vorven mit dinen geselscap. \plain \f0\fs24 [Versikel und Responsorium.] \plain \f0\i\fs24 Die leves ende regneers god eweliken sonder enyde. Amen. Heer, verhoer mjn ghebet. Ende mijn ropen comen totti. Benedien wir den heer. Gode segen wi danc. Alle gelovige zielen moeten rusten in vreden. Amen\plain \f0\fs24 , (9\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -10\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Van onser liever vrouuwen<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[15].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Ave, heilichste moeder ende maghden Maria, om dar swaert des rouwen, dat dijn heilige siel duerghinc}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... ende mit hem outsprekeliken verbliden moet. Amen\plain \f0\fs24 , (10\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -13\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Ent prime tiit oremus<\plain \f0\fs24 , (11\plain \f0\super\fs32 rv\plain \f0\fs24 )\plain \f0\i\fs24  >Ymnen<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Te priim tiit wort Ihesus gheleit tot Pylatus}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... die profeten te voren hadden gesproken\plain \f0\fs24 , (11\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -12\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Collecta<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[9].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Heer Ihesu Criste, des levenden gods soen, die scanliken biste ghepresenteert den ongenadigen rechter}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... moeten dine ghebenedide ste(rv)e\plain \f0\fs24 , (12\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -13\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Van onser liever vrouwen<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[16].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 O alre soetste moeder, vrouwen ende reyne maget, Maria}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... ende mit waerachtigher penitencien mi gheselen moet. Amen\plain \f0\fs24 , (13\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -15\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Te tertie<\plain \f0\fs24 , (13\plain \f0\super\fs32 rv\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Ymnen<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Te tertie tiit riepen die ioden cruysten, cruysten, hi wort bespot}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... die ghepassiit biste om ons\plain \f0\fs24 , (13\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -14\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Collecta<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[10].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Heer Ihesu Criste, des levenden gods soen, du biste een croen alre heilighen}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... verleent hem te comen tot die ewige glorien\plain \f0\fs24 , (14\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -15\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Van onser lieven vrouwen. Ora\plain \f0\fs24 [tio]\plain \f0\i\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[17].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 O alre goedertierenste moeder ende maghet Maria}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... Op dat ir nie overgelevert en worde totter ewiger pinen inden helschen brant. Amen\plain \f0\fs24 , (15\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -17\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Sext tiit<\plain \f0\fs24 , (15\plain \f0\super\fs32 rv\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Ymnen<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Te sex tiit wort Ihesus ghenaghelt an den cruce}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... dinen heiligen cruce die werlt verlost heves\plain \f0\fs24 , (15\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -16\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Collecta<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[11].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Heer Ihesu Criste, des levenden gods soen, die wtgerect hebste diin armen in den cruce}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ...  Op dat wi di eweliken moegen bescouwen.\plain \f0\fs24 , (16\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -17\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Van onser liever vrouuwen<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[18].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 O alre mynnentlichste unversoerte maget}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... toe moet geraeken mit siel ende mit liif. Amen\plain \f0\fs24 , (17\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -19\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 )\plain \f0\i\fs24 >Noen<\plain \f0\fs24 , (17\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -18\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Ymnen<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Te noen tiit riep Ihesus hely hely waerom hi alsoe aftergelaten waer}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... dinen heiligen cruce verlost heves die werelt\plain \f0\fs24 , (18\plain \f0\super\fs32 rv\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Collecta<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[12].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Heer Ihesu Criste, levende gods soen, die om ons in den cruce storves}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... vader muchten diins bloets altiit te verbliden\plain \f0\fs24 , (18\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -19\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Van onser liever vrouuwen<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[19].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 O alre edelste ende mynlicste maget}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... rusten des ewigen vaderlants. Amen\plain \f0\fs24 , (19\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -22\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Vesper<\plain \f0\fs24 , (19\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -20\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Ymnen<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Te vesper tiit wort Ihesus genomen van den cruce}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... och daer lach neder der glorien croen\plain \f0\fs24 , (20\plain \f0\super\fs32 rv\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Collecta<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[13].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Heer Ihesu Criste, des levenden gods soen, du biste een scoencheit der ewiger salicheit}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ...die bynnensten onser gedachten\plain \f0\fs24 , (21\plain \f0\super\fs32 rv\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Van onser liever vrouwen<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[20].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 O alre edelste ende alre reynste iuncvrouven, dochter des ewigen vaders}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... te crussen dienen lieven gebenediden soen Ihesum Cristum\plain \f0\fs24 , (22\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -25\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Complet<. Bekeer ons, god, onsen salichmaker ende ofker dinen toern van ons\plain \f0\fs24 , (22\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -23\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Ymnen<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[7].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Te compleet tiit wort dat edel lichaem Cristi in den grave gheleit}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... dinen heilighen cruce, die werelt verlost hevest\plain \f0\fs24 , (23\plain \f0\super\fs32 rv\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Collecta<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[14].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Heer Ihesu Criste, des levenden gods soen, sette diin piin diin cruce ende dinen doot}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... vrede ende eendrachticheit der heiligher kerken ende ons me sondaren leven ende bliscap eweliken\plain \f0\fs24 , (23\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -24\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Van onser liever vrouwen<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[21].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 O waerde iuncvrouven maget, Maria, eersamighe moeder}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... ende mit een salich eynde van hene moet\plain \f0\fs24 , (24\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -25\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Van onser liever vrouwen<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[22].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 O gloriose vrouve ende moeder miins lieven heren Ihesu Cristi}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... ende diins ghebenediden soens van der ewiger doot ende scanden ende van der ewiger verdomenisse. Amen\plain \f0\fs24 , (25\plain \f0\super\fs32 rv\plain \f0\fs24 ) Rubrik. \plain \f0\i\fs24 >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[24]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Dit gebet plach sinte Bernardus te lesen tot onser vrouwen}}\plain \f0\i\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[25].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 O vrou der glorien ende coninghinne der bliscappen}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... Du bliveste eweliken ghebenediit mit Ihesum, dinen leven uitvercoren ende gemynden zoen\plain \f0\fs24 , (25\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 )\plain \f0\i\fs24  \plain \f0\fs24 Excipit \plain \f0\i\fs24 Te horen dat soete nacts Ave Maria\plain \f0\fs24 . 26\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24  leer, 26\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24  Miniatur.}

