\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs24 91\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 -156\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Gebete}}\plain \f1\fs24 , teilweise mit Kollekten. Jedes Gebet beginnt mit einer Initiale. Gebetsanl\u228 \'e4sse in den Rubriken genannt, (91\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 -95\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Kommuniongebet}}\plain \f1\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\fs24 >Dit gebet selmen lesen, alsmen got onsen heer gaen wil om hende ontfanghen<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 O overste prester ende waerachtich biscop Ihesus Cristus}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... moet ons brenghen die vader, die soen ende die heilige gheest. Amen\plain \f1\fs24 , (95\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 -97\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[3].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Kommuniongebet}}\plain \f1\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\fs24 >Noch van den heiligen sacrament<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Her Ihesu Criste, ic en bin niet wairdich, dattu ingaeste onder myn dack}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... ende regneert een god in ewicheit. Amen. \plain \f1\fs24 Vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Haimerl, Gebetbuchliteratur, 1952}}\plain \f1\fs24 , S. 111 (636), 126 (771), (97\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 -98\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[4].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Kommuniongebet}}\plain \f1\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\fs24 >Van den heiligen sacrament<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Almachtige ende ontfermhertige god ende hemelsche vader}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... ende in u hamelsche geselscap. Amen. \plain \f1\fs24 Vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Haimerl, Gebetbuchliteratur, 1952}}\plain \f1\fs24 , S. 126 (771), (98\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 -99\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[5].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Kommuniongebet}}\plain \f1\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\fs24 >Alstu dat heilige sacrament ontfangen, hebste een gebet<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Heer Jesu Criste, welcoem moetstu siin ghebenedide vaders}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... ende gheest im naedesen leven das ewige laven. Amen\plain \f1\fs24 , (99\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 -101\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[6].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Kommuniongebet}}\plain \f1\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\fs24 >Van den heiligen sacrament<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Herr Jesu Criste, lof si dijnre wonderliker}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... god is almachtich ende onversceiden. Amen. \plain \f1\fs24 Vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Haimerl, Gebetbuchliteratur, 1952}}\plain \f1\fs24 , S. 126 (771), (101\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 -102\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[7].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Ablassgebet}}\plain \f1\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\fs24 >Dit ghebet sende die paus Leo der coninghinen van Cecilien ... - ... dri dusent van dagheliscen sonden \plain \f1\fs24 [3000 + 3000 Tage Ablass]\plain \f1\i\fs24 .<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Heer, ontfanc ic dat heilige wywater}}\plain \f1\i\fs24   ... - ... nae desen leven dat ewighen leven. Amen\plain \f1\fs24 , (102\plain \f1\super\fs32 rv\plain \f1\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[8].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Weihwassergebet}}\plain \f1\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\fs24 >Die craft van den heiligen gewiden water<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[7].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Ses dinghen weric dat water, dat overnuts den priester ghebenediit is}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... die tracheit van den menscen. Dit seit sinte Augustiin\plain \f1\fs24 , (102\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 -103\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[9].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Gebet um S\u252 \'fcndenvergebung}}\plain \f1\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\fs24 >Waer mede dattie daghelisce sonden vergeven worden<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[8].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 In sevet manieren worden die daghelisce sonden vergeven}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... sonden vergeven, datmen das heiligh Otyles ontfaet\plain \f1\fs24 , (103\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 -105\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[10].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Ablassgebet}}\plain \f1\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\fs24 >So wie diet naegescreven gebet alle dage leest ... - ... in wat daghen een mensch dit ghebet spreect, in dien dagen en sel hi niet haesteliken sterven<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[9].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Heer Ihesu Criste, almachtich, god goedertieren gesontmaeker}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... ons heren Ihesu Cristi. Pater noster\plain \f1\fs24 , (105\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 -108\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 ) Teilweise mit Wasserschaden. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[11].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Gebet von den sieben Wunden Jesu}}\plain \f1\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\fs24 >Dese nagescreven ghebeden van den gebenediden heilighen viifs wonden ... - ... heilighen wonden der rechten hant ons heren Ihesu Cristi. Pater noster<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[10].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Weest ghegruet heilighe wonder der rechter hant myns liefs heren}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... ende hier nae van den ewigen doot. Amen \plain \f1\fs24 [500 Jahre + 7 Karenen], (108\plain \f1\super\fs32 rv\plain \f1\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[12].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Zusatzgebet}}\plain \f1\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\fs24 >Een ghebet op dese voergescreven ghebeden<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[11].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 O doete ghebenedide mynke ghewonde Ihesu}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... in dinen dienst dotten eynde mijns levens. Amen\plain \f1\fs24 , (109\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 -110\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[13].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Ablassgebet}}\plain \f1\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\fs24 >Dese drie Patir nosteren plach een persoen alle dage de lesen voor enen crucefix ... - ... verdienen VI\plain \f1\i\super\fs32 M\plain \f1\i\fs24  VI\plain \f1\i\super\fs32 C\plain \f1\i\fs24  ende LXVI jaer oflaets \plain \f1\fs24 [6666 Jahre Ablass]\plain \f1\i\fs24 . Pater noster<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[12].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Dit Pater noster lees ic di, lieve heer Ihesu Criste}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... dat mijnre scelen beulecken mach. Amen\plain \f1\fs24 , (110\plain \f1\super\fs32 rv\plain \f1\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[14].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Gebet beim Kreuz}}\plain \f1\fs24 .\plain \f1\i\fs24  >Een heilich broeder plach dit naevolghende ghebet ... - ... hi sonder enighe piin voer tot onsen lieven heer in der ewiger glorien<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[13].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Heer Ihesu Criste, des lievenden gods soen overmits die bitterheit}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... dat hem toebehoert dat is sonden. Amen\plain \f1\fs24 , (111\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 -112\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[15].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Gebet f\u252 \'fcr s\u228 \'e4umige S\u252 \'fcnder}}\plain \f1\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\fs24 >Man leest, datter een persoen verdoemt soude hebben gheweest, wer slechts behouden bleef, om dat hi dit naeghescriven ghebet alle daghe plach te lesen mit ynnicheit siins herten<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[14].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Ic dancke di heuer, heer Jesu Cirste, om dattu nu aldus edelen creatuer ghescaepen}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... ende in ewigen tiden. Amen\plain \f1\fs24 , (112\plain \f1\super\fs32 rv\plain \f1\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[16].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Erl\u246 \'f6sungsgebet}}\plain \f1\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\fs24 >Dit ghebet maecte sinte Augustiin. Ende di et daghelics leest, en mach niet verloren bliven<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[15].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Sich in mi onsalich mensche, o onghemeten goedertierenheit}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... die menichvoudicheit dijnre grondeloser oncfermheiticheit. Amen. \plain \f1\fs24 Vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[12].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Galynina, Augustinus, 2010}}\plain \f1\fs24 , S. 202, (112\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 -113\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[17].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Gebet um Messfr\u252 \'fcchte}}\plain \f1\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\fs24 >Die dit gebet spreect devoteliken, is deelachtich alle die missen, die gecelebrieret worden over al aertrike. Gebet<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[16].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 O lieve heer Ihesu Criste, ic aenbede dinen heiligen lichaeme}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... troen der ewigen glorien. Amen\plain \f1\fs24 , (113\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 -115\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[18].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Ablassgebet}}\plain \f1\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\fs24 >Dese gebeden heeft sinte Gregorius ghemaechtenn ... - ... gheconfirmiert inten stoel van Romen Romen \plain \f1\fs24 [(20000 + 14) Jahre + 24 Tage Ablass]\plain \f1\i\fs24 . Pater noster. Ave Maria<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[17].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 O heer Jesu Criste, ic aenbede di, hanghende an den cruce}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... mijnre zielen, als si verstenden sel. Amen. \plain \f1\fs24 Vorlage: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[13].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Lerocquais, Les livres d'heures. Manuscrits}}\plain \f1\fs24 , Bd. 2, S. 346, Nr. XXXVII. Vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[3].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Haimerl, Gebetbuchliteratur, 1952}}\plain \f1\fs24 , S. 92, 94, (115\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 -118\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[19].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Gebet in Bedr\u228 \'e4ngnis}}\plain \f1\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\fs24 >Soe, wie dit ghebet alle sonnendaghen ynnichliken leest mit berouwe des herren ... - ... sel hondert ende XL dagen oflaets gebben< \plain \f1\fs24 [100 + 40 Tage Ablass]\plain \f1\i\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[18].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 O heilige maertelaer, sinte Herasmus, die apten}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... ende van allen wederstoot, moet worden verlost. Overmits onsen here Jesum Cristum. Amen\plain \f1\fs24 , (118\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 -120\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[20].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Gnadengebet}}\plain \f1\fs24 .\plain \f1\i\fs24  >Dit gebet sel een mensche spreken also dicke, als hem siin sonden leet siin ende hi ghenade van gode begheert, soe sel hi ghenade ende troest overmits dit gebet van onsen heer ontfaghen<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[19].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 O goedertieren heer Jesu gode, behaechliken siin}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... di naevolghen moet eweliken zonder eynde. Amen\plain \f1\fs24 , (120\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 -121\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[21].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Dreifaltigkeitsgebet}}\plain \f1\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\fs24 >Een suverliken gebet vander heiliger drienvoudichen ende eerst totten hemelschen vader. Gebet<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[20].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 O almachtighe hemelsche vader, ic bidde di om een cler bekennen}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... in mijnre ghehoechnissen. Amen. >Totten soen gebet<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[21].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 O goede Jesu, ewige wijsheit}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... verstandenisse. Amen. >Totten heiligen geest<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[22].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 O goedertieren heilige gheest}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... eweliken in minen wille. Amen\plain \f1\fs24 , (121\plain \f1\super\fs32 rv\plain \f1\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[22].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Dreifaltigkeitsgebet}}\plain \f1\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\fs24 >Ghebet<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[23].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 O heilighe drievoudighe craften}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... si leven of doot. Amen\plain \f1\fs24 , (121\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 -123\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[40].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Gebet beim Kreuz}}\plain \f1\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\fs24 >Soe, wie dat beelde van den aensciin ons heren Jhesu Cristi aensiet ... - ... dit naevolghende ghebet seltu oec mede lesen<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[24].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Ic gruet u, ghebenedide aenschiin ons liefs hern Jesu Cristi}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... aen god eweliken sonder eynde. Amen. \plain \f1\fs24 Vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[4].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Haimerl, Gebetbuchliteratur, 1952}}\plain \f1\fs24 , S. 92 (548), 128 (768), (123\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 -124\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[23].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Ablassgebet}}\plain \f1\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\fs24 >Soe, wie dit ghebet spreect mit ynnicheit siins herzen, die heeft Benedictus die paevs gegheven III\plain \f1\i\super\fs32 M\plain \f1\i\fs24  daghen oflaets van dootsonden ende dusent daghen van daghelicsen zonden \plain \f1\fs24 [3000 + 1000 Tage Ablass]\plain \f1\i\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[25].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 O siel Cristi heilich mi, o lichaam Cristi, behoet mi}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... dit sel men lesen, alsmen onsen heer opbuert inder missen. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[5].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Oosterman, De gratie, 1995}}\plain \f1\fs24 , Bd. 2, S. 307, Nr. 304, (124\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 -125\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[24].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Gebet um Bu\u223 \'dfnachlass}}\plain \f1\fs24 .\plain \f1\i\fs24  >Die gracie es CCC jaer vegewers quijt ende alsoe menich verloren tiits quiit ende penitencien<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[26].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Weest ghegruet, ghewaer heilighe lichaem}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... alle der  ghegeelre kristenheit. Amen\plain \f1\fs24 , (125\plain \f1\super\fs32 rv\plain \f1\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[25].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Opfergebet}}\plain \f1\fs24  . \plain \f1\i\fs24 >Alsmen die kelter opbuert in der missen<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[27].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Weest ghegruet, alre suverste bloet mijns liefs hern Jhesu Cristi}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... in der ewicheit. Amen\plain \f1\fs24 , (125\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 -127\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[26].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Ablassgebet}}\plain \f1\fs24  vor dem Tabernakel. \plain \f1\i\fs24 >Alle, die gheen, die dit ghebet lesen inder missen ...  - ... dat was VI\plain \f1\i\super\fs32 M\plain \f1\i\fs24  VI\plain \f1\i\super\fs32 C\plain \f1\i\fs24  ende ses entsestich \plain \f1\fs24 [6666 Tage Ablass]\plain \f1\i\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[28].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Ic bidde di mynnentlike, lieve heer Jhesu Cristi, om dier hoegher minnen}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... noch sonder dinen heiligen lichaem. Amen. \plain \f1\fs24 Vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[6].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Haimerl, Gebetsbuchliteratur, 1952}}\plain \f1\fs24 , S. 94, Z. 24 f., (127\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 -130\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[27].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Gnadengebet}}\plain \f1\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\fs24 >Een suverlic gebet van onsen hern<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[29].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 O, der die voeten dijnre hoecheit legghe ic ghevallen sondige mensche, alle mine ropen is ghenade}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... Daer laet im di iubileren an(e) mit vroeliken tonghen dis cantieren. Amen\plain \f1\fs24 , (130\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 -131\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[28].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Ablassgebet}}\plain \f1\fs24  aus Jerusalem. \plain \f1\i\fs24 >Dit naegescriven gebet staet gescreven te Iherusalem in der kerstenen copelle ende daer siin toeghegeven grote oflaten. Die graci is dusent jaer aflaets \plain \f1\fs24 [1000 Jahre Ablass]\plain \f1\i\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[30].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 O, heer Jesu Criste, die dat alre heilichste lichaem ontfingheste van der glorioser maghet Marien}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... regneers aen god in ewicheit. Amen\plain \f1\fs24 ,\plain \f1\i\fs24  \plain \f1\fs24 (131\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 -132\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[29].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Ablassgebet}}\plain \f1\fs24  am Morgen. \plain \f1\i\fs24 >Benedictus die twaleste paevs heeft gegheven tot desen ghebedekiin driehondert daghen oflaets \plain \f1\fs24 [300 Tage Ablass]\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... men selt des morghens lesen, alsmen eerst op ghestaen is<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[31].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Die keyserlike hoeghe moeghentheit gode moet mi huyden gebenedien}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... weghen huyden bescermen ende bewaeren\plain \f1\fs24 . Vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[7].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Haimerl, Gebetbuchliteratur, 1952}}\plain \f1\fs24 , S. 91, Z. 15-17,\plain \f1\i\fs24  \plain \f1\fs24 (132\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 -133\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[30].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Nachtgebet}}\plain \f1\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\fs24 >Sinte Bernaerdus ghebet ende men selt lesen des avonts, eermen slapen gaet<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[32].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Heer Jesu Criste, verghif mi goedertiecht, soe wat ic in desen dage misdaen hebbe}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... een god ewelic sonde eynde. Amen\plain \f1\fs24 , (133\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 -140\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[31].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Gebet gegen Bedr\u228 \'e4ngnis}}\plain \f1\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\fs24 >Sinte Augustinus heeft dit gebet bescreven ... - ... als siin siel vor sinen lichaem sceiden sel, soe sel si in den paradise geset worden, is dathi unter dootsonden gestorven is<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[33].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 God weest mir armen sondaer genadich}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... mit enen speer in mijnre siden gestecken wort. \plain \f1\fs24 Vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[8].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Haimerl, Gebetbuchliteratur, 1952}}\plain \f1\fs24 , S. 128, Z. 14-17, (140\plain \f1\super\fs32 rv\plain \f1\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[32].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Gebet zum Allerh\u246 \'f6chsten}}\plain \f1\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\fs24 >Een gebet van onsen here<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[34].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 O alre ontfermhertichste, o alre scoenste, o alre eerwaerdichste god}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... mynliker ontvermherticheit. Amen. Amen\plain \f1\fs24 , (141\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 -145\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[33].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Mariengebet}}\plain \f1\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\fs24 >Een ghebet van onser liever vrouwen gehieten O intemerata ... - ... ist dattet hem salich is siinne sielen, o in eternum et benedicta etc.<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[35].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 O onbevlecte ende in ewicheit gebenediite, sonderlinge maget}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... regneers god in ewicheit. Amen\plain \f1\fs24  (maskuline Form). \u196 \'c4hnelt: Oostermann, De gratie, 1995, Bd. 2, S. 303, Nr. 288. Vorlage: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[14].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Leroquais, Les livres d'heures. Manuscrits}}\plain \f1\fs24 , Bd. 2, S. 346 f., Nr. XXXVIII. Vgl. Fonds 68, Nr. 437, (145\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 -147\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[34].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Mariengebet}}\plain \f1\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\fs24 >Soe, wie dit ghebet alle dage devoteliken leest voer onser liever vrouwen beelde, die en sel siin nootturft niet ontbreken opter aerden. Ende hi en sel niet sterven sonderliecht. Ende hi sel dat heiligen sacrament ontfangen voer siinre doot. Ghebet<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[36].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 O hoeghe edel vrou, moeder gods Maria, ic bidde u, dat ghi nu im doet penitencie doen, mit waerachtige biecht}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... die ewige salicheit. Amen. \plain \f1\fs24 Vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[9].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Haimerl, Gebetbuchliteratur, 1952}}\plain \f1\fs24 , S. 128, Z. 19-22\plain \f1\i\fs24 , \plain \f1\fs24 (147\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 -149\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[35].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Mariengebet}}\plain \f1\fs24 .\plain \f1\i\fs24  >Dit gebet wordt sinte Bernaerdus geopenbaert vanden enghel. Ende soe, wie dattet dagelics leest, sel behouden bliven. Ende also als gout gaet boven allen metael, alsoe gaet dit navolgende ghebet boven allen ghebet<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[37].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Ic gruet u, Maria, dienstmaecht der heiligher drievoudicheit, ic gruet u, Maria, bruyt des heilighen geests }}\plain \f1\i\fs24 ... - ... mit gerechten gelove die moet behagen. Amen. \plain \f1\fs24 Vorlage: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[15].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Chevalier, Repertorium, 1892-1921}}\plain \f1\fs24 , Nr. 1872, (149\plain \f1\super\fs32 rv\plain \f1\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[36].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Mariengebet}}\plain \f1\fs24 .\plain \f1\i\fs24  >Soe, wie dese grueten mit ynnicheit siins herten leest ende mit gansen gelove alle dage, daer sel onse lieve vrouwe toe comen, eer hi sterft<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[38].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Ic gruet u, Maria, een opgewassen lelij der reynicheit}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... sel dat gi mijn gheleitster siit totte vrogeden diins lieve kints. Amen. \plain \f1\fs24 Vorlage: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[16].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Chevalier, Repertorium, 1892-1921}}\plain \f1\fs24 , Nr. 9871, (149\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 -152\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[37].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Mariengebet}}\plain \f1\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\fs24 >Die heilige paevs sinte Bonifacius heeft tot desen naevolghenden geven ... - ... die verdient seven jaer oflaets ende XL carinen< carinen \plain \f1\fs24 [7 Jahre + 40 Karenen Ablass]\plain \f1\i\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[39].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Die moeder gods, vol van rouwe stont biden cruce vol van tranen}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... dan dat mijn siel worden ghevoert in den hemelschen paradiis. Amen. \plain \f1\fs24 \u196 \'c4hnelt: Oostermann, De gratie, 1995, Bd. 2, S. 300 f., Nr. 279. Vorlage: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[17].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 AH}}\plain \f1\fs24  54, S. 312 f., Nr. 201. Vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[10].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Haimerl, Gebetbuchliteratur, 1952}}\plain \f1\fs24 , S. 128, Z. 34 f., (152\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 -154\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[38].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Gebet von den sieben Freuden Mariens}}\plain \f1\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\fs24 >Dit siin die seven bliisscappen onser liever vrouwe Marien ... - ... Hier beginnen die seven bliscappen onser liever vrouwen<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[40].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Verbliit u, heilige Maria, moeder ende maghet}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... in der uren mijns doots. Amen. \plain \f1\fs24 Vorlage: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[18].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Chevalier, Repertorium, 1892-1921}}\plain \f1\fs24 , Nr. 1782 f. Vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[11].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Heimerl, Gebetbuchliteratur, 1952}}\plain \f1\fs24 , S. 125 (745), (154\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 -156\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[39].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Mariengebet}}\plain \f1\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\fs24 >Van onser liever vrouwen<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[41].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 O bloeyende roes suverlike moeder des heren, o saftmoedige maget}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... is inden raeyen vander sonnen. \plain \f1\fs24 Vorlage: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[19].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 AH}}\plain \f1\fs24  1, S. 51, Nr. 7.}

