\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 157\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -182\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Suffragien, teilweise mit Kollekten}}\plain \f0\fs24 . Jede Antiphon beginnt mit einer Initiale. Rubriken rubriziert, (157\plain \f0\super\fs32 rv\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Michael}}\plain \f0\fs24 , (157\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Engel}}\plain \f0\fs24 , (157\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -158\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[3].4100gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Schutzengel}}\plain \f0\fs24 , (158\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -159\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[4].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Peter}}\plain \f0\fs24 , (159\plain \f0\super\fs32 rv\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[5].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Paul}}\plain \f0\fs24 , (159\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -160\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[7].4100gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Johannes der Evangelist}}\plain \f0\fs24 , (160\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -161\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[8].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Sebastian}}\plain \f0\fs24 , (161\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -162\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[10].4100gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Adrian}}\plain \f0\fs24 , (162\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -163\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fl