u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Apollonia}}\plain \f0\fs24 , (171\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -172\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[23].4100gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Maria Magdalena}}\plain \f0\fs24 , (172\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -173\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[24].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Anna}}\plain \f0\fs24 , (173\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -174\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[25].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Elisabeth}}\plain \f0\fs24 , (174\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -175\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ){\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[26].4100gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17  Alle Heiligen}}\plain \f0\fs24 , (175\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -176\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) Gott f\u252 \'fcr alle Seelen, (176\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -178\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Litanei}}\plain \f0\fs24 . Durch Unterstreichung hervorgehoben: Maria, die Engel, Michael, Gabriel, Johannes der T\u228 \'e4ufer, Peter, Paul, Andreas, Jakob, Johannes der Evangelist, Bartholom\u228 \'e4us, Ursula, Agnes, Cecilie, Tekla, Agathe, Barbara, Katharina, (178\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -182\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) Exempel rubriziert und unterstrichen. Es folgen sieben Vaterunser-Bitten. 183\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24  leer. 183\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24  Miniatur.}

