\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 (49\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -68\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) Teil 4. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 van der gottliken leve}}\plain \f0\fs24 , (49\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -60\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 Dyt is van der gottliken leve seer unverliclik. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Dat is m\u255 \'ffn gebot, dat gy iw under lauk leiff hebn}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... eyn wertlik herte, dar se anverowen moge unde ungelesschen blive. >Nota<\plain \f0\fs24 , (61\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -64\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 Van vyffteyn grade de zele. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Viffte\u255 \'ffn grade synt vermyds, den der zele boret up to stigen}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... gegeven unde gensliken, verkoft um seyner leve. Amen\plain \f0\fs24 , (64\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -65\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 Van der schemede. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Schemede is eyn thoren der gotliken sterkede}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... ane scemede en kan n\u255 \'ffn d\u255 \'ffnk recht verdich of erliken werden of to gaen\plain \f0\fs24 , (65\plain \f0\super\fs32 rv\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 Van der lycknyssen des levendes. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Unse levent in dusser werlt is geliket enen scheppe}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... vermyds anderen versemen\u255 \'ffssen edder nacheit\plain \f0\fs24 , (65\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -66\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 Van wylligen gottliken armode. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Wisset warnstige navolgers der wylichliken armode}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... to dusser armot help uns Ihesus, de de alde armeste was up erden. Amen\plain \f0\fs24 . \plain \f0\i\fs24 Hir were vele to seggen, men ic bevelet j\u252 \'fcwer mytticheit to undersokende. \plain \f0\fs24 M\u246 \'f6gliche Vorlage: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Ps.-Eusebius Cremonensis}}\plain \f0\i\fs24 ,\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Epistola ad Damasum de morte Hieronymi}}\plain \f0\fs24 . Druck: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 PL}}\plain \f0\fs24  22, Sp. 239-282, bes. 248C-250C, (67\plain \f0\super\fs32 rv\plain \f0\fs24 ) V\plain \f0\i\fs24 an te\u255 \'ffn st\u252 \'fccken, de dar hinderen den menscen to enen vullencommen levende. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Sunte Berend beschrifft uns van X hinderliken stucken, den menscen to komende to enen vullen comende levent}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... de he to s\u255 \'ffnen en medibroders of susters hebn solde\plain \f0\fs24 , (67\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -68\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 Van der waren otmodicheit. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Wat wy to voren, hebt gesecht van den willigen armode}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... des moten io gebracht werden vermyds den verdenste syner benedicden moder. Amen. \plain \f0\fs24 Druck: Speygel der dogende, L\u252 \'fcbeck 1485, 158\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -160\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 , 97\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -98\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 , 96\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 , 100\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 , 101\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 , 108\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 , 98\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -100\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 , (68\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -72\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) leer,}

