\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 40\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -44\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Aufnahmestatuten}}\plain \f0\fs24 , (40\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -41\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Questo si e el modo che se debe tenere a recevere li homini in lo ordine de la compagnia de la conceptione de la Immaculata Virgine Maria<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Non se vole haver tanta cura de essere grande moltitudine}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... che apertengano a le supradicte compagnia\plain \f0\fs24 , (41\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -42\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Questo si e lo ordine che si debe tenere a recevere le donne in dicta compagnia<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Dice el sapientissimo Salomone}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... Et finalment sia ben probata secundo la discretione di fratelli et sorelle de dicta compagnia\plain \f0\fs24 , (42\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -44\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) Aufnahmeritus. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Et notato che ogniuno cossi  donne commo homini sonno obligati a confessarsi dal confessor de la compagnia}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... et lo lectore non possa recevere alcu\plain \f0\fs24 [na] \plain \f0\i\fs24 persona sen\u231 \'e7a licentia del superiore\plain \f0\fs24 , (42\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) Hymnus. Neumiert.\plain \f0\i\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Chevalier, Repertorium, 1892-1921}}\plain \f0\fs24 , Nr. 21204. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[3].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 AH}}\plain \f0\fs24  50, S. 193, Nr. 144,}

