\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 1\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -144\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Stundenbuch}}\plain \f0\fs24 ,
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -12\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Kalendar}}\plain \f0\fs24 . Monatsbezeichnungen, Goldene Zahl, r\u246 \'f6mische Tagesz\u228 \'e4hlung und bestimmte Festbezeichnungen rubriziert, Sonn- und Wochentagsbuchstaben, (1\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -8\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) Franz\u246 \'f6sisch, manchmal Lateinisch, (8\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -12\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) Lateinisch. Vielleicht nach dem Gebrauch von Nantes oder Le Mans wegen der Nennung von Felix (Bischof von Nantes, 8. Januar und 7. Juli), Rigomerus (Abt von Le Mans, 16. September statt 17. Januar), Clarus (Bischof von Nantes, 10. Oktober) und Corentinus (Bischof von Le Mans, 12. Dezember), (1\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -12\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Notizen}}\plain \f0\fs24  und {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[3].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Gebete}}\plain \f0\fs24 . 2. Hand, (1\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Gratias tibi ago, sancte pater omnipotens eterne deus, qui me dignatus es in hac preterita nocte custodire}}\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... in tuo sancto servitio\plain \f0\fs24  (verk\u252 \'fcrzt, zweimal). Auszug aus: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Alcuinus}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[4].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 De usu psalmorum}}\plain \f0\fs24 . Druck: MPL 101, 484B, (1\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -2\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 Oratio devotissima a beato Augustino composita. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Domine Iesu Christe, fili dei vivi et redemptoris mundi, defende me}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... et corpus meum nunc et in perpetuum. Amen\plain \f0\fs24 , (3\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -5\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) Ed.: Leroquais, Les livres d'heures. Manuscrits, Bd. 2, S. 342, Nr. XXXI, (6\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -8\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 Oratio ad virginem Mariam pro defunctis. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Mone, Hymnen, 1853-1855}}\plain \f0\fs24 , Bd. 1, S. 400 f., Nr. 292, (8\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -10\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 Oratio devotissima beati Leonis pap\u230 \'e6.\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 In principio erat verbum etc. }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 [Io 1,1] }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Deo gratias. Osanna. Filio David benedictus, qui venit in nomine domini}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... in meam commemorationem et in remissionem omnium peccatorum. Sit semper mecum. Amen\plain \f0\fs24 , (10\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -16\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 )\plain \f0\i\fs24  Benedictio angelorum et archangelorum, virtutum, principatuum thronorum ... - ... et omnes inimicos meos, visibiles et invisibiles, in hac hora et omni tempore potissimum in horas mortis me\u230 \'e6. Amen. Iesus. Maria\plain \f0\fs24 ,}

