\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 (13\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -18\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Perikopen}}\plain \f0\fs24 , (13\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -14\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) Johannes, (14\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -16\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) Lukas, (16\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -17\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) Matth\u228 \'e4us, (17\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -18\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) Markus, (16\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -18\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Gebet}}\plain \f0\fs24 . 2. Hand. \plain \f0\i\fs24 Oratio contra pericula mundi eminentia. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Per signum \u8224 \'86 ..., libera me, domine. In nomine patris et filii, spiritus sancti. Amen. In nomine sancte et individue trinitatis. Amen. Ego iuro vos, omnia genera armorum}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... Verbum caro factum est et habitavit in nobis, et vidimus gloriam dei quasi unigeniti a patre, plenum gratiae et veritatis \plain \f0\fs24 [Io 1,14], (18\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Mariengebet}}\plain \f0\fs24 . \plain \f0\i\fs24 H\u230 \'e6c sunt 71 nomina virginis Marie. Quicumque ea diebus sabbati recitaverit cum septem Ave Maria, apparebit ei ante diem exitus sui, quarum nomina dedit episcopo, quomodo de sclavonie. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Digna virgo, flos et nubes, regina}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... mulier, mediatrix, magna, assumpta, Maria. Postea dic septem Ave Maria\plain \f0\fs24 ,}

