\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 (50\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -51\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Officium parvum de Sancta Cruce}}\plain \f0\fs24 , (50\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -55\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Ablassgebete}}\plain \f0\fs24 . 2. Hand. Gebete 1-8 enden stets \plain \f0\i\fs24 Amen. Pater noster. Ave Maria\plain \f0\fs24 , (50\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Quicumque devote dixerit septem orationes sequentes cum 7 Pater}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17  [noster]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17  et Ave Maria ante imaginem prefatis, lucrabitur quinquaginta sex millia annorum indulgentiam, que atribus summis pontificale fuerunt, videlicet primo a beato Gregorio 14 milia, secundo a papa Nicolao quinto 14 milia anno domini 1449, tertio a papa Sixto 4, qui has indulgentias dupplicavit anno domini 1478, et sic sunt in summa 56 milia annorum. Et laici nescientes eas orationes, 15 Pater noster et totiusdem. Amen}}\plain \f0\fs24 , (51\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -53\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 Orationes devotissim\u230 \'e6. \plain \f0\fs24 Ed.: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Leroquais, Les livres d'heures. Manuscrits, Bd. 2}}\plain \f0\fs24 , S. 346, Nr. XXXVII. Vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Haimerl, Gebetbuchliteratur, 1952}}\plain \f0\fs24 , S. 92 (542), 121 (710),}

