\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 (53\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -58\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 , 60\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -63\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 , 66\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -69\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 , 74\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -78\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 , 80\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -83\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Officium BMV}}\plain \f0\fs24 . 2. Teil, (53\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -59\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) Prim, (60\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -63\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) Terz. Ende fehlt, (vor 63\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) Textverlust (Capitulum u.a.), (63\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) Schlussgebet nach dem Gebrauch von Rom. 2. Schlussgebet am Ende unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig, (66\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -69\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) Sext. Anfang fehlt, (vor 71\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) Textverlust,  (71\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -72\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) Non. Ende fehlt, (74\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -78\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) Vesper. Ende fehlt, (80\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -83\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) Komplet. Anfang und Ende fehlen, (53\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -63\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Gebete}}\plain \f0\fs24 . 2. Hand, (53\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 Invenientes eas 8 addentibus duas sequentes orationes, dupplicavit indulgentias predictas, et sic summa erunt centum 12 milia annorum indulgentiarum. \plain \f0\fs24 Vgl. Leroquais, Les livres d'heures. Manuscrits, Bd. 1, S. 207; Bd. 2, S. 61, (54\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 8.\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 O amantissime domine sancte pater, ego offero tibi innocentem mortem}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... deprecor te miserere mei\plain \f0\fs24 , (54\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 9. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 O domine Iesu Christe, fili dei vivi, qui mysterium tu\u230 \'e6 acerbissim\u230 \'e6 passionis beato Gregorio famulo tuo miserabiliter revelasti}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... predictas orationes devote dicentibus liberaliter sunt elargiti, qui vivis et regnas cum deo patre in unitate spiritus sancti deus pro omnia secula seculorum. Amen\plain \f0\fs24 , (55\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 Leo papa decimus (ad manum) adiunxit orationem tri pr\u230 \'e6dictas orationes iubeliatas approbando easdemque indulgentias supplicando, qu\u230 \'e6 usque adiuventum VIII\plain \f0\i\super\fs32 XX\plain \f0\i\fs24  quatuor milium annorum (fo) fidemque diezimum \plain \f0\fs24 [!]\plain \f0\i\fs24  ascendere noscimur\plain \f0\fs24 , (55\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24  bis 56\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24  oben) \plain \f0\i\fs24 10. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 O domine Iesu Christe, adoro te ad iudicium progredientem}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... corporis et anim\u230 \'e6. Nunc et in perpetuum. Amen\plain \f0\fs24 , (55\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 Sanctus Gregorius in honore sanctuum vulnerum Christi has transposuit salutationes dansque quingentos annorum indulgentiarum devote dicentibus\plain \f0\fs24 , (55\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -57\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 1. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Ave, manus dextra Christi}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... quod per dextram redemistitur. 2. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Ave, palma Iesu sena}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... quam produxit mater Eva\plain \f0\fs24 , (56\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 )\plain \f0\i\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Ave, vulnus dextri pedis}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... esto nobis spes mercedis. 4. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Ave, plaga crescant plant\u230 \'e6}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... consuere post et ante\plain \f0\fs24 , (56\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -57\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 )\plain \f0\i\fs24  5. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[7].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Ave, latus lanceatum}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... dominum nostrum Iesum Christum etc. \plain \f0\fs24 Chevalier, Repertorium, 1892-1921, Nr. 1869. Vgl. Haimerl, Gebetbuchliteratur, 1952, S. 80 (459), 92 (541), 124 (732),  (57\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -58\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) Rubrik abgeschnitten.\plain \f0\i\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[8].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Salve et tremendum cunctis potestatibus}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... per omnia secula seculorum. Amen\plain \f0\fs24 , (59\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -61\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 Sequitur oratio devotissima de omnibus beatissim\u230 \'e6 virginis Mari\u230 \'e6. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[9].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 O dulcissima regina mundi }}\plain \f0\i\fs24 ... - ... sine gravimine portare meruisti. Bis Ave Maria\plain \f0\fs24 , (59\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) Rubrik abgeschnitten. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[10].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 [Adoro te et benedico]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[10].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17  lilias candissimas}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... hominem dei filium concepisti. Ave Maria. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[11].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Adoro te et benedico nobilissimum cor}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... reverentissime et tractasti. Bis Ave Maria\plain \f0\fs24 , (60\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[12].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Adoro te et benedico magnam tuam}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... referens magnificat docentasti. Bis Ave Maria. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[13].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Adoro te et benedico labia tua melliflua}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... per oscula coniuxisti. Bis Ave Maria. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[14].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Adoro te et benedico mares tuas decentissimas}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... miram fragrantiam sensisti. Bis Ave Maria\plain \f0\fs24 , (61\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[15].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Adoro te et benedico os et (signam) tuam disertissimam}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... summ\u230 \'e6 sapienti\u230 \'e6 suscepisti. Bis Ave Maria\plain \f0\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[16].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Adoro te et benedico speciosissimos oculos}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... ex ipsis vulneris misericorditer intueri. Bis Ave Maria\plain \f0\fs24 , (61\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[17].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Adoro te et benedico animan tuam}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... in amenitate summ\u230 \'e6 beatitudinis recepisti. Bis Ave Maria. Finis\plain \f0\fs24 , (62\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -63\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) Rubrik teilweise abgeschnitten. [Oratio ad beatam Mariam virginem] \plain \f0\i\fs24 pro venia peccatorum impetranda. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[18].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Sanctissima et beatissima virgo Maria, dignis}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[18].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 [sima]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[18].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17  et incorupta genitrix}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... regnat deus per omnia secula seculorum. Amen\plain \f0\fs24 ,}

