\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 (85\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -103\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Septem psalmi poenitentiales}}\plain \f0\fs24 , (97\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -103\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Litanei}}\plain \f0\fs24 . R\u246 \'f6mischer Festkalender, (92\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -105\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Gebete}}\plain \f0\fs24 . 2. Hand, (92\plain \f0\super\fs32 rv\plain \f0\fs24 ) Rubrik abgeschnitten. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Domine Iesu Christe, suscipe preces mei peccatoris}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... regnabis in secula seculorum. Amen\plain \f0\fs24 , (92\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 Oratio benefactoribus. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Vincere, redemptor humani generis, qui tollis peccata mundi}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... qui vivis et regnas etc.\plain \f0\fs24 , (93\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) Rubrik abgeschnitten. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Domine Iesu Christe, ego miser peccator admoneo te}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... valeam omnibus diebus vit\u230 \'e6 me\u230 \'e6. Amen. Pater noster. Ave Maria\plain \f0\fs24 , (93\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -94\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) Rubrik teilweise abgeschnitten. \plain \f0\i\fs24 Oratio devotissima de (... martyris). {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Omnipotens sempiterne deus, conditor mundi, in hac die commendo tibi vitam et animam meam}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... Christus, tua dextera me famulum tuum benedicat. \u8224 \'86 \u8224 \'86 Amen \u8224 \'86. Iesus \u8224 \'86\plain \f0\fs24 . Vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Haimerl, Gebetbuchliteratur, 1952}}\plain \f0\fs24 , S. 91 (539), (100\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -105\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Birgitta Suecica}}\plain \f0\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[3].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 15 Gebete vom Leiden Jesu}}\plain \f0\fs24 . \plain \f0\i\fs24 Prima oratio. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 O Iesu Christe, \u230 \'e6terna dulcedo te amantium}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... te merear laudare cum omnibus sanctis tuis in \u230 \'e6ternum. Amen\plain \f0\fs24 , (100\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) Rubrik teilweise abgeschnitten. \plain \f0\i\fs24 Sequuntur 15 orationes ... de notissima mulieri, cum esset Rom\u230 \'e6 reclusa apud Sanctum Paulum, cum animum domini scire desiderasset, apparuit ei dominus dicens: Corporis mei vulnera, tot erant summa quinque millia quadringenta et octogintaqu\u230 \'e6. Si venia aliqua prosequi volueris, XV Pater noster et totidem Ave Maria dices quotidie per annum integrum. Sicque et devoluto anno unum, pro qu(o volumus) veritabiliter salutandis, mult\u230 \'e6 indulgenti\u230 \'e6 tribuuntur his, qui has sequantes orationes dixerunt:  Pater noster. Ave Maria dicuntur in principio omnium orationum\plain \f0\fs24 . Vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Haimerl, Gebetbuchliteratur, 1952}}\plain \f0\fs24 , S. 92 (545), }

