\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 (103\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -134\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Officium mortuorum}}\plain \f0\fs24 . Nach dem Gebrauch von Nantes. Vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Ottosen, Responsories, 2007}}\plain \f0\fs24 , S. 118 f. (R 14, 72, 24, 32, 57, 37, 68, 46, 38), (105\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -134\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Gebete}}\plain \f0\fs24 . 2. Hand, (105\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) Schluss der Rubrik am unteren Rand abgeschnitten. \plain \f0\i\fs24 Post istud Pater noster dic orationem sequentem. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Domine Iesu Christe, filii dei vivi, suscipe hanc orationem}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... et remissionem ...\plain \f0\fs24 , (106\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -127\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 Sequuntur orationes multum devot\u230 \'e6 cum gratiarum actiones de omnibus beneficiis adeo humano generi impensis, videlicet in opere nostre redemptionis.\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Domine deus meus, laudare te desydero}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... tibi gratias referamus per dominum nostrum Iesum Christum\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f0\i\fs24 filium unum, qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitate spiritus sancti deus per omnia secula seculorum. Amen. Iesus\plain \f0\fs24 . Vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Haimerl, Gebetbuchliteratur, 1952}}\plain \f0\fs24 , S. 92 (546), (127\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -129\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 Oratio devotissima ad honorem passionis domini nostri Iesu Christi et ad honorem beatissim\u230 \'e6 virginis Mari\u230 \'e6 ad obtinendum quodcumque licitum.\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Sanctissima Maria, perpetua virgo virginum, mater misericordi\u230 \'e6}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... omnium benefactorum meorum vivorum et mortuorum vitam sempiternam. Amen. Iesus\plain \f0\fs24 , (129\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 Oratio devotissima ad virginem Mariam et dicentibus Innocentius pappa multas concessit indulgentias et privilegia\plain \f0\fs24 , (130\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -131\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Clementissima domina et dulcissima virgo sancta Maria, mater dei}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... exaudi me, benignissima virgo (immaculata), mater dei misericordi\u230 \'e6. Amen. Iesus. Maria\plain \f0\fs24 , (132\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -133\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) Rubrik abgeschnitten. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Salve, imperatrix fortissima, anim\u230 \'e6 me\u230 \'e6 peccatricis spes tutissima}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... domini nostri Iesu Christi perpetue fuisse lucratum. Amen\plain \f0\fs24 , (133\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 Alia oratio ad omnes sanctos etc.\plain \f0\fs24 , (133\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -134\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Sancta Maria, mater misericordi\u230 \'e6 piissima, ora pro me ad dominum}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... ad vitam pervenire sempiternam. Amen\plain \f0\fs24 , (134\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 Oratio ante missam dicendam. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Deus, qui de indignis dignos, de inmundis mundos, de peccatoribus iustis facis}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... in unitate spiritui sancti deus per omnia secula seculorum. Amen\plain \f0\fs24 ,}

