\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 (7\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -17\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Landgraf Wilhelm IV. von Hessen-Kassel}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Brief}}\plain \f0\fs24  an {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Herzog Julius von Braunschweig-Wolfenb\u252 \'fcttel}}\plain \f0\fs24  (Kassel, 1579 X 11). Lateinisch und deutsch, (7\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -15\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 Aliam Epistolam Illustrissimi Landgraffii Wilhelmi ad Iulium Ducem Brunsviecnsem etc. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Fide post hoc scriptum, quod nunc sequitur. Theologorum Helveti\u230 \'e6 scriptum ad Illustrissimos Germani\u230 \'e6 Principes, qui Augustanam Confessionem profitentur. Ratisbon\u230 \'e6 in Comit(atu) 1576. Etsi veremur, illustrissimi Principes, ne quis nobis vitio versas, quod in hoc amplissimo}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... Satisfectis ecclesiis quietem et salutem. Beata Generatio qu\u230 \'e6rentium Veritatem et Pacem\plain \f0\fs24 , (15\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -17\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 Ad principem Iulium ducem Brunsvicense. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Freundlicher lieber Oheim, Schwager unndt Bruder }}\plain \f0\i\fs24 ... - ... Datum Cassel den 11. Octobris 1579. Wilhelm Landgraf tzu Hessen. \plain \f0\fs24 Zur  Erkl\u228 \'e4rung der Schweizer Theologen beim Reichstag von Regensburg (1576) vgl. Axel Gotthard, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Der\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Augsburger\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Religionsfrieden\plain \f0\fs24  (Reformationsgeschichtliche Studien und Texte 148), \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 M\u252 \'fcnster\plain \f0\fs24  2004, S. 352-355, 359, 375 f., 384 f.}

