\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Missa Sanctorum Apostolorum Ioannis et Pauli}}\plain \f1\fs24 . Anfang und Ende fehlen. Graduale (Stufengebet) untypisch. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Isti sunt due olive }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 [Sach 411]}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... dominus Petro tue corona\plain \f1\fs24 [...], Offertorium. Ps 5,12-13. Secreta. \plain \f1\i\fs24 Hostias tibi, domine, sanctorum martyrum tuorum Iohannis et Pauli  ... - ... provenire subsidium\plain \f1\fs24 . Communio. Weish 3-6. Postcommunio. \plain \f1\i\fs24 Sumpsimus, domine, sanctorum tuorum sollemnia celebrantes sacramenta celestia ... - ... gaudiis eternis consequamur. Per\plain \f1\fs24 . Missa in Vigilia sanctorum Petri et Pauli apostolorum. Introitus. \plain \f1\i\fs24 Dicit dominus Petro ... - ... opera manum eius annunciat firmamentum\plain \f1\fs24 . Oratio. Bricht ab \plain \f1\i\fs24 Presta, quesumus, omnipotens deus, ut nullis. \plain \f1\fs24 Beide\plain \f1\i\fs24  \plain \f1\fs24 nicht im Missale Romanum festgehalten, (1\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[3].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Missa Sancti Apollinaris Episcopi et Martyris}}\plain \f1\fs24 . Anfang und Ende fehlen. Gebete untypisch. Offertorium. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Deus, qui nos beati Apollinaris martyris tui}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... de eiusdem etiam protectione gaudeamus. Per.\plain \f1\fs24  Secreta. \plain \f1\i\fs24 Propiciare quesumus, domine, supplicacionibus nostris et interveniente sancto Apollinare ... - ... (placeat ... vivere).\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\fs24 Communio. Ps 88,36-38.\plain \f3\lang1033\fs36  \plain \f1\i\fs24 Semel iuravi in sancto meo ... - ... et testis in celo fidelis.\plain \f1\fs24  Postcommunio. \plain \f1\i\fs24 Hec nos communio, domine, purget a crimine, et, intercedente sancto \plain \f1\fs24 [Apollinare]. Vgl. Missale Romanum, 1960, S. 598 f.}

