\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Anselmus Cantuariensis}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 De libero arbitrio}}\plain \f0\fs24 . Ausschnitte, (1) 3. Spalte. Cap. 2-3. Beginnt \plain \f0\i\fs24 utitur \plain \f0\fs24 [potestate ...] \plain \f0\i\fs24 nulla res pot\plain \f0\fs24 [est] \plain \f0\i\fs24 illi dominari\plain \f0\fs24 , bricht ab \plain \f0\i\fs24 peccato se subdidissent\plain \f0\fs24 , (2) 1. Spalte. Cap. 3-4. Beginnt \plain \f0\i\fs24 efficere nec tamen absentibus\plain \f0\fs24 , bricht \plain \f0\i\fs24 ab absente re quae videri\plain \f0\fs24 , 2. Spalte. Cap. 4-5. Beginnt \plain \f0\i\fs24 nolens vult\plain \f0\fs24 , bricht ab \plain \f0\i\fs24 de illa namque loquimur qua\plain \f0\fs24 , (2) 3. Spalte. Cap. 5. Beginnt \plain \f0\i\fs24 hoc non nisi volens\plain \f0\fs24 , bricht \plain \f0\i\fs24 ex se aperte videtur habere\plain \f0\fs24 . (1) 1. Spalte. Cap. 5-6. Beginnt \plain \f0\i\fs24 cum dicitur, improprie dicitur\plain \f0\fs24 , bricht ab \plain \f0\i\fs24 ad quietem\plain \f0\fs24 , 2. Spalte. Cap. 6-7. Beginnt [p]\plain \f0\i\fs24 osse aliquid non nobis\plain \f0\fs24 , bricht ab \plain \f0\i\fs24 voluntatem, nisi quia magis.\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Sch\u246 \'f6nberger, Repertorium, 1994}}\plain \f0\fs24 , Nr. 11297-11300. Druck: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 MPL}}\plain \f0\fs24  158, Sp. 489-506. Ed.: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Schmitt, Opera omnia, 1984}}\plain \f0\fs24 , Bd. 1, S. 205-226.}

