\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 192\plain \f0\super\fs32 rv\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermones}}\plain \f0\fs24 . Beginnen ...\plain \f0\i\fs24 mini operantes non deficiamus et iterum qui non laborat, non manducet ... - ... qui ebrietatem diligit, siciet in eternum. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Vexillum regis venerabile cuncta regentis}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... studeamus adire supernam. >Sermo<. Prima ... conversatio aque in sanguine. Primum preceptum alienos deos nomen adorare ... - ... non cumcupisces ullam rem proximi. >Sermo<. Pater familias, qui operarios ad vineam conducit et denarii mercedem promittit, Christus est ... - ... qui una vita hora et laboraverunt. >Sermo<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Homo habens centum oves et relictis illis ovem perditam querit ac repertam humeris revelit, figuram Christi expressit}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... omnia, quecumque habet pater, propria possidet. Explicit. \plain \f0\fs24 193\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24  Notiz. Nachtragshand. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Sanctorum salvator omnium, qui non}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... qui credita, perveniat  sempiternam. Liber 1.\plain \f0\fs24  194\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24  Inhaltsverzeichnis des gesamten Bandes (zeigt Textverlust am Schluss desselben). Endet \plain \f0\i\fs24 Historia sancte Marie genitricis sancti salvatoris. LXVII. Transitus sancte dei genitricis. LXVIII. Gesta salvatoris domini nostri de eadem. LXX. De fuga VII mortalium vitiorum. LXXI. De cruce. LXXII. De preceptis. LXXIII. De exposicione evangelii. LXXIIII. De exposicione evangelii. LXXV.  }

