\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 23\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -187\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Johannes Krefting}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Reportatio}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs24 . \plain \f0\fs24 Nach Textbefund u\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 nvollst\u228 \'e4ndig, (23\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs32\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Titel. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Institutionum\plain \f0\i\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Iuris\plain \f0\i\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Civilis\plain \f0\i\fs24  illustria ac Iuris studiosis valde necessaria schola \plain \f0\fs24 [\u252 \'fcber gestr. \plain \f0\i\fs24 problemata\plain \f0\fs24 ] \plain \f0\i\fs24 in librum quartum dictata et tradita\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 sunt a Magistro Casparo Altenaick Coloniensi Iuris Prudenti\u230 \'e6 Professore et Collega in Inclito Gymnasio Bremensi novo auditorio publico. Anno a partu virginis et Nativitate Christi Domini nostri Salvatoris 1585 concepta a Joanne Crefftingo Bremensi privatis calamis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [...]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  publicis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , (24\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs32\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -76\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs32\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Beginnt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Annotata elegantissima in librum quartum Iustiniani Institutionum Iuris Civilis, a titulo de actio non incepta a Magistro Casparo Alteneick dictata anno 1585. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Varia sunt, que ius hoc Romanum ad usum politicum proponit}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . Bricht ab \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quam formam XL. Hic observa legem esse sequendam non consuetudinem atque consuetudinem, qui est qua legem. Et\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , (76\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs32\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -77\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs32\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) leer, (77\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs32\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -80\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs32\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Beginnt {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Est adhuc aliud hic nempe lite contestata etiam transit actio}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . Endet ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rem ratam haberi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , (81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs32\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -83\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs32\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) leer, (84\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs32\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -88\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs32\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De interdictis Titulus XV. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Dicturus est nunc imperato de interdictis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... - ... adversus quem sit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ad quid sit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , (88\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs32\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -89\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs32\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) leer, (89\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs32\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -97\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs32\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 De persecutione, cuius ac grand\u230 \'e6 retinenda et recuperanda}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... - ... et iustiti\u230 \'e6 huius vit\u230 \'e6 exornat. Verbum non attingimus ista prolixius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , (98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs32\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -100\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs32\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) leer, (100\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs32\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs32\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Nunc videamus de poena et de singularibus quibusdam in tante hoc crimine gravis in reum ... - ... E ne etiam ea res noceat expllicatio.Satis de primo hoc crimine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , (102\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs32\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -145\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs32\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) leer, (146\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs32\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -187\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs32\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De obligationibus, qu\u230 \'e6 ex delicto nascuntur. Titulus I. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Titulus ipse et principium tituli est generale}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ... - ... De ea re pluribus dixi ad flumen de nuptiis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , (187\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs32\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Kolophon. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Finis impositus anno domini 1586 die Zachari\u230 \'e6, qui erat 14. Martii}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \plain \f0\fs24 Druck der Vorlage: Caspar Altenaich, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Institutionum\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Iuris\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Civilis\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 observationes\plain \f0\fs24  et \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 explicationes, \plain \f0\fs24 Bremen 1587. Zu Altenaich vgl. Heinrich Wilhelm Rotermund, Lexikon aller Gelehrten, die seit der Reformation in Bremen gelebt haben, nebst Nachrichten von gebohrnen Bremern, die in andern L\u228 \'e4ndern Ehrenstellen bekleideten, Bremen 1818, S. 202.}

