\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 (41\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -50\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 , 53\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -68\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Gebete des Priesters}}\plain \f0\fs24 . H\u228 \'e4ufig Psalmen, (41\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -50\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) Mit Rubriken: Handwaschung, Anlegen der liturgischen Gew\u228 \'e4nder, Betreten des Altars, Austeilen der Hostie, (50\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -51\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) Nachtrag. Lateinisch. Anfang des Alphabets, F\u252 \'fcrbitte, (51\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -52\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) leer, (52\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) Nachtrag. \plain \f0\i\fs24 1537. Tugendt, das best. R B H\plain \f0\fs24 , (53\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -65\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) Vor der Messe, (53\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -60\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 Summe sacerdos et vere pontifex ... - ... neque sciam in eternum\plain \f0\fs24 , (61\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -62\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Oratio ante missam<. Conscientia trepidi, domine Ihesu Christe, accedo ... - ... Qui cum patre et sancto spiritu vivit et regnat (d.p.e.s.)\plain \f0\fs24 , (62\plain \f0\super\fs32 rv\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Oratio ante missam<. Domine, non sum dignus, ut intres sub tectum meum ... - ... valeam esse pudicus, sobrius, iustus et constans in consciencia bona et sermone nonesto et in opere tibi placenti. Qui vivis\plain \f0\fs24 , (63\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 Domine Ihesu Christe, fili dei vivi, da michi facinoroso ... - ... et preter te non est alius. Qui vivis\plain \f0\fs24 , (63\plain \f0\super\fs32 rv\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 Domine Ihesu Christe, fili dei vivi, te supplicissime et humillime deprecor ... - ... usque ad conspectum immensissime glorie et misericordie tue. Qui vivis\plain \f0\fs24 , (63\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -65\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Oratio ante missam<. Omnipotens et misericors deus, ecce, accedo ... - ... propono tandem revelata facie in te contemplari pereundi dominum\plain \f0\fs24 , (65\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -68\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) Nach der Messe. \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Oratio bona post missam dicenda<. Domine, deus meus, misericordia mea, remitte michi misero peccatori omnia peccata mea ... - ... revocare et purgandos  a purgatorio digneris liberare, pater misericordiarum, pro tua misericordia in eternum. Amen\plain \f0\fs24 , (69\plain \f0\super\fs32 rv\plain \f0\fs24 ) leer,}

