\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs24 3\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 -14\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermones quadragesimales}}\plain \f1\scaps\fs24 . \plain \f1\fs24 Tagesangaben rubriziert. Alle Sonntage der Fastenzeit einschlie\u223 \'dflich Ostern, (3\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 -4\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\fs24 >Dominica II\plain \f1\i\super\fs32 a \plain \f1\fs24 [!] \plain \f1\i\fs24 in X\plain \f1\i\super\fs32 a\plain \f1\i\fs24 L<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Et ecce mulier Cana}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 [nea].}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17  M. XV}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 [,22]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 . Ista mulier volens sanitatem}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... superbi inter superbos scientie spiritualiter conversacioni magna utriusque. Nota, quod talis humilitas multa bona facit. \plain \f1\fs24 Es folgt eine Glosse, (4\plain \f1\super\fs32 rv\plain \f1\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\fs24 >Dominica II\plain \f1\i\super\fs32 a\plain \f1\fs24  \plain \f1\i\fs24 in X\plain \f1\i\super\fs32 a\plain \f1\i\fs24 L<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Mulier Cana}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 [nea]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17  a finibus illis egressa clamavit dicens: Miserere mei }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 [Mt 15,22]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 . Beatus Paulus octavo die tempus presens commendavit}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... auro siciens, tu solus inde eris sufficiens\plain \f1\fs24 , (4\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 -5\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\fs24 >Dominica III\plain \f1\i\super\fs32 a\plain \f1\i\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Item Belchebub princeps eicit demonis in dei}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... Christi depravabant et principi demonum attribuabant ... - ... ne confessioni facere posset\plain \f1\fs24 , (6\plain \f1\super\fs32 rv\plain \f1\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\fs24 >Dominica 4\plain \f1\i\super\fs32 a\plain \f1\i\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Cum sublevasset oculos Ihesus etc. Io VI}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 [,5].}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17  Oculum sit sapientie et oculum nomine dei oculo sapientie}}\plain \f1\i\fs24 . Dicitur Eccl XXIIII\plain \f1\fs24 [,27]\plain \f1\i\fs24 : Omnia vidit oculos illius ... - ... quod nemo possit corrigere, quem ille despexerint\plain \f1\fs24 , (6\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 -7\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 ) Unter dem Text eine Glosse, (6\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 -7\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\fs24 >Item dominica 4\plain \f1\i\super\fs32 a\plain \f1\i\fs24  in X\plain \f1\i\super\fs32 a\plain \f1\i\fs24 L<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Est puer unus hic, qui habet quinque panes ordiacios et duos pisces. Io. VI}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\super\fs32\chcbpat17 o}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 [,9].}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17  Per hoc aliter videamus, qualiter evangelium bis legatur per animum}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... et solvit debitum\plain \f1\fs24 , (7\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 -8\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\fs24 >In passione dominica<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Ihesus autem abscondit se et exivit a templo }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 [Io 8,59]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 . Et dicit: Karissimi, qui, si domus dei imitans, sue potenciam exercere voluisset}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... abscondit me in abscondito tabernaculi sui\plain \f1\fs24 , (8\plain \f1\super\fs32 rv\plain \f1\fs24 ) Tagesangabe fehlt [Judica]. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Qui est ex deo, verbum dei audit. Io VIII}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 [,47]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 . Verbum dei vel potius verbum dei, quod non solum audire, sed etiam facere debemus}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... vide in sermone de sancto Petro benedictus deus etc., \plain \f1\fs24 (8\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 -9\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 ) Tagesangabe fehlt [Palmsonntag]. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[7].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Ecce, rex tuus venit }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[7].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 [Io 12,15]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[7].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17  tibi misericordia. Mea verba proposita scripta sunt in evangelio hodierno}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... in indicio amicis suis eos ad suum regnum ducendo\plain \f1\fs24 , (9\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 -11\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\fs24 >In ramis palmarum<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[8].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Plurima autem turba straverunt vestimenta sua in via }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[8].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 [Mt 21,8]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[8].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 . Hodie sancta mater duas processiones recolit}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... postmodum tam ignominose tractaverunt\plain \f1\fs24 , (11\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 -12\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\fs24 >In parasceve<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[9].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Clamans voce magna emisit spiritum }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[9].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 [Mt 27,50].}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[9].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17  Clamavit dominus in morte propter tria positio[nes] doloris}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... cum gaudentibus tribus etc. Amen\plain \f1\fs24 , (12\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 -13\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\fs24 >In vigilia pasce<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[10].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Fasciculus mirre dilectus est meus, intra ubera mea commorabitur. Botrus cypri dilectus meus mihi in vineis Engadi. Can Io}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[10].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 [12-13].}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[10].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17  Virgo beata in passionem Christi multam habet amaritudinem}}\plain \f1\fs24  \plain \f1\i\fs24 ... - ... et assecuti sunt consorcium angelorum. Amen\plain \f1\fs24 , (13\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 -14\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\fs24 >In  parasceve<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[11].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Sabaut non tamen a longa, Maria autem eum viderit, 4or rivos defluentes}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... mortuo non pepercit etc. Amen\plain \f1\fs24 , (14\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 ) Beginnt \plain \f1\i\fs24 >In vigilia pasce<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[12].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Maria Magdalena et altera Maria veniunt videre sepulturam. Mc. ultimo }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[12].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 [Mc 16,1]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[12].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 . Quando magna est integritas diei}}\plain \f1\fs24 , bricht ab\plain \f1\i\fs24  quod non debeat detineri a morte, habent rationem.}

