ficat ista impositio cineris. Ad primam videtur ammonere propheta}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... et ago penitenciam in ... et te etc.\plain \f1\fs24 , (24\plain \f1\super\fs32 rv\plain \f1\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\fs24 >In die cinerum sermo<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Convertimini ad me in toto corde vestro. Joel II}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 [,12].}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17  In hiis verbis prius et dulcis totus dulcitur et pie revocat peccatores et hortatur eos}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... non conversi futuris etc.\plain \f1\fs24 , ... , (88\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 -91\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\fs24 >In ascensione domini<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Ascendit Christus in altum. Captivam duxit captivitatem de dona hominibus }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 [Ps 67,19]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 . Karissimni, predie celebravit mater ecclesia de morte Christi gloriosum triumphum}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... in celesti patris, ad quod nos perducat Christus. Amen\plain \f1\fs24 , (91\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 -93\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\fs24 >In festo Pentecostes<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Spiritus domini replevit orbem terrarum. Sap I}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 [,7].}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17  Die pasce, dilectissimi, dominus ac redemptor noster Christus de hostibus devincta morte triumphavit}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... et exultant in rebus pessimis\plain \f1\fs24 , (93\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 -94\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\fs24  >In die penthecosten<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Emitte spiritum tuum etc. }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 [Ps 103,30]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 . In verbis istis David in persona ecclesie monet}}\plain \f1\fs24 , bricht ab \plain \f1\i\fs24 opera de genere bonorum faciat.}

