\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs24 95\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 -117\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermones quadragesimales}}\plain \f1\fs24 . Unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig. Perikopenangaben oft gestrichen. Anfang fehlt. Vom ersten Freitag der Fastenzeit bis Gr\u252 \'fcndonnerstag, (95\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 -97\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Convertimini ad me in tota te. Joel II}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 [,12]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 . De penitencia verba sunt  f.s. exhortantis nos ad penitencie susceptionem}}\plain \f1\fs24  \plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... et prius hanc vitam domino reddat acceptum\plain \f1\fs24 , (97\plain \f1\super\fs32 rv\plain \f1\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\fs24 >Feria VII\plain \f1\i\super\fs32 a\plain \f1\i\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Clama, ne cesses a tuba  exalta vocem nostram et anima populo meo scelare corpus. Psalmista }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 [58,1].}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17  Et sicut verba sunt scripta ad populum predictum}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... Letabitur iustis, cum viderit vindictam\plain \f1\fs24 , (97\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 -98\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\fs24 >Dominica prima in XL\plain \f1\i\super\fs32 a\plain \f1\i\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Dic, ut lapides isti panes fiant. Verba proposita sunt demonis filium temptatis. Mt 4}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 [,3].}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17  Legitur in evangelio, quod dominus a spiritu demonis in desertum est ductus}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... fecit voluntatem patris mei\plain \f1\fs24 , ... , (113\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 -114\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\fs24 >In cena domini<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Cum dilexisset suos dominus, filius dei Christus Ihesus ante mortem suam sciens omnia }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 [Io 13,1]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 . ... Sermones omni dilectione plenum ipsis relinquendo}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... ego sum mercis tue meritum. Ra. etc.\plain \f1\fs24 , (114\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 -116\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\fs24 >Dominica Corpore Christi<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Probet autem se ipsum homo, sic de pane illo edat et de calice bibat. Ia Corinthorum XI}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 [,28]. }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Gloria vero examinet et predicet apostolus. In verbis propositis hortatur nos ad dignam probationem}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... pacis eius in utero eius vertere in fel aspidum\plain \f1\fs24 , (116\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 -117\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\fs24 >De eodem<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Volenti digne coniunctate sex sunt necessaria. Item decet spiritus seu dominus}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... pro memoria eiusdem passionis\plain \f1\fs24 , (116\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 ) Marginalie der Haupthand. \plain \f1\i\fs24 Verczigest dich.}

