\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs24 117\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 -140\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermones de tempore}}\plain \f1\scaps\fs24 .\plain \f1\fs24  Tagesangaben rubriziert. Perikopenangaben oft gestrichen. Weihnachten, Mari\u228 \'e4 Verk\u252 \'fcndigung, Ostern (Schwerpunkt), Allerseelen, (117\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 -120\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Dabit dominus ipse vobis signum. Ec. V. usque eius. Ysa VII}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 [,14].}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17  In verbis istis circa Christi incarnacionem}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... et post hoc exilium ostendat nobis ipsum\plain \f1\fs24 , (120\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 -122\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\fs24 >In annuntiatione<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Cantate domino canticum novum, quia. Cantica canticarum. In regno suo eterno autem mirabilia fecit }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 [Ps 97,1]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 . Sic scriptum habemus in psalmo. Hac mirabilia}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... est benedictum in secula seculorum. Amen\plain \f1\fs24 , (122\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 -124\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\fs24 >In parasceve<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Inspice et fac secundum exemplar, qui tibi in monte monstratum est. Exodus XXV}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 [,40]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 . Christus est tamquam liber exemplaris, ad cuius exemplar tamen vitam nostram debemus deducere}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ...  - ... ut ab ipsis de carcere habeatis et ipsum sublimati beneficia valeant\plain \f1\fs24 , ... , (136\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 -137\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\fs24 >De apparitionibus. In die pasce<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Notandum, quod ipsa die ressurectionis V vicibus apparuit dominus et aliis diebus sequentibus aliis V vicibus}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... quamvis adhunc ista municaret\plain \f1\fs24 , (137\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 -138\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\fs24 >Feria secunda in festo pasche<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Tu solus peregrinus es in Ierusalem etc. Lucas ultimo }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 [24,18]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 . Quamvis dominus propria in persona venisset}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... in dyademam levate signum etc.\plain \f1\fs24 , (138\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 -140\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\fs24  >Feria III\plain \f1\i\super\fs32 a\plain \f1\i\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Venit Ihesus et stetit in medio discipulorum et dixit: Pax vobis. Lucas ultimo }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 [recte Io 20,19 non Lc 24,36]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 . Dupliciter modum nos Ihesus in verbis istis}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... pacem peccatorum videns\plain \f1\fs24 .}

