\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs24 141\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 -190\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermones de tempore et de sanctis}}\plain \f1\scaps\fs24 . \plain \f1\fs24 Festangaben rubriziert. Reihenfolge gem\u228 \'e4\u223 \'df Kirchenjahr: Lucia, Thomas, Johannes der Evangelist, Agnes, Mari\u228 \'e4 Lichtmess, Agatha, Matthias, Mari\u228 \'e4 Verk\u252 \'fcndigung, Georg, Philipp und Jakob, Johannes an der lateinischen Pforte, Johannes der T\u228 \'e4ufer, Petrus, Dreifaltigkeit, Margarete, Maria Magdalena, Mari\u228 \'e4 Himmerlfahrt, Bartholom\u228 \'e4us, Mari\u228 \'e4 Geburt, Matthias, Franz, Dionysius, Allerheiligen, Allerseelen, Martin, Elisabeth, C\u228 \'e4cilia, Katharina von Alexandria, Clemens I., Clemens von Alexandria?, Katharina von Siena?, (141\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 -142\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\fs24 >De sancta Lucia sermo<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Vidit dominus lucem, quod esset bona. Genesis}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 [1,31].}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17  In verbo isto Lucia tripliciter commendatur}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... approximavit, quam videndo clara et sana et immortalis est, ad quam etc.\plain \f1\fs24 , (142\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 -143\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\fs24 >De sancto Thoma sermo<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Mitte manum tuam in latus meum etc. }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 [Io 20,24].}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17  Duo nota in libro isto sunt signa}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... Ista, si didicerimus et fecerimus eum ipso in celo in eternum erimus. Amen\plain \f1\fs24 , (143\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 -145\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\fs24 >De sancto Iohanne evangelista sermo<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Venerat dilectis meus in ortum suum}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17  [Hld 6,1]}}\plain \f1\i\fs24   ... - ... et in orto celi, qui omnia patenti incipienti\plain \f1\fs24 , (145\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 -147\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\fs24 >De sancta Agnete<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Venerunt nuptie agere et uxor agnum preparavit}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... ut fecundentur et sit de aliis\plain \f1\fs24  ... , (170\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 -171\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 ) Im September aufgef\u252 \'fchrt. \plain \f1\i\fs24 >De Matheo sermo et apostolo \plain \f1\fs24 [nachgestellt !]\plain \f1\i\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Cum transiret Ihesus, vidit hominem sedentem}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17  [Mt 9,9]}}\plain \f1\fs24  \plain \f1\i\fs24 ... - ... quod beati misericordes etc.\plain \f1\fs24 , ... , (186\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 -187\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\fs24 >De Clemente<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Vidi similem filio hominis habentem coronam in capite suo}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17  [Offb 14,14]}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... hanc tripliciter coronam habet homo sanctus Clemens, ad quam etc.\plain \f1\fs24 , (187\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 -189\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\fs24  >De sancto Clemente sermo<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Item mari via tua usque non cognoscentur }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 [Ps 76,20].}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17  Previdens David, quod beatus Clemens debuit in mari mergi}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  ... - ... qui impedit, ne in mari ambulemus et mare transeamus et sit de augustis, \plain \f1\fs24 (188\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 -189\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 ) Glosse,\plain \f1\i\fs24  \plain \f1\fs24 (189\plain \f1\super\fs32 r\plain \f1\fs24 -190\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\fs24 >Sancte Katherine sermo<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[7].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Dominus omnium dilexit dominam sapientam. VII. Verbarum }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[7].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 [recte Weish 8,3].}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[7].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\fs24\chcbpat17  Licet de sapientia dicatur increata}}\plain \f1\i\fs24  .... - ...\plain \f1\fs24  \plain \f1\i\fs24 et quod eam multipliciter laudavit et honoravit tam in vita quam in morte et per mortem\plain \f1\fs24 , (190\plain \f1\super\fs32 v\plain \f1\fs24 ) Glosse.}

