\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 182\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -187\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Tractatus de poena inferni et de gloria coelesti}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs24 .\plain \f0\fs24  Titel in der Kopfzeile und Kapitel\u252 \'fcberschriften rubriziert. \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Incipit aliud tractatus de pena inferni et de gloria celesti collectus ex secunda parte vite Cristi. Et primo de pena inferni<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Finale vobis iudicium secutur pene inferni et gloria celesti. De pena infernali est sciendum}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... ad te deum et dominum meum perveniantur. Amen\plain \f0\fs24 , (183\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Sequitur de gloria celesti<. Postremo de gloria celi sciendum est.\plain \f0\fs24  Abweichend: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Iohannis de Caulibus}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Meditationes vitae Christi}}\plain \f0\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Zumkeller, 1966}}\plain \f0\fs24 , Nr. 692. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Distelbrink, Bonaventurae scripta, 1975}}\plain \f0\fs24 , Nr. 166. Ed.: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[3].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 CCCM}}\plain \f0\fs24  153.}

