\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 188\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -192a\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Exempel und Notizen}}\plain \f0\fs24 , (188\plain \f0\super\fs32 rv\plain \f0\fs24 )\plain \f0\i\fs24  >Incipit hystoria pulchra valde sufficiens<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Rex quidam dives, multum nobilis et potens dictus est Winnenberg}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... et promisit ei in futuro duplicia meliora et multa alia\plain \f0\fs24 , (188\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -191\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >In hoc exemplo sub (similitudine) moraliter et magna doctrina et consolacio omnibus<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Iste rex est deus, rex regum et dominus dominantium, princeps principum, qui dictus est de Zwinenberg}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... et sibi omne delictum misericorditer relaxatur, quorum nobis prestare dignatur\plain \f0\fs24 , (190\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Duodecim fructus corporis Christi<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Primus fructus est, quod homo non minuitur in temporalibus}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... wir werden vereinigt werden mit got als d\u255 \'ff koenec in d\u255 \'ff hostia sic et nos etc.\plain \f0\fs24 , (191\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 )  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Nota de timore dei scriptum est}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... Qui ergo istud custodire potest, sufficit ei ad salutem. >Amen<\plain \f0\fs24 , (192\plain \f0\super\fs32 rv\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Collacio de omnibus sanctis<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Gloria hec est omnibus sanctis eius }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 [Ps 149,9]. }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Parentes reverendi nec non et (sorores) etc. Nota, quod duplici devotione}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... innocentes in iniquitate genitos in veritate respirantes\plain \f0\fs24 , (192a\plain \f0\super\fs32 rv\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Sciendum, quod ad civitatem dei acquirendam et conquirendam tamen sunt necessaria}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... et nolite iudicare secundum faciem, si non secundum faciem unius, autem secundum cor licet.}

