<\plain \f0\fs24 , (199\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -200\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >De contricione<\plain \f0\fs24 , (200\plain \f0\super\fs32 rv\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >De hiis, qui reciduant<\plain \f0\fs24 , (200\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >De festo<\plain \f0\fs24 , (200\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -201\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >De satisfactione<\plain \f0\fs24 , (201\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 )\plain \f0\i\fs24  >De oracione<\plain \f0\fs24 , (201\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >De ieiunio<\plain \f0\fs24 , (201\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >De eleemosinariis<\plain \f0\fs24 , (201\plain \f0\super\fs32 rv\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >De temptacione<\plain \f0\fs24 , (201\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >De virginitate<\plain \f0\fs24 , (201\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >De continencia et castitate<\plain \f0\fs24 , (201\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -202\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >De mundicia cordis<\plain \f0\fs24 , (202\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >De beatitudine<\plain \f0\fs24 , (202\plain \f0\super\fs32 rv\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >De humilitate<\plain \f0\fs24 , (202\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -203\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >De paupertate<\plain \f0\fs24 , (203\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >De disciplina<\plain \f0\fs24 , (203\plain \f0\super\fs32 rv\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >De correctione<\plain \f0\fs24 . 204\plain \f0\super\fs32 rv\plain \f0\fs24  leer.}

