\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 205\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -208\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo}}\plain \f0\fs24 . \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Nota, quam utile sit sermo dei passionem Christi iugiter habere in misero<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Quam utile sit passionem Christi iugiter habere}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... sana et re integra peccatorum meorum vincera. Amen. Deo gratias\plain \f0\fs24 , (208\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 )\plain \f0\i\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Ex materia ista ego frater Paulus Moerich ordinis predicatorum filius conventus Wienensis excerpsi collacionem, quam feci deo cooperante festo purificationis in Columbaria, anno 4o conversationis mee, anno vero domini M}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\super\fs32\chcbpat17 o}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 CCCC 3}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\super\fs32\chcbpat17 o}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 8 }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 [Colmar, 1438 II 2]. }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Leva oculos tuos ad orientem et vide, quatenus demonstrantur. Thema ad proscriptum}}\plain \f0\i\fs24 . \plain \f0\fs24 Vorlage f\u252 \'fcr die Inkunabel GW M29659 wegen gleichnamigem Auftraggeber und \u252 \'fcbereinstimmendem Thema (Leiden Christi)? Zu Moerich als Auftraggeber vgl. Piero Scapecchi, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Subiaco 1465 oppure [Bondeno 1463]? Analisi del frammento Parsons-Scheide, \plain \f0\fs24 La Bibliofilia 103 (2001) S. 1-24. }

