\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 209\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -221\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Briefformeln und Redefiguren}}\plain \f0\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Fidelissimo socio dictionis fidelitatis}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... gaudetur et leticia ac honore perpetua. Amen\plain \f0\fs24 , (213\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -216\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 Ut scias loqui ordinate et devote, qui predicator es ... - ... amare paupertatem et humilitatem\plain \f0\fs24 , (216\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 Venerabili in Christo patri ac domino ... - ... feliciter accepturos (...) et vestre dig(nitatis)\plain \f0\fs24 , (217\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -219\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 In Ihesu omni salvacione acceptabili cum salutatione ... - ... non ideo trib\plain \f0\fs24 [u]\plain \f0\i\fs24 etur firmitas (vester) etc.\plain \f0\fs24 , (220\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -221\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 Hic  quo lux est et dux, quem crux drux scripta peremit. Qui Arentos gentes flentes sua peccata ... - ... Datum Columbarii anno domini M\plain \f0\i\super\fs32 o\plain \f0\i\fs24 CCCC\plain \f0\i\super\fs32 o\plain \f0\i\fs24 XXXVIII kal. octobris in octava Augustini \plain \f0\fs24 [Colmar, 1438 X 1]\plain \f0\i\fs24 . Orate pro me. Confrater Paulus Mo\plain \f0\i\super\fs32 e\plain \f0\i\fs24 rich de patrum ordinis predicatorum karissimus frater et sodalis vester in domino Iesu Christo.}

