\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 221\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -223\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Decretum Synodi Basiliensis}}\plain \f0\fs24 . In controversiis inter sacerdotes ecclesiarum parrochialium et religiosos mendicantes. \plain \f0\i\fs24 Sacrosancta synodus Basilensis in spiritu sancto segregata. Ad perpetua rei memoriam. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Frequentes querela quorundam nostrorum et curatorum ecclesiarum}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... ad honorandum et frequentandum dictas civitates, prout sanxerios canonice reciperunt et inducunt\plain \f0\fs24 . Vgl. Johannes Helmrath, Das Basler Konzil 1431-1449. Forschungsstand und Probleme (K\u246 \'f6lner Historische Abhandlungen 32), K\u246 \'f6ln, Wien 1987, S. 123-125. 224\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -226\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24  leer. }

