\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 244\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -246\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo}}\plain \f0\fs24 .\plain \f0\i\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Adolescens, tibi dico surgere. Luca VIIo 14. Adolescens mortuus signat peccatorem culpe mortali subiacentem}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... qui pro nobis, fratres, est obediens patri usque ad mortem. \plain \f0\fs24 247\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -256\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermones}}\plain \f0\fs24 . Anfang fehlt, (247\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f0\fs24 -250\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) Beginnt \plain \f0\i\fs24 Seraphim\plain \f0\fs24 , endet \plain \f0\i\fs24 malos institutum. Amen\plain \f0\fs24 , (250\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -251\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Ecce, ancilla domini. Luc. 1}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 [,38]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 . Quid sibi vult, quod domicella Nazarea}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... cum magna proprius eterna pro(po)sitorum sunt et seipsum cum filio in eternum. Amen\plain \f0\fs24 , (251\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -253\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 )\plain \f0\i\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Nota quadriplicem effectum}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... abscondita et ab oculis meis\plain \f0\fs24 , (253\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -254\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Ascendit in arborem sytomorum. Luc}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 [19,4].}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17  Legitur hic in omni festo dedicationis desidero}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... iustum dedunt domus\plain \f0\fs24 , (254\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -256\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Miserere mei, deus }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 [Ps 50,3].}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17  Septem sunt defectus impellentes hominem}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... per gratiam suam pater hominum Christus Ihesus\plain \f0\fs24 , (256\plain \f0\super\fs32 rv\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Nota, quod omnes, qui homines in hoc mundo}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... si homo non haberet salutem. Gebith schon.}

