\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 1\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -110\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermones de tempore}}\plain \f0\fs24 . Alphabetisch sortiert. \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Sunt hic collecta libro vulgalia multa ex alphabetico distincte scripta, tenta scilicet positum tytulo, quibus est proprio<\plain \f0\fs24 , (1\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -2\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 )\plain \f0\i\fs24  >De abstinentia<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Multiplex est abstinentia detestabilis, ut in ypocritis}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... de mala societate\plain \f0\fs24 , (2\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >De adulacione<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Adulator est mit(rox) dyaboli lactans peccatores}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... sermonibus loquor pro Christo suo expandit (rethe) pedibus suis\plain \f0\fs24 , (2\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -3\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 )\plain \f0\i\fs24  >De ambicione<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 (Advertit) hominem et tenet in periculoso statu}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... ut unus memoriatur pro populo\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f0\i\fs24 etc. M\plain \f0\i\super\fs32 t\plain \f0\fs24 , ... - ...,  (103\plain \f0\super\fs32 rv\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >De veritate<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17  Solvet distingui tripliciter veritas, oris, cordis et operis}}\plain \f0\i\fs24 ... - ... ut habendetis (misericordiam)\plain \f0\fs24 , (103\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -104\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >De videndo<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Debemus videre primo dominum. Ps}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 [131,10].}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17  Respice in faciem Christi tui }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 [Ps 83,10]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 . Io. I}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 .}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17  Domine, volumus Ihesum videre }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 [Io 12.21]}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... facie ad faciem etc.\plain \f0\fs24 , (104\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -105\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >De vita eterna<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Sicut dicit Augustinus: Beata vita et eterna est id, quod hominibus optimum est habetur et amatur}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... dignetur, qui vivit et regnat pro omni secula seculorum. Amen\plain \f0\fs24 ,\plain \f0\i\fs24  \plain \f0\fs24 (105\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -109\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) Sanctorale von Andreas bis Martin. \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Incipiunt adapciones omnium sermonum<. Incipiunt adapciones omnium sermonum in hoc libello contentorum, prout competunt sabbatis, dominicis et festis totius anni et postea de sanctis. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 In sabbato ad vesperas. Benedictus dominus}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... qui in domino moriuntur ... de morte. Apo. XIIII\plain \f0\fs24 [,13]\plain \f0\i\fs24 . Martini ... vel temptacio, sed vita ... temptacione Iob. VIII\plain \f0\fs24 , (109\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -110\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) Inhaltsverzeichnis. Alphabetisch, auf Lagensignaturen bezogen. \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Incipiunt< capitula totius libri secundum ordinem alphabeticum. De abstinencia ... - ... De vita eterna. \plain \f0\fs24 [XX]\plain \f0\i\fs24 VII. f. Expliciunt capitula horum sermonum. \plain \f0\fs24 Parallelhs.: StStdtB Augsburg: 2\plain \f0\super\fs32 o\plain \f0\fs24  Cod. 30.}

