\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 2\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -6\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 , 33\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -34\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Urbanus VI papa}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Bulla promulgationis}}\plain \f0\fs24 . [U]\plain \f0\i\fs24 rbanus episcopus servus servorum dei. Ad perpetuam rei memoriam. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Hiis que pro divini cultum}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... in dicto monasterio perpetuis temporibus observetis et in nullo penitus violentis. Tenor autem dictarum constitucionum talis est (...) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Datum Rome in Trasteverim apud sanctam Ceciliam}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  sub anno dominice incarnacionis Millesimo CCC LXXIX, tercia die mensis decembris, II indictione, pontificatus sanctissimi in Christo patris et domini nostri, domini Urbani, divina providencia pape sexti\plain \f0\fs24 ,\plain \f0\i\fs24  anno primo. Et ego Iohannes ... - ... Datum Rome apud sanctam Mariam in Trasterverim III non. decembris, pontificatus nostri anno primo\plain \f0\fs24  [Trastevere, 1379 statt 1378 XII 3]. \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Excipit regula sancti Salvatoris cum bulla<. \plain \f0\fs24 Edd.: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 AA SS}}\plain \f0\fs24  52, S. 466 f.; Liber privilegiorum monasterii Vazstenensis, ed. Ernst Nygren (Corpus Codicum Suecicorum Medii Aevi 11), Kopenhagen 1950, fol. 42r-51v. Vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Nyberg, Klostergr\u252 \'fcndungen, 1965}}\plain \f0\fs24 , S. 43-59, 
