\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 6\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -33\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Birgitta Suecica}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Regula sancti Salvatoris}}\plain \f0\fs24 . \u931 S-Text. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Hec sunt constituciones, quas sancte memorie domina Brigitta de regno Swecie statuit}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  et ordinavit per abbatissam et moniales et fratres confessores earum in monasterio sancte Marie Watzsteno Lyncopensis dioecesis. >De humilitate et castitate et promptitate. Primum capitulum<. Principum itaque, huius religionis ... - ... in cordibus suis, quod terra sunt et in terram revertentur. \plain \f0\fs24 Ed.: Sancta Birgitta, Opera minora, ed. Sten Eklund, Bd. 1 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (\plain \f0\fs24 Svenska Fornskrift-S\u228 \'e4llskapet: Ser. 2, Latinska skrifter \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 8/1)\plain \f0\fs24 , Stockholm 1975, S. 10-16 (ohne diese Hs.), 146-173. Zur Textgeschichte vgl. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Den\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 heliga\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Birgittas\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Reuelaciones\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 extrauagantes,\plain \f0\fs24  ed. Lennart Hollman (Svenska Fornskrift-S\u228 \'e4llskapet: Ser. 2, Latinska skrifter 5), Uppsala 1965, S. 63-85.}

