\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 47\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -79\plain \f0\super\fs32 v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Petrus Olafsson de Alvastra}}\plain \f0\fs24 :\plain \f0\super\fs32  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Additiones ad regulam s. Salvatoris}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs24 . \plain \f0\fs24 60 Kapitel, \u220 \'dcberschriften rubriziert. \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Incipiunt addiciones domini Petri prioris ad regulam sancti Salvatoris. Et primo de gradibus seu signis vere humilitatis. Capitulum primum<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Humilitas vera est timere deum}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... Sorores sepeliantur in ambitibus et in ecclesia inferiora, creatos ymmo etiam in ipsa ecclesia et similiter fratres. Expliciunt addiciones<. \plain \f0\fs24 Lat. Fassung der Additiones.}

