\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 79\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -86\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Birgitta Suecica}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Revelationes pertinentes ad statuta}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs24 . \plain \f0\fs24 Capitula 10 (recensio 2), 22 f., 13, 15, 21, 20, 33.\plain \f0\scaps\fs24  \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Sequuntur revelaciones pertinentes ad statuta. Primo de organis non habendis. Revelatio prima<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Christus loquitur: Filii Israhel, quia carnales erant, multa habebant}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... in manu abbatisse permittere in temporalibus et confessori in spiritualibus. >Expliciunt revelaciones filii dei super addiciones permissas<. \plain \f0\fs24 Ed.: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Den\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 heliga\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Birgittas\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Reuelaciones\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 extrauagantes, ed.\plain \f0\fs24  Lennart Hollman (Svenska Fornskrift-S\u228 \'e4llskapet: Ser. 2: Latinska skrifter 5), Uppsala 1965, S. 123, 132 f., 125, 127, 131 f., 131, 147 f. }

