\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 87\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -114\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Decretum capituli generalis in Vadstinensi}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs24 , \plain \f0\fs24 (87\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -109\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Sequitur institucio seu constitucio super Ave Maris stella cantandi omni die post vesperas<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Filius dei loquebatur sponse existenti in monasterio Uwastereri}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... Tenor literarum apostolicarum, de quibus fit mentio supra, sequitur in huius modum\plain \f0\fs24 , (109\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -114\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Martinus Papa V}}\plain \f0\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Breve}}\plain \f0\fs24 . \plain \f0\i\fs24 Martinus episcopus, servus servorum dei. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Dilectis filiis de Watzsteno}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... Datum Rome apud Sanctos Apostolos X kal. augusti pontificatus nostri anno primo \plain \f0\fs24 [Rom, 1418 VII 23] ... \plain \f0\i\fs24 Datum et actum Watzstenis anno, die (Nicese), hora, loco, indictione pontificatus supradictis presentibus ibidem honorabilibus et circumspectis viris dominis Petro Holmstain Lyncopiensi et Sirengenensi, Benedicto Laurencii et Laurentio Michaeli Vexionensi ecclesiarum canonicis testibus ad premissa vocatis spiritualiter et rogatis. Et ego Laurentius firmandi etc.\plain \f0\fs24  Bestimmungen am Rand numeriert. Ed.: Nygren, Liber privilegiorum, 1950. Nicht in: Svenskt diplomatarium fr\u229 \'e5n och med \u229 \'e5r 1401, Bd. 4, ed. Carl Silfverstolpe / Karl Henrik Karlsson, Stockholm 1902-1904.\plain \f0\b\fs24  \plain \f0\fs24 Vgl. Torvald H\u246 \'f6jer, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Studier\plain \f0\fs24  i \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Vadstena\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 klosters\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 och\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Birgittinordens\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 historia\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 intill\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 midten\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 af\plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1400-talet, Upsala\plain \f0\fs24  1905, S. 175-180, 189 (Erw\u228 \'e4hnung einer \u228 \'e4hnlichen Bulle von 1427 VII 23). Bisher nicht zug\u228 \'e4nglich: Ina Friedlaender, Vadstena kloster och dess gynnare 1416-1419, Kyrkohistorisk \u197 \'c5rsskrift 63 (1963), S. 86-144, bes. S. 104-111.}

