\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 114\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -139\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Consuetudines Vadstinenses et declarationes dubiorum}}\plain \f0\fs24 . \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Sequuntur consuetudines Wazstenenses et decla\plain \f0\fs24 [racion]\plain \f0\i\fs24 es aliquorum dubiorum. Et primo de officio generalis confessoris, deinde de ceteris officialibus et eorum officiis etc.< >De officio confessoris generalis etc.<\plain \f0\fs24 , (114\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -122\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) Capitula 1-4.\plain \f0\i\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Confessor sit prudens et maturus}}\plain \f0\i\fs24 ... - ... super hanc familiam tuam etc. sunt conclusione\plain \f0\fs24 , (122\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 -139\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) Am Rand nummeriert. \plain \f0\i\fs24 >Sequuntur declaraciones dubiorum, pro quorum certitudine investiganda. Primo queritur<.{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17  Qualiter agatur per fratres solempnitas}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... per presentes perpetua duratura. In cuius rei testimonium. Datum VIII\plain \f0\i\super\fs32 o\plain \f0\i\fs24  die mensis novembris anno domini M\plain \f0\i\super\fs32 o\plain \f0\i\fs24  CCCC\plain \f0\i\super\fs32 o\plain \f0\i\fs24  XX\plain \f0\i\super\fs32 o\plain \f0\i\fs24  \plain \f0\fs24 [1420 XI 8].\plain \f0\i\fs24  \plain \f0\fs24 64 Erkl\u228 \'e4rungen. Vgl. Liber usuum fratrum monasterii Vadstenensis. The Customary of the Vadstena Brothers, ed. Sara Risberg (Studia Latina Stockholmiensia 50), Stockholm 2003, S. 54-56 (weitere Hs.).}

