\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24 139\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -141\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Notizen}}\plain \f0\fs24 , (139\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -140\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[4].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 De culpis}}\plain \f0\fs24 . \plain \f0\i\fs24 De culpis, que committuntur in monasterio, et de penis pro eis infligendis et primo de levioribus culpis. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Levis culpa est, si quis - ut signum datum fuit - non derelictis omnibus ad ecclesiam ordinate venerit}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... dum habitus canonice religionis despicitur in dignis. Deo gracias. \plain \f0\fs24 Ed.: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De culpis, \plain \f0\fs24 ed. Christer Henriks\u233 \'e9n (\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Seminarium Latinum Upsaliense 1\plain \f0\fs24 ), \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Uppsala\plain \f0\fs24  1990, (140\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Revelatio sanctae Birgittae}}\plain \f0\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Cantus sit modestus}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... et devotione plenus\plain \f0\fs24 , (140\plain \f0\super\fs32 v\plain \f0\fs24 -141\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 Ps.-Bernardus Claraevallensis}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[3].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 De cantu psalmodiae}}\plain \f0\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Venerabilis pater Bernhardus Clarevallis abbas precepit}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... neglecto eo, quid debes obtinere\plain \f0\fs24 , (141\plain \f0\super\fs32 r\plain \f0\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs24\chcbpat17 De cantu chori}}\plain \f0\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs24\chcbpat17 Vox est grata chori, si mens bene consonat ori}}\plain \f0\i\fs24  ... - ... se sacrinat ille. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs24\chcbpat17 Walther, Proverbia, 1963-1986}}\plain \f0\fs24 , Nr. 34714.}

